<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NUM" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Gaalu Sɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Gaalu Sɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Gaalu Sɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="toc3">GlS</para>
  <para style="mt1">Gaalu Sɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">Kona ʋuunaanigɔi (40) niiti Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti ti kɛɛni siɛi ɠa teʋebai zu, aisa ti ʋa zeeli minazeɠe zooi ma, é ga Kanaan yooi, fai niiti kpein ti ziɛni, naa ɠa Gaalu Sɛʋɛi suɠulazu. Sɛʋɛi laasei pɛɛʋɛ ga Gaalu Sɛʋɛi tɔɔzei, ada felegɔ ɠa su, ti zunuiti tiegɔi lɛɛzu Izilayɛle wolodamai ɠilagilagi pɛ su, niiti ti kɔɔmaʋɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 1:1-54">1:1-54</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 26:1-65">26:1-65</ref></char>). Faaɠwɛ nu wolai tanigaa ti laaʋɛ da ga GALA goo wo nui Moize ɠa é Minazeɠe Pɔlɔmai ma zɛʋɛ lɔɔlugɔ mɔungiti sɛʋɛa, Gaalu Sɛʋɛi ta zɔiti (Zenɛze, Ɛgezɔde, naa ʋɛɛ Levi Nuiti Ta-Zɛʋɛi ʋa, ta Tɔ Sɛʋɛi Velesiɛi). Naa ɠulaʋɛ kɛlɛma sɛʋɛi nii ɓɔɠɔi zu, tɔɔzei Gaalu Sɛʋɛi nii woo lɔɔzeiʋɛ ga é ɠɛ ma GALA ge niima wooiti boni Moize ma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 1:1">1:1</ref></char>). Toɠa zoo ɠɛɛzu ga gaama ɓalaa ga Moize sɛʋɛi bɔɔlɔzuʋɛ zɛʋɛni, kɛlɛ sɛʋɛ ɠɛ nuiti ti ta ʋɛɛ ba, ná ʋolu ʋelei poun. Naama ʋoogi ɠa ga nii, gola ɓaaʋɛ nu ʋa ɠisiɛ ga Moize a la zoo é tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ná-ɓɔɠɔmaayeii maamusɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 12:3">12:3</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɠɛai ma siɛi laawu teʋebai zu, ti kpee mɔinmɔin tooni ga GALA daalɔɠɔ, ti ɗa ɓaka daalɔɠɔma, tama ti naama ɓakɔi zɔlɔɔni ga gooɠaaʋotegi. Naama ʋoogi ta ɠa ga nii, siɛgi zu Izilayɛle nuiti ti luani la, ti kpee loo GALA daalɔɠɔma ga Kanaan nuɓusɛiti sɛbɛi wola wɔɔlɔʋɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 14:1-4">14:1-4</ref></char>). Naa maaʋele ma, GALA ge ɠɛni ma, naama yeeɠɛɠalai zu ɠɛɠalama ɠila ɲɛgɛlɛin kpakologiti saama, ta zaazu pɛ, Izilayɛle nuiti ti ʋa lɛ minazeɠe zooi zu. Moize ɓɔɠɔi kololalai ɠɛɛni ga GALA, tama zobo ge la mɔ ɠɛni veeni bɛ, é ʋa lɛ minazeɠe zooi zu. Tama anɛɛ ni nuɓusɛi ɠɛni ɓakasu, GALA ge ɠɛni ba nɔ, é ɗa ɓaa ti maazu. Siɛgi zu Izilayɛle zili nuiti ti GALA kwɛɛtala ɠala goo wo nui ta zeɠeni la, nii daa ɠɛni ga Ɓalaame, ga é Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti foovo, aisa naa mu ge ʋa ɠɛ, GALA ge vaani bu ga tɔun é ɗa tuya wooiti nɔ wo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 22:1-24:25">22:1—24:25</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Fai tanigaa wogɛ é lo Izilayɛle nuiti gaalu fai ʋa, naa ʋɛɛ ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ ɓɛtɛ vai ʋa, ta zalaɠa ɠula nuiti tosuʋɛ, naa ʋɛɛ vebɛ aniiti ba, niiti bolodai ɠilagilagi maanɛɛni, é ʋa la zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ laalao fai zu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 1:1-10:10">1:1—10:10</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Izilayɛle ná-siɛi é boni teʋebai zu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 10:11-25:19">10:11—25:19</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Gaalugi velesiɛi wo fai, ta devei taɠiligaa ti veeni é lo Izilayɛle nuiti ba. Naa ʋolu adaʋɛ tanigaa laasei bogɛ, ʋɛti Izilayɛle nuiti ti ti-ʋuuzuʋɛti toni ná, ti ɠɛai ma liizu ga minazeɠe zooi ʋɔ pelei, faa wogɛ ɓalaa é lo zooi naa ɠaaɠwɛ ʋelei ʋa bolodamaiti zɔɠɔzu niiti ti ʋaazu lɛɛzu zooi zu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 26:1-36:13">26:1—36:13</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NUM 1"/>
  <para style="ms1">Izilayɛle Nuiti Kɛai Ma <optbreak/> Sinayi Teʋebai Zu</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="NUM 1:1-10:10">1:1—10:10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle nuiti gaalu faa mɔungi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 1:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ Sinayi teʋebai zu, GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu, alugi velesiɛi ma volo mɔungi ma, ti ɠulaai ma Ezipete yooi ʋa, ma ɠonagi velesiɛi. É ɠɛni ma: <verse eid="NUM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 1:2"/>«À Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti kpein gaalu, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la, ta ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti, wo zunuiti kpein gaalu, <verse eid="NUM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 1:3"/>é zo kona ʋuufelegɔ (20) ma, é lɛ zeemaazu, nii dɔin seeliai kɔɔɠɔ vai ma Izilayɛle nuiti saama. Wa Aalɔn, wa ti ɠaalu ga kɔɔʋɛbɛi ɠɛʋelei.<verse eid="NUM 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 1:4"/>«Zunu ɠilagila ka ɠɛ wo ʋa, é ɠula bolodai ɠilagilagi zu, zunui nii a ɠɛ ga pɛlɛyeɠe ɠundiɠii. <verse eid="NUM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 1:5"/>Wɛlɛ zunuiti daaseigiti ba, niiti ta ɓɔ wo ʋa:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 1:5">Luɓɛn ʋɔ bɛ, Elisuul, Sedeyuul ná-doun zunui,<verse eid="NUM 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 1:6"/>Simiyɔn ʋɔ bɛ, Selumiyɛle, Sulisadayi ná-doun zunui,<verse eid="NUM 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 1:7"/>Zuda ʋɔ bɛ, Naason, Aminadaɓe ná-doun zunui,<verse eid="NUM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 1:8"/>Isakaal ʋɔ bɛ, Netaneyɛle, Suaal ná-doun zunui,<verse eid="NUM 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 1:9"/>Zaɓulɔn ʋɔ bɛ, Eliyaɓe, Ɠelon ná-doun zunui,<verse eid="NUM 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 1:10"/>Zozɛfe ná-doun zunuiti pɔ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 1:10">Efelayime ʋɔ bɛ, Elisama, Amiyude ná-doun zunui,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 1:10">Manasé ʋɔ bɛ, Gameliyɛle, Pedasuul ná-doun zunui,<verse eid="NUM 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 1:11"/>Ɓɛnzamɛn ʋɔ bɛ, Aɓidan, Gideyɔni ná-doun zunui,<verse eid="NUM 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 1:12"/>Dan ʋɔ bɛ, Ayiyezɛɛl, Amisadayi ná-doun zunui,<verse eid="NUM 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 1:13"/>Asɛɛl ʋɔ bɛ, Pagiyɛle, Wokelan ná-doun zunui,<verse eid="NUM 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 1:14"/>Gade ʋɔ bɛ, Eliasafe, Deyuwɛle ná-doun zunui,<verse eid="NUM 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 1:15"/>Nɛfɛtali ʋɔ bɛ, Ayila, Enan ná-doun zunui.»<verse eid="NUM 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 1:16"/>Naati ka ti ɠɛni ga nuɓusɛiti gaazuʋɛti, ti ti lolini. Ti ɠɛni ga ta-wolodamaiti ta-lotuɠɔiti. Tiya ɠa ti ɠɛni ɓalaa ga Izilayɛle ɠɔɔɓɔgi ma ɠundiɠiiti.<verse eid="NUM 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 1:17"/>Moize ta Aalɔn ti zunui niiti kpɔni ɓɔɠɔ ʋa, niiti ziimazeɠegi ɠɛni ga tiye ga ti-laaseigiti. <verse eid="NUM 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 1:18"/>Ti nuɓusɛiti pɛ gaalɛɛni ba, alugi velesiɛi ma volo mɔungi ma. Ti Izilayɛle nuiti kpein gaaluni, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la, ta ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti. Ti zunuiti daaseigiti sɛʋɛni ga gilagila, é zo kona ʋuufelegɔ (20) ma, é lɛ zeemaazu, <verse eid="NUM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 1:19"/>eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni la Moize ya. Zekana Moize ta-ɠaalugi woni da Sinayi teʋebai zu.<verse eid="NUM 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 1:20"/>Luɓɛn, Izilayɛle ná-doun zunu mɔungi, mavofodaiti tetemazu, ti zunuiti gaaluni ga gilagila, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la, ta ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti, é zo kona ʋuufelegɔ (20) ma, é lɛ zeemaazu, niiti kpein ta la zoo ti li kɔɔmaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 1:21"/>Luɓɛn ná-bolodai zu nii gaaluni, naa ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuunaani maazu lɔzita undɔɔlugɔ (46.500).<verse eid="NUM 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 1:22"/>Simiyɔn mavofodaiti tetemazu, ti zunuiti gaaluni ga gilagila, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la, ta ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti, é zo kona ʋuufelegɔ (20) ma, é lɛ zeemaazu, niiti kpein ta la zoo ti li kɔɔmaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 1:23"/>Simiyɔn ná-bolodai zu nii gaaluni, naa ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuulɔɔlu maazu taaʋuu unsaʋagɔ (59.300).<verse eid="NUM 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 1:24"/>Gade mavofodaiti tetemazu, ti zunuiti gaaluni ga gilagila, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la, ta ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti, é zo kona ʋuufelegɔ (20) ma, é lɛ zeemaazu, niiti kpein ta la zoo ti li kɔɔmaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 1:25"/>Gade ná-bolodai zu nii gaaluni, naa ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuunaani maazu lɔɔlu undɔzita puulɔɔlu (45.650).<verse eid="NUM 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 1:26"/>Zuda mavofodaiti tetemazu, ti zunuiti gaaluni ga gilagila, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la, ta ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti, é zo kona ʋuufelegɔ (20) ma, é lɛ zeemaazu, niiti kpein ta la zoo ti li kɔɔmaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 1:27"/>Zuda ná-bolodai zu nii gaaluni, naa ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuulɔfela maazu naani undɔzita (74.600).<verse eid="NUM 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 1:28"/>Isakaal mavofodaiti tetemazu, ti zunuiti gaaluni ga gilagila, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la, ta ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti, é zo kona ʋuufelegɔ (20) ma, é lɛ zeemaazu, niiti kpein ta la zoo ti li kɔɔmaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 1:29"/>Isakaal ná-bolodai zu nii gaaluni, naa ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuulɔɔlu maazu naani unnaani (54.400).<verse eid="NUM 1:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 1:30"/>Zaɓulɔn mavofodaiti tetemazu, ti zunuiti gaaluni ga gilagila, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la, ta ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti, é zo kona ʋuufelegɔ (20) ma, é lɛ zeemaazu, niiti kpein ta la zoo ti li kɔɔmaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 1:31"/>Zaɓulɔn ná-bolodai zu nii gaaluni, naa ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuulɔɔlu maazu lɔfela unnaani (57.400).<verse eid="NUM 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 1:32"/>Zozɛfe ná-doun zunui Efelayime mavofodaiti tetemazu, ti zunuiti gaaluni ga gilagila, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la, ta ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti, é zo kona ʋuufelegɔ (20) ma, é lɛ zeemaazu, niiti kpein ta la zoo ti li kɔɔmaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 1:33"/>Efelayime ná-bolodai zu nii gaaluni, naa ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuunaani undɔɔlu (40.500).<verse eid="NUM 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 1:34"/>Manasé mavofodaiti tetemazu, ti zunuiti gaaluni ga gilagila, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la, ta ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti, é zo kona ʋuufelegɔ (20) ma, é lɛ zeemaazu, niiti kpein ta la zoo ti li kɔɔmaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 1:35"/>Manasé ná-bolodai zu nii gaaluni, naa ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuusaʋa maazu fele unfelegɔ (32.200).<verse eid="NUM 1:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 1:36"/>Ɓɛnzamɛn mavofodaiti tetemazu, ti zunuiti gaaluni ga gilagila, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la, ta ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti, é zo kona ʋuufelegɔ (20) ma, é lɛ zeemaazu, niiti kpein ta la zoo ti li kɔɔmaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 1:37"/>Ɓɛnzamɛn ná-bolodai zu nii gaaluni, naa ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuusaʋa maazu lɔɔlu unnaanigɔ (35.400).<verse eid="NUM 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 1:38"/>Dan mavofodaiti tetemazu, ti zunuiti gaaluni ga gilagila, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la, ta ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti, é zo kona ʋuufelegɔ (20) ma, é lɛ zeemaazu, niiti kpein ta la zoo ti li kɔɔmaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 1:39"/>Dan ná-bolodai zu nii gaaluni, naa ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuulɔzita maazu fele undɔfela (62.700).<verse eid="NUM 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 1:40"/>Asɛɛl mavofodaiti tetemazu, ti zunuiti gaaluni ga gilagila, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la, ta ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti, é zo kona ʋuufelegɔ (20) ma, é lɛ zeemaazu, niiti kpein ta la zoo ti li kɔɔmaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 1:41"/>Asɛɛl ná-bolodai zu nii gaaluni, naa ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuunaani maazu ɠila undɔɔlugɔ (41.500).<verse eid="NUM 1:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 1:42"/>Nɛfɛtali mavofodaiti tetemazu, ti zunuiti gaaluni ga gilagila, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la, ta ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti, é zo kona ʋuufelegɔ (20) ma, é lɛ zeemaazu, niiti kpein ta la zoo ti li kɔɔmaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 1:43"/>Nɛfɛtali ná-bolodai zu nii gaaluni, naa ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuulɔɔlu maazu saʋa unnaanigɔ (53.400).<verse eid="NUM 1:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 1:44"/>Naati tiegɔi ɠa Moizeni ta Aalɔn ti gaaluni. Zunu puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12) niiti ti ɠɛni ga Izilayɛle woloda ɠundiɠiiti, naati ti ɓɔni ti ʋa. <verse eid="NUM 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 1:45"/>Izilayɛle nuiti saama, niiti kpein ti ti ɠaaluni, eɠɛʋelei ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti ti la, é zo kona ʋuufelegɔ (20) ma, é lɛ zeemaazu, niiti kpein ta la zoo ti li kɔɔmaʋɛ, <verse eid="NUM 1:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 1:46"/>ti ɠɛni ga zunu waaundɔzita zunu waasaʋagɔ undɔɔlu puulɔɔlu (603.550).<verse eid="NUM 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Levi nuiti ta-vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 1:47"/>Levi nuiti ta-wolodai zu, ti-ɠɛɛ ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti bu, ti ɠaa la ɠɛni luni ti zaama. <verse eid="NUM 1:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 1:48"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 1:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 1:49"/>«Mina Levi nuiti ta-wolodamaiti gaalu, mina ti ɠaalu Izilayɛle nuiti saama ɲɛgɛlɛin. <verse eid="NUM 1:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 1:50"/>Seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai, nii zeele woo ɠesui bu, naa ma wotii ve Levi nuiti zea, ta ma zɔɔlaiti kpein, ta nii kpein é ga naama vai. Ta seɠe ʋɛlɛi zeɠe, ta ná-sɔɔlaiti kpein, ti ná-botii ɠɛ, ti ʋu seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai maaɠoolii zu. <verse eid="NUM 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 1:51"/>Siɛgi zu seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai a ɠɛna zeɠea la losuʋɛ, é ʋa li ada ɠili, Levi nuiti ta kulakula ba, ti to ʋolu ga niinɛ, ʋɛ ta ɠɛ zeizu ná. Zɔi nɔpɛ a maaɓuɠana ná ʋa, nii é la ga Levi ná-bolodai zu nui ta, ta naama nui ʋaa. <verse eid="NUM 1:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 1:52"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ta ʋu ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ ti ɠilagilagi, ná-bolodai ná-poogi ɠobaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 1:53"/>Kɛlɛ Levi nuiti ta ʋu seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai maaɠoolii zu, nii zeele woo ɠesui bu, naa ɠa a kɛ nà-ziiɠaawanai mina vuka Izilayɛle ʋɛbɛi ma. Levi nuiti ta ɠɛ seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai makɛsu.»<verse eid="NUM 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 1:54"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɠoloni, ti deveiti kpein so, niiti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ti veeni Moize ya.<verse eid="NUM 1:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NUM 2"/>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle nuiti puu ʋelei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 2:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ta Aalɔn ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ti ma: <verse eid="NUM 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 2:2"/>«Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɠilagilagi ɠa ʋu ná-bolodai ná-poogi ɠobaʋɛ, ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti ta-ʋoogi wu. Ta ʋu GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi letema, ta maaɠoolii zu.<verse eid="NUM 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 2:3"/>«Zuda ná-bolodai ɠa ʋu folo ɠulazu ʋelei, ná-poogi wu, ga ná-kɔɔɓɔgiti kɛʋelei. Ná-kundiɠii ɠa ɠɛ ga Naason, Aminadaɓe ná-doun zunui. <verse eid="NUM 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 2:4"/>Ná-kɔɔɓɔgi liegɔi ɠa ɠɛ ga zunu waaʋuulɔfela maazu naani undɔzita (74.600). <verse eid="NUM 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 2:5"/>Isakaal ná-bolodai ɠa ʋu kobaʋɛ. Ná-kundiɠii ɠa ɠɛ ga Netaneyɛle, Suaal ná-doun zunui. <verse eid="NUM 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 2:6"/>Ná-kɔɔɓɔgi liegɔi ɠa ɠɛ ga zunu waaʋuulɔɔlu maazu naani unnaanigɔ (54.400). <verse eid="NUM 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 2:7"/>Zaɓulɔn ná-bolodai ɠa ʋu zɔɔla ʋelei. Ná-kundiɠii ɠa ɠɛ ga Eliyaɓe, Ɠelon ná-doun zunui. <verse eid="NUM 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 2:8"/>Ná-kɔɔɓɔgi liegɔi ɠa ɠɛ ga zunu waaʋuulɔɔlu maazu lɔfela unnaanigɔ (57.400). <verse eid="NUM 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 2:9"/>Zuda ná-kɔɔɓɔgiti ti-liegɔi ɠa ɠɛ ga zunu waaungila waaʋuulɔsaʋa maazu lɔzita unnaanigɔ (186.400). Naati ka ta lo siɛi ma ʋelei la.<verse eid="NUM 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 2:10"/>«Luɓɛn ná-bolodai ɠa ʋu nu yeezazu ʋelei, ná-poogi wu, ga ná-kɔɔɓɔgiti kɛʋelei. Ná-kundiɠii ɠa ɠɛ ga Elisuul, Sedeyuul ná-doun zunui. <verse eid="NUM 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 2:11"/>Ná-kɔɔɓɔgi liegɔi ɠa ɠɛ ga zunu waaʋuunaani maazu lɔzita undɔɔlugɔ (46.500). <verse eid="NUM 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 2:12"/>Simiyɔn ná-bolodai ɠa ʋu kobaʋɛ. Ná-kundiɠii ɠa ɠɛ ga Selumiyɛle, Sulisadayi ná-doun zunui. <verse eid="NUM 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 2:13"/>Ná-kɔɔɓɔgi liegɔi ɠa ɠɛ ga zunu waaʋuulɔɔlu maazu taaʋuu unsaʋagɔ (59.300). <verse eid="NUM 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 2:14"/>Gade ná-bolodai ɠa ʋu zɔɔla ʋelei. Ná-kundiɠii ɠa ɠɛ ga Eliasafe, Leyuwɛle ná-doun zunui. <verse eid="NUM 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 2:15"/>Ná-kɔɔɓɔgi liegɔi ɠa ɠɛ ga zunu waaʋuunaani maazu lɔɔlu undɔzita puulɔɔlugɔ (45.650). <verse eid="NUM 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 2:16"/>Luɓɛn ná-kɔɔɓɔgiti ti-liegɔi ɠa ɠɛ ga zunu waaungila waaʋuulɔɔlu maazu ɠila unnaani puulɔɔlugɔ (151.450). Naati ka ta ɠɛ ʋelelaiti poluʋɛ siɛ wo fai zu.<verse eid="NUM 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 2:17"/>«Naa ʋoluma, Levi nuiti ta ʋilɛ ti ʋolu ga GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi, siɛ wo fai zu. Ta ɠɛ kɔɔɓɔ felegɔ mɔungiti ta kɔɔɓɔ felegɔ ɠaaɓelagiti zɔɠɔzu. Ʋelei ti ʋuu ʋelei la, pele ɠana ta lii la, ɛsɛ ge yɛ losu, ti ɠilagilagi, ta ta-ʋoogiti.<verse eid="NUM 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 2:18"/>«Efelayime ná-bolodai ɠa ʋu folo liizu ʋelei, ná-poogi wu, ga ná-kɔɔɓɔgiti kɛʋelei. Ná-kundiɠii ɠa ɠɛ ga Elisama, Amiyude ná-doun zunui. <verse eid="NUM 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 2:19"/>Ná-kɔɔɓɔgi liegɔi ɠa ɠɛ ga zunu waaʋuunaani undɔɔlugɔ (40.500). <verse eid="NUM 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 2:20"/>Manasé ná-bolodai ɠa ʋu kobaʋɛ. Ná-kundiɠii ɠa ɠɛ ga Gameliyɛle, Pedasuul ná-doun zunui. <verse eid="NUM 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 2:21"/>Ná-kɔɔɓɔgi liegɔi ɠa ɠɛ ga zunu waaʋuusaʋa maazu fele unfelegɔ (32.200). <verse eid="NUM 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 2:22"/>Ɓɛnzamɛn ná-bolodai ɠa ʋu zɔɔla ʋelei. Ná-kundiɠii ɠa ɠɛ ga Aɓidan, Gideyɔni ná-doun zunui. <verse eid="NUM 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 2:23"/>Ná-kɔɔɓɔgi liegɔi ɠa ɠɛ ga zunu waaʋuusaʋa maazu lɔɔlu unnaanigɔ (35.400). <verse eid="NUM 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 2:24"/>Efelayime ná-kɔɔɓɔgiti ti-liegɔi ɠa ɠɛ ga zunu waaungila maazu lɔsaʋa ungila (108.100). Naati ka ta ɠɛ liizu togi zaʋasiɛi zu.<verse eid="NUM 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 2:25"/>«Dan ná-bolodai ɠa ʋu nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei, ná-poogi wu, ga ná-kɔɔɓɔgiti kɛʋelei. Ná-kundiɠii ɠa ɠɛ ga Ayiyezɛɛl, Amisadayi ná-doun zunui. <verse eid="NUM 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 2:26"/>Ná-kɔɔɓɔgi liegɔi ɠa ɠɛ ga zunu waaʋuulɔzita maazu felegɔ undɔfela (62.700). <verse eid="NUM 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 2:27"/>Asɛɛl ná-bolodai ɠa ʋu kobaʋɛ. Ná-kundiɠii ɠa ɠɛ ga Pagiyɛle, Wokelan ná-doun zunui. <verse eid="NUM 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 2:28"/>Ná-kɔɔɓɔgi liegɔi ɠa ɠɛ ga zunu waaʋuunaani maazu ɠila undɔɔlugɔ (41.500). <verse eid="NUM 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 2:29"/>Nɛfɛtali ná-bolodai ɠa ʋu zɔɔla ʋelei. Ná-kundiɠii ɠa ɠɛ ga Ayila, Enan ná-doun zunui. <verse eid="NUM 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 2:30"/>Ná-kɔɔɓɔgi liegɔi ɠa ɠɛ ga zunu waaʋuulɔɔlu maazu saʋa unnaanigɔ (53.400). <verse eid="NUM 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 2:31"/>Dan ná-kɔɔɓɔgiti ti-liegɔi ɠa ɠɛ ga zunu waaungila waaʋuulɔɔlugɔ maazu lɔfela undɔzita (157.600). Naati ka ta li ga gaaɓelagi ta ta-ʋoogiti.»<verse eid="NUM 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 2:32"/>Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti ti ti ɠaaluni ga pɛlɛyeɠei, ta ta-ɠɔɔɓɔgiti kɛʋelei, ti-liegɔi ɠɛni ga zunu waaundɔzita zunu waasaʋagɔ undɔɔlu puulɔɔlugɔ (603.550). <verse eid="NUM 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 2:33"/>Levi nuiti gaa la ɠɛni luni Izilayɛle nui zɔiti saama, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni la Moize ya.<verse eid="NUM 2:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 2:34"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti ziɛni ga deveiti pɛ, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni la Moize ya. Naa ɠa é kɛɛni, ti ɠɛni ʋuuzu ta-ʋoogi ɠoba. Ta ɠɛna ziaa, ti lo ga ta-woloda ʋelei, ta pɛlɛyeɠe ʋelei.<verse eid="NUM 2:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NUM 3"/>
  <para style="s">Aalɔn ná-doun zunuiti ta-wotii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 3:1"/>Aalɔn ta Moize ti-mavofodai ʋɛtɛ, siɛgi zu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni la Moize ʋɔ Sinayi gizei ma.<verse eid="NUM 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 3:2"/>Aalɔn ná-doun zunuiti daaseigiti kaa: ma mɔungi laaseigi ɠɛni ga Nadaɓe, naa ʋolumai Aɓiyu ta Eleazaal, ta Itamaal. <verse eid="NUM 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 3:3"/>Ti ɠɛni ga zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, gulɔ ɲadegai ziɛni ti ma, zobogi ve ti ya, ga ti zalaɠa ɠula wotii ɠɛ. <verse eid="NUM 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 3:4"/>Kɛlɛ Nadaɓe ta Aɓiyu ti zaani Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu Sinayi teʋebai zu, tɔɔzei ti ʋaani ga abu ɠiligi. Ti la ɠɛni dounɠa zɔlɔɔni. Eleazaal ta Itamaal ti zalaɠa ɠula wotii ɠɛɛni, ti-ɠɛɛ Aalɔn ɗa wɛlɛ ti ma.<verse eid="NUM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Levi nuiti kɛɛ vai <optbreak/> zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ta-wotii zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 3:5"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 3:6"/>«Ʋa ga Levi mavofodai, è ma nuɓusɛiti pu zalaɠa ɠula nui Aalɔn yeema, ga ti ɗa ɓɔ ba. <verse eid="NUM 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 3:7"/>Ta ɠɛɛzu ná-botii zu, ta nuɓusɛiti ta-wotii, GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi ɠakala, ti ti-losuʋɛti kpein kɛ, ti daazeeli, é lo seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ʋa. <verse eid="NUM 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 3:8"/>Ti ɠaaɓa GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu zɔɔlaiti ma, ti ti makɛ, ti ɠɛ Izilayɛle nuiti ta-wotii zu, ti ti-losuʋɛ kpein kɛ, ti daazeeli, é lo seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai vai ʋa. <verse eid="NUM 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 3:9"/>Ɗa Levi nuiti fe Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti zea. Ta veezu bɛ ɲɛgɛlɛin, ti ɠɛ ga Izilayɛle nuiti gaazuʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 3:10"/>Ɗa Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti sei, ti zalaɠa ɠula wotii ɠɛ. Zɔi nɔpɛ a maaɓuɠana seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ʋa, nii é la ga ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠei wu nui ta, ta naama nui ʋaa.»<verse eid="NUM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 3:11"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 3:12"/>«Wɛlɛ, gè yiimazeɠea ga Levi nuiti, Izilayɛle nuiti saama, doun zunu mɔungiti kpein potogi zu, Izilayɛle anzanuiti ti-loun mɔungiti. Ta ga nɔ̀nɔiti. <verse eid="NUM 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 3:13"/>Doun zunu mɔungi kpein ka ga nɔ̀nɔ, é zo naama voloi ma, yeei gè Ezipete yooi zu loun zunu mɔungiti paani la, gè Izilayɛle loun zunu mɔungiti makɛni ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, é zo nuiti ti-lointi ma, é li suaiti ti-yiʋoiti pɔ. Ta ga nɔ̀nɔ. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.»<verse eid="NUM 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Levi nuiti gaalu fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 3:14"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI devei veeni Moize ya, Sinayi teʋebai zu, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 3:15"/>«Levi mavofodaiti gaalu, eɠɛʋelei ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti ti la, ta ta-wolodamaiti. Ɗa zunuiti kpein gaalu, é zo alu gila ma, é lɛ zeemaazu.» <verse eid="NUM 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 3:16"/>Moize ti ɠaaluni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-devei zu, eɠɛʋelei é ma levei zɔlɔɔni da.<verse eid="NUM 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 3:17"/>Levi ná-doun zunuiti daaseigiti ti ɠɛni ga: Gɛɛlɛson, Keɠate ta Melali. <verse eid="NUM 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 3:18"/>Gɛɛlɛson ná-doun zunuiti daaseigiti kaa, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la: Liɓini ta Simeyi. <verse eid="NUM 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 3:19"/>Keɠate ná-doun zunuiti daaseigiti kaa, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la: Amalame, Yiseɠaal, Eɓelɔn, ta Uziyɛle. <verse eid="NUM 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 3:20"/>Melali ná-doun zunuiti daaseigiti kaa, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la: Maali ta Musi. Levi ná-bolodamaiti kana, eɠɛʋelei ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti ti la.<verse eid="NUM 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 3:21"/>Gɛɛlɛson mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni ga Liɓini ná-bolodamaiti ta Simeyi nɔnɔiti. <verse eid="NUM 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 3:22"/>Ti-liegɔi ɠɛni ga zunu waadɔfela undɔɔlugɔ (7.500), é zo alu gila ma, é lɛ zeemaazu. <verse eid="NUM 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 3:23"/>Gɛɛlɛson ná-bolodamaiti ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ ɠɛni ga seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ʋoluʋelei, folo liizu ʋelei. <verse eid="NUM 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 3:24"/>Gɛɛlɛson ná-bolodamaiti ta-ɠundiɠii ɠɛni ga Eliasafe, Layɛle ná-doun zunui. <verse eid="NUM 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 3:25"/>Ti-losuʋɛ ɠɛni ga ti ɠaaɓa GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi ʋaalobazuʋɛ niiti ma: seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai, ta ma ʋɛɛmazeɠei, ta kwɛpele seɠezuɠoozagi, nii é GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ, <verse eid="NUM 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 3:26"/>ta koii ma zasai laaʋɛ ma ɠwɛpele seɠezuɠoozagi, ta sasai ma zeɠeiti, nii é seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ta zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ maaɠoolii zu, é ʋɛɛ ta-ɠaluiti ba. Tiya ɠa ti-ɠasɔ ɠɛni ga botii, nii togai naama aniiti kpein ba.<verse eid="NUM 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 3:27"/>Keɠate mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni ga Amalame ná-bolodamaiti, ta Yiseɠaal nɔnɔiti, naa ʋɛɛ Eɓelɔn ta Uziyɛle tɔnɔiti ba. <verse eid="NUM 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 3:28"/>Ti-liegɔi ɠɛni ga zunu waadɔsaʋa undɔzita (8.600), é zo alu gila ma, é lɛ zeemaazu. Ti pɛ ka ti ɠɛni seizu ɲadegai ma wotii zu. <verse eid="NUM 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 3:29"/>Keɠate ná-bolodamaiti ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ ɠɛni ga nu yeezazu ʋelei seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ɠilazuʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 3:30"/>Keɠate ná-bolodamaiti ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti ta-ɠundiɠii ɠɛni ga Elisafan, Uziyɛle ná-doun zunui. <verse eid="NUM 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 3:31"/>Ti-losuʋɛ ɠɛni ga ti ɠaaɓa GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi ma zɔɔlai niiti ma: minazeɠe kesui, ta taɓalii, ta fitina zei anii, ta zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛti, ta seizu ɲadegai ma zɔɔlaiti kpein, niiti botii ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ga tiye, ta kwɛpele seɠezuɠoozagi. Tiya ɠa ti-ɠasɔ ɠɛni ga botii, nii togai naama aniiti kpein ba. <verse eid="NUM 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 3:32"/>Levi nuiti ta-ɠundiɠi wolai ɠɛni ga Eleazaal, zalaɠa ɠula nui Aalɔn ná-doun zunui. Tɔ ɠa é ɠɛni wɛlɛzu Levi nuiti ma, niiti ti ɠɛni seizu ɲadegai ma wotii zu.<verse eid="NUM 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 3:33"/>Melali mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni ga Maali ná-bolodamaiti ta Musi nɔnɔiti. <verse eid="NUM 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 3:34"/>Ti-liegɔi ɠɛni ga zunu waadɔzita unfelegɔ (6.200), é zo alu gila ma, é lɛ zeemaazu. <verse eid="NUM 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 3:35"/>Melali ná-bolodamaiti ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti ta-ɠundiɠii ɠɛni ga Suliyɛle, Aɓiyayile ná-doun zunui. Ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ ɠɛni ga seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ɠilazu ʋelei nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 3:36"/>Ti-losuʋɛ ɠɛni ga ti ɠaaɓa GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi ʋaalobazuʋɛ niiti ma: seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai zuzo guluiti, ta ma wulu zɔkpɔiti, ta ma lɔkpalaiti, ta ta-labuiti, ta ta-zɔɔlaiti kpein niiti botii ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ga tiye, <verse eid="NUM 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 3:37"/>ta tɔkpalaiti ti ɠɛni ga koii ma zasai, é ɠooli ma, é ʋɛɛ ta-labuiti ba, ta ti zuzo kɔluiti, ta ta-ɠaluiti.<verse eid="NUM 3:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 3:38"/>Moize-o, Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti-yo, ti ʋuuni seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ɠakalaʋɛ, folo ɠulazu ʋelei, GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ. Ti ɠɛni seizu ɲadegai ma wotii ɠɛɛzu Izilayɛle nuiti daaseigi zu. Zɔi nɔpɛ a la maaɓuɠana ná ʋa, ta naama nui ʋaa.<verse eid="NUM 3:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 3:39"/>Levi nuiti kpein, niiti Moizeni ta Aalɔn ti ti ɠaaluni, zunuiti, é zo alu gila ma, é lɛ zeemaazu, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-devei ɠɛni la, é lo pɛlɛyeɠeiti ba, ti ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuufele maazu felegɔ (22.000).<verse eid="NUM 3:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Doun mɔungiti unmɔɔ fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 3:40"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Moize ma: «Doun zunu mɔungiti kpein gaalu Izilayɛle nuiti saama, é zo alu gila ma, é lɛ zeemaazu, è ti-laaseigiti sɛʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 3:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 3:41"/>Ɗa Levi nuiti fe bɛ̀, Izilayɛle nuiti ti-loun zunu mɔungiti potogi zu. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI. Levi nuiti ta-loganiiti ta ɠɛ ga nɔ̀nɔ, Izilayɛle nuiti ta-logani zinɛ mɔungiti potogi zu.» <verse eid="NUM 3:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 3:42"/>Moize doun zunu mɔungiti kpein gaaluni Izilayɛle nuiti saama, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni la zea. <verse eid="NUM 3:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 3:43"/>Doun zunu mɔungi kpein gaaluni, é zo alu gila ma, é lɛ zeemaazu. Ti-liegɔi ɠɛni ga waaʋuufele maazu fele unfele puulɔfela maazu saʋagɔ (22.273).<verse eid="NUM 3:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 3:44"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 3:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 3:45"/>«Levi nuiti fe bɛ̀, Izilayɛle nuiti ti-loun zunu mɔungiti potogi zu, ta Levi nuiti ta-loganiiti, Izilayɛle nuiti ta-loganiiti potogi zu. Levi nuiti ta ɠɛ ga nɔ̀nɔ. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI. <verse eid="NUM 3:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 3:46"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti-loun zunu mɔungiti, zunu unfele puulɔfela maazu saʋagɔ (273) unmɔɔ fai zu, nii daai ma, ti yɔɠɔzu ma ta Levi nuiti, <verse eid="NUM 3:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 3:47"/>naa ɠa ga ɗa wali ɠae lɔɔludɔɔlu kula ti ɠilagilagi unmɔɔ fai zu. Wali ɠaei naa zoloo seizu ɲadegai ma walii ma, nii buɲɛgi ga galamu puugɔ. <verse eid="NUM 3:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 3:48"/>Ɗa walii naa ve Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti zea, ga naati unmɔɔ ganii, niiti ti-liegɔi a leʋe Levi nuiti tiegɔi ʋa.» <verse eid="NUM 3:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 3:49"/>Moize unmɔɔgi ma walii zoni, é ɠula naati zea, niiti ti-liegɔi ɓudɛni Levi nuiti maazu, ti unmɔɔgai, <verse eid="NUM 3:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 3:50"/>é walii zoni, é ɠula Izilayɛle nuiti ti-loun zunu mɔungiti zea, é ɠɛ ga wali ɠae waagila unsaʋa puulɔzita maazu lɔɔlugɔ (1.365), eɠɛʋelei seizu ɲadegai ma walii la. <verse eid="NUM 3:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 3:51"/>Moize unmɔɔgi ma walii veeni Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti zea, é zoloo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-devei ma, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI Moize ɓɔɠɔi leveni la.<verse eid="NUM 3:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NUM 4"/>
  <para style="s">Keɠate nuiti ta-wotii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 4:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ta Aalɔn ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ti ma: <verse eid="NUM 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 4:2"/>«Keɠate mavofodaiti gaalu, Levi ná-doun zunuiti saama, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la, ta ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti, <verse eid="NUM 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 4:3"/>é zo kona ʋuusaʋagɔ (30) ma, é li kona ʋuulɔɔlugɔ (50) ʋɔ, nii nɔpɛgi a zoloo GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi ma wotii ta ɠɛɛ vai ma.<verse eid="NUM 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 4:4"/>«Keɠate mavofodaiti ta-wotii ʋɛtɛ, ta ɠɛ kɛɛzu GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu: ada ɲadega wolai ma ɠasɔi ɠa ɠɛ ti unma. <verse eid="NUM 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 4:5"/>Siɛgi zu ta ɠɛ liizu la, ti zeɠe ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ, Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti ta kwɛpele seɠezuɠoozagi ɠula, ti zeele woo ɠesui maavelevele la, <verse eid="NUM 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 4:6"/>ziɛ wu zua ɠɔlɔi ʋɛɛ ma, ti seɠe ɓiinii ʋɛɛ maazu, naa ʋolu ti kesui zeɠe wulu zɔkpɔiti to ba.<verse eid="NUM 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 4:7"/>«Ta seɠe ɓiinii ʋɛɛ taɓalii ma, nii ɓului laazu ga GALA bɛ, ti diɠiiti sei maazu, ta tazaiti, puya zalaɠai vaa zu, ta kokoiti, ta ziawɔiti. Ɓuluiti ti veai GALA bɛ, naati ta yɛ ná taɓalii ɠa. <verse eid="NUM 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 4:8"/>Ta pɛɛmazeɠe ɓɔi sɔsɔgi ʋɛɛ ma aniiti ma, naa ʋolu ti ziɛ wu zua ɠɔlɔi velevele ti ma, naa ʋolu ti taɓalii zeɠe wulu zɔkpɔiti to ba.<verse eid="NUM 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 4:9"/>«Ta seɠe ɓiinii zeɠe, ti felevele fitina zei anii ma, wozaɠala fai zu, ta ná-fitinaiti, ta ná-salaʋa zo sɔɔlaiti, ta ná-salaʋa zeɠe aniɲakaiti, ta ná-gulɔ aniɲakaiti, ná-botii ɠɛɛ vai ma. <verse eid="NUM 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 4:10"/>Ta ti maavelevele, ta ná-sɔɔlaiti kpein, ziɛ wu zua ɠɔlɔi zu, ti ti la kasɔ zeɠe wului ma.<verse eid="NUM 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 4:11"/>«Ta pɛɛmazeɠe ɓiinii ʋɛɛ zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma, nii zanugi ziɛni maaʋɛ, ti maavelevele ga ziɛ wu zua ɠɔlɔi, naa ʋolu ti seɠe wulu zɔkpɔiti to ba. <verse eid="NUM 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 4:12"/>Ta aniɲakaiti kpein seɠe, niiti ti botii ɠɛɛzu ga tiye seizu ɲadegai zu, ti ti ʋu seɠe ɓiinii zu, ti ti maavelevele ga ziɛ wu zua ɠɔlɔi, naa ʋolu ti ti la kasɔ zeɠe wului ma.<verse eid="NUM 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 4:13"/>«Ta zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma yuʋui ɠula su, ti pɛɛmazeɠe ɓɔigi ʋɛɛ niina gaazu, <verse eid="NUM 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 4:14"/>naa ɠa ti sɔɔlaiti kpein puuzu maazu, niiti ti ga ná-botiɠɛ aniiti: abu zeɠe aniiti, sua zɔɔ mitɛ wolaiti, pɛluiti, ta ɲama vaza aniɲakaiti. Naa ʋoluma ta ziɛ wu zua ɠɔlɔi ʋɛɛ ti pɛ maazu, ti seɠe wulu zɔkpɔiti to ba.<verse eid="NUM 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 4:15"/>«Siɛgi zu Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti ti ɓesu la ga seizu ɲadegai ta sɔɔlaiti maavelevele, ti lii ziɛgi zu, ti ʋa zeɠe ʋuuzuʋɛ, Keɠate ná-nuiti ta ʋa niina, ti ti zeɠe. Kɛlɛ ti mina yeevɔɔɠu ada ɲadegai ma anii ta ʋa, ti ʋa za. Keɠate mavofodaiti tosuʋɛ ɠana, GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi ná-fai zu.<verse eid="NUM 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 4:16"/>«Zalaɠa ɠula nui Aalɔn ná-doun zunui Eleazaal losuʋɛ ɠa ga, é ɗa wɛlɛ fitinai ná-gulɔi ma ta ansansegi, ta vebɛ zalaɠai é ɠulazu folo-o-folo, ta siɛma wulɔ ɲadegai. Toɠa seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ma wɛlɛma vai kpein kɛ, ta bu anii kpein, ta seizu ɲadegai, é ʋɛɛ ma zɔɔlaiti kpein ba.»<verse eid="NUM 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 4:17"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ta Aalɔn ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ti ma: <verse eid="NUM 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 4:18"/>«À mina va bu ga Keɠate nuiti ta-wolodai ma ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti ma zuwu ɠaaleʋe Levi nuiti saama. <verse eid="NUM 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 4:19"/>Wɛlɛ pelegi maanɛai wo kɛ la ti ʋɛ, nii a kɛ ti zɛnvui wo, ti mina za: Siɛgi zu ti ʋaazu la ani ɲadegaiti pɔ bɛ, ɗɛi è ga Aalɔn, wa è-loun zunuiti, wa lɛ, wo ɛsɛ tosuʋɛ lɛɛ la, nii maanɛai é kɛ. <verse eid="NUM 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 4:20"/>Keɠate nuiti ti maa la nɛɛni, ti ʋa lɛ ada ɲadegai eyɛsu pɛ, naa ʋɛtɛ faa zu, anɛɛ yeeɠɛɠala go nɔ laawu, ti ʋa za.»<verse eid="NUM 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gɛɛlɛsome nuiti ta-wotii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 4:21"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 4:22"/>«Gɛɛlɛson mavofodai ɠaalu, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la, ta ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti. <verse eid="NUM 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 4:23"/>Ɗa zunuiti kpein gaalu, é zo kona ʋuusaʋagɔ (30) ma, é li kona ʋuulɔɔlugɔ (50) ʋɔ, nii nɔpɛgi a zoloo GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi ma wotii ta ɠɛɛ vai ma. <verse eid="NUM 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 4:24"/>Wɛlɛ nii ɠa é ɠɛɛzu ga Gɛɛlɛson nuiti ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti tosuʋɛ, nii ta kɛ, ta nii ta seɠe: <verse eid="NUM 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 4:25"/>Ta ɗa seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ma landaiti seɠe, ta GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi, ta ma ʋɛɛmazeɠeiti, ta ziɛ wu zua ɠɔlɔi é ʋɛɛzu ti maazu, ta kwɛpele seɠezuɠoozagi é GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ, <verse eid="NUM 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 4:26"/>ta koii ma zasai, nii é seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ta zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ maaɠoolii zu, ta sasai laaʋɛ ma ɠwɛpele seɠezuɠoozagi, é ʋɛɛ ta-ɠaluiti ba, ta naama zɔɔlaiti kpein. Ta botii kpein kɛ, nii togai naa ʋa. <verse eid="NUM 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 4:27"/>Gɛɛlɛson mavofodaiti ta ta-wotii kpein kɛ Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti ta-levei wu, ti naama ɠasɔi zeɠe, nii maanɛai ti seɠe, ti ti-losuʋɛ laazeeli. <verse eid="NUM 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 4:28"/>Pele ɠana Gɛɛlɛson nuiti ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti ta-wotii a ɠɛ la, é lo GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi vai ʋa. Ta kɛ, ti daazeeli zalaɠa ɠula nui Aalɔn ná-doun zunui Itamaal ná-devei wu.<verse eid="NUM 4:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Melali nuiti ta-wotii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 4:29"/>«Ɗa Melali mavofodaiti gaalu ɓalaa, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la, ta ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti. <verse eid="NUM 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 4:30"/>Ɗa zunuiti kpein gaalu, é zo kona ʋuusaʋagɔ (30) ma, é li kona ʋuulɔɔlugɔ (50) ʋɔ, nii nɔpɛgi a zoloo GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi ma wotii ta ɠɛɛ vai ma.<verse eid="NUM 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 4:31"/>«Wɛlɛ, nii ɠa maanɛai ga ti ɗa seɠe, GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi ma zɔɔlaiti su: seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai zuzo guluiti, ta ma wulu zɔkpɔiti, ta ma lɔkpalaiti, ta ma labuiti, <verse eid="NUM 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 4:32"/>ta tɔkpalaiti ti ɠɛni ga koii ma zasai, é ɠooli ma, é ʋɛɛ ta-labuiti ba, ta ti zuzo kɔluiti, ta ta-ɠaluiti, ta sɔɔlai nii kpein fizɔgai ti loda vai zu. Wa ɛsɛ ná-sɔɔla lɛɛ la, nii a ɠɛ seɠezu. <verse eid="NUM 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 4:33"/>Pele ɠana Melali nuiti ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti ta-wotii a ɠɛ la, ta ti-losuʋɛ, é lo GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi vai ʋa. Naa ɠa ta ɠɛ kɛɛzu Itamaal yeezu, nii é ga zalaɠa ɠula nui Aalɔn ná-doun zunui.»<verse eid="NUM 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Levi nuiti gaalu fai, <optbreak/> niiti ti ɠɛni botii zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 4:34"/>Moize ta Aalɔn ta nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠundiɠiiti ti Keɠate mavofodaiti gaaluni, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la, ta ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti, <verse eid="NUM 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 4:35"/>é zo kona ʋuusaʋagɔ (30) ma, é li kona ʋuulɔɔlugɔ (50) ʋɔ, nii nɔpɛgi a zoloo GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi ma wotii ta ɠɛɛ vai ma. <verse eid="NUM 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 4:36"/>Nii gaaluni ta-wolodamaiti su, naa ɠɛni ga zunu waafelegɔ undɔfela puulɔɔlugɔ (2.750). <verse eid="NUM 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 4:37"/>Keɠate ná-bolodamaiti kana, ti ti ɠaaluni, nii kpein é ɠɛni botii ɠɛɛzu GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu. Moize ta Aalɔn ti ti ɠaaluni, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni la Moize ya.<verse eid="NUM 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 4:38"/>Gɛɛlɛson mavofodaiti ti ɠaaluni, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la, ta ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti, <verse eid="NUM 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 4:39"/>é zo kona ʋuusaʋagɔ (30) ma, é li kona ʋuulɔɔlugɔ (50) ʋɔ, nii nɔpɛgi a zoloo GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi ma wotii ta ɠɛɛ vai ma, <verse eid="NUM 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 4:40"/>nii gaaluni, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la, ta ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti, naa ɠɛni ga zunu waafelegɔ undɔzita puusaʋagɔ (2.630). <verse eid="NUM 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 4:41"/>Gɛɛlɛson ná-bolodamaiti kana, ti ti ɠaaluni, nii kpein é ɠɛni botii ɠɛɛzu GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu. Moize ta Aalɔn ti ti ɠaaluni, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni la ti ya.<verse eid="NUM 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 4:42"/>Melali ná-bolodamaiti ti ɠaaluni, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la, ta ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti, <verse eid="NUM 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 4:43"/>é zo kona ʋuusaʋagɔ (30) ma, é li kona ʋuulɔɔlugɔ (50) ʋɔ, nii nɔpɛgi a zoloo GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi ma wotii ta ɠɛɛ vai ma, <verse eid="NUM 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 4:44"/>nii gaaluni, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la, naa ɠɛni ga zunu waasaʋagɔ unfelegɔ (3.200). <verse eid="NUM 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 4:45"/>Melali ná-bolodamaiti kana, ti ti ɠaaluni. Moize ta Aalɔn ti ti ɠaaluni, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni la Moize ya.<verse eid="NUM 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 4:46"/>Levi nuiti, Moize ta Aalɔn ta Izilayɛle nuiti ta-ɠundiɠiiti ti ti ɠaaluni, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la, ta ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti, <verse eid="NUM 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 4:47"/>é zo kona ʋuusaʋagɔ (30) ma, é li kona ʋuulɔɔlugɔ (50) ʋɔ, nii nɔpɛgi a zoloo GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi ma wotii ta ɠɛɛ vai ma, <verse eid="NUM 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 4:48"/>ti-liegɔi ɠɛni ga zunu waadɔsaʋa undɔɔlugɔ puulɔsaʋa (8.580). <verse eid="NUM 4:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 4:49"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é devei veeni ga ti ti ɠaalu, Moize ɛsɛ ná-boti lɛɛni la, nii maanɛai é kɛ, ta kasɔi nii maanɛai é seɠe, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni la Moize ya.<verse eid="NUM 4:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NUM 5"/>
  <para style="s">Tɔgi é lo ɲade fai ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 5:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 5:2"/>«Devei ve Izilayɛle nuiti zea ga ti naati kpein kula ɓɔɠɔ zaama ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ, niiti ti ɠɔzɔai ga gee zeeɓɛi, ɓaa kalaɲa kolegi, ɓaa ti vɔɔɠuai poomai ta ʋa. <verse eid="NUM 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 5:3"/>É ɠɛni ga zunu ɓaa anzanu, wa ti ɠula wo-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋa, ti mina wo-ʋuuzuʋɛ ɠɔzɔ, ʋɛ gè zeini ná wo zaama.» <verse eid="NUM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 5:4"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti woozogi ɠɛɛni, ti naama nuiti kpein kulani ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋa, ti li ná ʋoluʋɛ, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni la Moize ya.<verse eid="NUM 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Unmai ma vaazuɓɛtɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 5:5"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 5:6"/>«Ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ, è ɠɛ ti ma: Ni zunu ɓaa anzanu a ɓaaɠona nui ta ma, toɠa ɠɛ ga ladalala nu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI letema, kɛni é leve ga sɔba nu. <verse eid="NUM 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 5:7"/>Toɠa laa zɔ ga ga kotoi é kɛai. Toɠa ma anii ɠaaɠale ma naa ʋɔ, nii é ɓaaɠogai ma, é kpɔ ba ga ma gaaɠwɛsu lɔɔlugɔi zeizu ɠilagi. <verse eid="NUM 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 5:8"/>Ni nui nii kpaaɠomai wogai la, naa za, tama ná-pogani zeɠe nu la ná, nii faazuɓɛtɛi a wo zeezaama, aniiti kpein ta ve Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, naa ɠa ga zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa ta ve zea, é ɓɔ baala sinɛi ʋa, é ga koto gba zalaɠai sɔba nui ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 5:9"/>Vebɛani ɲadegai kpein Izilayɛle nuiti ta kula, faanɛɛ gelei nii a zeɠe ba, é ve zalaɠa ɠula nui ya, naa ɠa ɠɛ ga naa nɔnɔ. <verse eid="NUM 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 5:10"/>Nii nui feezu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, naa ɠa ve zalaɠa ɠula nui ya, nii nui a fe zalaɠa ɠula nui ya, naa nɔnɔ ɠana.»<verse eid="NUM 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tolo vai é ʋilɛ anzanui ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 5:11"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 5:12"/>«Ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ, è ɠɛ ti ma: Wɛlɛ nii maanɛai wo kɛ, ni anzanui ta a sinigi yaavana, é ɠɛ bɛ ga ladalala nu. <verse eid="NUM 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 5:13"/>Ni zunu ɠili ka laana la, sinigi la ɠoleni ma, tɔɔzei é ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔʋɛ dɔɔɠuzu, zeele la ná, a zeele woo wo daalɔɠɔma, tama é la zoni ná kɛɛzuʋɛ, <verse eid="NUM 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 5:14"/>siɛgi zu tolo ɠigi ɠɛɛzu la sinigi ʋɛ, é zooʋi anzai ma, é ɠɛni ga ɠite vaa ɓaa zɛɛ, <verse eid="NUM 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 5:15"/>toɠa ʋaa la zalaɠa ɠula nui ʋɔ bɛ, moloi nii é ga wɔɔlezegi, toɠa naama ɠɛzɛi kilo saʋagɔ zeɠe, é kɛ bɛ ga zalaɠai, é mina gulɔ ʋu ma, é mina ansanse pu ma, mazɔlɔɔ toɠa ga tolo zalaɠai, vebɛ zalaɠai nii é faaɠaaza golai ma vai loozu nu ɠisu.<verse eid="NUM 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 5:16"/>«Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa maaɓuɠa ga anzanui seizu ɲadegai ʋa, é lo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠakala. <verse eid="NUM 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 5:17"/>Toɠa ziɛ ɲadegai zaɠa pɔlɔ liɠi zu, é seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ma vufiligi yɛʋɛ, é pu su. <verse eid="NUM 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 5:18"/>Toɠa anzanui ɠaalɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, é nɔungi vie, é vebɛ zalaɠai ve zea, nii é ná-faaɠaazagi ma ɠizɛsui wosu, naa ɠa é ga tolo zalaɠai, kɛlɛ zalaɠa ɠula nui ɓɔɠɔi ɠa foovoo ɗɛ wanai zo ya. <verse eid="NUM 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 5:19"/>Toɠa ɠɛ anzanui ma: ‹Ɗa ɠonazu ga: Ni zunu ɠili ge la dɛ laani ga ɗe, è la dɛ ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔni, è ʋa è-zinigi yaava, kaipa è zeini bɛ, naazu foovoo ɗɛ wanai nii mina faa ɲɔu nɔpɛ kɛ ga ɗe. <verse eid="NUM 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 5:20"/>Kɛlɛ tama, è zeiɗai ma zini bɛ, ni è è-zinigi yaava, è ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔ, è la zunu ɠili koba, <verse eid="NUM 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 5:21"/>ɗa ɠonazu, è yeezei niima voovooiti bu: Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI è-ɓalaiti fɔ, é è-ɠogi lɛ da, eyɛsu ɗa-nuɓusɛiti ta ɠɛna foovoo loa, ti pokɔɠɔ è ma. <verse eid="NUM 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 5:22"/>Foovoo ɗɛi tɛi ge lɔ è ɠoozu, é è-ɠogi lɛ da, é è-ɓalaiti fɔ!› Anzanui ɠa gooɠaaʋote, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Ungo, é ɠɛ ɠana!›<verse eid="NUM 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 5:23"/>«Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa foovoo vai niiti sɛʋɛ sɛʋɛi zu, é gba ziɛ wanai wu. <verse eid="NUM 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 5:24"/>Toɠa ziɛ wanai naa lo anzanui la, nii é ga foovoo ɗɛi, é kpɔle, é yei koozu. <verse eid="NUM 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 5:25"/>Aisa naa ʋa ɠɛ, zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa tolo zalaɠai zeɠe anzanui ya, é datɛɠɛ vai ma ʋoogi ɠɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, naa ʋolu é ʋaa la zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 5:26"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa zeeɲɛ gila seɠe ba, é makɛ ga ɠizɛsui, é gala, zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ, naa ʋoluma, é ziɛi ve anzanui ya, é kpɔle. <verse eid="NUM 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 5:27"/>Ni gaama ʋe ga é ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔʋɛ, é ɠɛ ga ladalala nui sinigi ʋɛ, foovoo ɗɛi ɠa yei koozuʋɛ, é naa wona, kogi lɛ da, kpalaiti ta vɔ, eyɛsu ná-nuɓusɛiti ta ɠɛna foovoo loa, ti pokɔɠɔ ma. <verse eid="NUM 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 5:28"/>Kɛlɛ ni anzanui la ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔni, ni ɲadegɛ, faa ɲɔu nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛa la, toɠa zoo é dounɠa zɔlɔɔ ʋolu.<verse eid="NUM 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 5:29"/>«Naa ɠa é ga tɔgi é ʋilɛ tolo vai ʋa, siɛgi zu anzanui é zini bɛ, é sinigi yaavazu la, é ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔ, <verse eid="NUM 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 5:30"/>ɓaa ni tolo yii a lɔɔna zunui ta yiima, é zooʋi anzai ma koloɠolo fai zu. Toɠa ɠula la Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠakala. Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa naa ɠɛ, nii kpein sɛʋɛai tɔgi zu. <verse eid="NUM 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 5:31"/>Anzazinigi ɠa ɠɛ ga sɔbalala nu naazu, anzanui ná-faaɠaaza golai ma ɠasɔi ɠa la tɔ ɓɔɠɔi unma.»<verse eid="NUM 5:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NUM 6"/>
  <para style="s">Nuiti ti ɓɔɠɔ ɠalivaazu <optbreak/> Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 6:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 6:2"/>«Ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ, è ɠɛ ti ma: Siɛgi zu zunui ta, ɓaa anzanui ta ɓɔɠɔ ɠalivaazu la Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, é ɓɔɠɔ ɠalivaa minazeɠegi wo, <verse eid="NUM 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 6:3"/>kɛni é ɓɔɠɔ zo, é mina dɔɔ ɓɔle, ɓaa kpɔɔle ani nɔpɛ a nu ɠaazulati, é mina dɔɔ laɓa ɓɔle, anɛɛ kpɔɔle ani laɓai ta ma zii nɔpɛ nii a nu zo, é mina leezɛin ma ɗɛi ta ɓɔle, é mina leezɛin ta mi, ma wundui ɓaa ma vɔɔi. <verse eid="NUM 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 6:4"/>Eyɛsu kalivaa ziɛgi ɓe, é mina leezɛin ʋaalobazuʋɛ tanɔpɛ mi, é zo ma ɠaei ma, é li ma ɠɔlɔ pɔ.<verse eid="NUM 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 6:5"/>«Naama yeeɠɛɠalai kpein daawu, niiti kalivaai ti zu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma, nɔungi mina wo, eyɛsu naama yeeɠɛɠalaiti daazeeli, toɠa ɲade niina, é nɔundeɠai ta kpɛlɛiti zɛ ná.<verse eid="NUM 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 6:6"/>«Yeeɠɛɠalai kpein daawu, é deveai ga é ɓɔɠɔ ɠaliva Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma, é mina maaɓuɠa nu ʋooma ʋa. <verse eid="NUM 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 6:7"/>É mina ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔ tɔgi letemazu, kɛɛɠɛ ʋɛ, ɓaa dee, ɓaa kɛɛɠɛloun zunu ʋɛ, ɓaa baazeela ʋɛ, ni naa ta a zaana, mazɔlɔɔ ná-kalivaa vai GALA ma, naama ʋoogi ɠa unmaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 6:8"/>Kalivaa ziɛgi kpein daawu, toɠa ga nu ɲadegai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ.<verse eid="NUM 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 6:9"/>«Ni nui ta a zaana koba kpaun, nɔungi é kalivaai, naa ɠɔzɔa, toɠa nɔungi wo ta kpɛlɛi, folo lɔfelasiɛi ma, ná-ɲade foloi. <verse eid="NUM 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 6:10"/>Foloi lɔsaʋasiɛi, toɠa li ga kpumago felegɔ ɓaa poopo kpokpa felegɔ zalaɠa ɠula nui ʋɔ, GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 6:11"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa gila kula ga koto gba zalaɠai, é zɔi ɠɛ ga gala zalaɠai, kotoi kɛai ga é yeevɔɔɠu poomai ʋa, naa gbaai ɠana. Naama voloi nɔ zu, toɠa nɔungi ɠaliva mɔnɔ ga niinɛ. <verse eid="NUM 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 6:12"/>Toɠa ɓɔɠɔ ɠaliva ʋolu ga niinɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma, ná-kalivaa yeeɠɛɠalaiti faa zu é ɠɛa deveni. Toɠa kona gila baala sinɛi ɠula ga faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠai. Foloiti ti leʋegai, é mina mɔ naati gaalu, tɔɔzei ná-kalivaa voloiti ti ɠɔzɔni.<verse eid="NUM 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 6:13"/>«Tɔgi ʋɛtɛ é ʋilɛ ɓɔɠɔ ɠalivaa vai ʋa: Foloi ná-kalivaa vai ɓesu la, naama voloi ta ʋaa la GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 6:14"/>Toɠa ná-zalaɠai ɠula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ: kona gila baala sinɛ ɠila, nii nɛɛʋuzu la ba, naa ɠa ɠɛ ga gala zalaɠai, ta kona gila baala saa ɠila, nii nɛɛʋuzu la ba, naa ɠa ɠɛ ga koto gba zalaɠai, ta baala sinɛ wolai, nii nɛɛʋuzu la ba, naa ɠa ɠɛ ga ziilɛi zalaɠai. <verse eid="NUM 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 6:15"/>Ɓului lɛʋɛ la su, toɠa ʋa ɓalaa ga naama ɓɔlɔgi: ɓului kpɛtɛai ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi, ta ɓulu lɛɛvɛiti lɛʋɛ la su, gulɔi ʋuai ma, é ɓɔ ta-vebɛ zalaɠaiti ba, ta ta-ʋuya zalaɠaiti. <verse eid="NUM 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 6:16"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa ʋa ga ti pɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠakala, é ná-koto gba zalaɠai ɠula, ta ná-gala zalaɠai. <verse eid="NUM 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 6:17"/>Toɠa baala sinɛ wolai ɠula ga ziilɛi zalaɠai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ta ɓului lɛʋɛ la su, naama ɓɔlɔgi, é kpɔ ná-vebɛ zalaɠai ʋa ta ná-puya zalaɠai. <verse eid="NUM 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 6:18"/>Nui kalivaai, naa ɠa nɔungi wo, GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ. Toɠa nɔundeɠai zeɠe ta kpɛlɛi, é ti ʋili abui ɠa, nii é ziilɛi zalaɠai wu. <verse eid="NUM 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 6:19"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa baala sinɛ wolai ma ɓakigi zeɠe, nii giliai, ta ɓulu ɠila lɛʋɛ la su, ta ɓulu lɛɛvɛ ɠila lɛʋɛ la su, é fe nui naa ya, nii é ɓɔɠɔ ɠalivaai, naa a ɓena ga nɔungi wo. <verse eid="NUM 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 6:20"/>Naa ʋolu, zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa ti latɛɠɛ vai ma ʋoogi ɠɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. Daamianigi naati ɲadegɛ, ta ɠɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nui nɔnɔ, é ɓɔ ma ɠekegi ta ma ɓalai ʋa, niiti ti ɠula ga datɛɠɛ vai ma ʋoogi. Naa ɠɛa ʋoluma, nii é ɓɔɠɔ ɠalivaai, naa ɠa zoo é dɔɔi ɓɔle niina.<verse eid="NUM 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 6:21"/>«Tɔgi ɠana é ʋilɛ naama nui ʋa, nii é ɓɔɠɔ ɠalivaazu, é minazeɠegi ɠɛai, nii maanɛai é kula ga zalaɠai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ kalivaa vai zu, gaalu ge la naa ʋa, nii a ɠɛ ga faanɛɛi ma zobogi bɛ ga é kɛ. Toɠa kɛ eɠɛʋelei a minazeɠe la, é ɓɔ naa ʋa, nii tɔgi bogai, é ʋilɛ nui ɠalivaa vai ʋa.»<verse eid="NUM 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tuyai loo ʋelei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 6:22"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 6:23"/>«Ɓɔɛ Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti pɔ, è ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Wɛlɛ, ʋele ɠa wa ɠɛ tuya loozu la Izilayɛle nuiti bɛ, wa ɠɛ ti ma:<verse eid="NUM 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 6:24"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI tuya loo wo ʋɛ, é wo makɛ!<verse eid="NUM 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 6:25"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yeezei wo wu ga pagɔ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 6:25">É zaalai la wo ma!<verse eid="NUM 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 6:26"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wɛlɛ wo ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 6:26">É ziilɛigi ve wo ʋɛ!›<verse eid="NUM 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 6:27"/>«Zekana ta wooɠula la mà, Izilayɛle nuiti ta-vaa zu, nɔ̀un nà, nà tuya loo ti ʋɛ.»<verse eid="NUM 6:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NUM 7"/>
  <para style="s">Botii lɔɔzei vai <optbreak/> seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 7:1"/>Yeei Moize ɓeni da ga seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai lo, é gulɔ ɲadegai ziɛni ma, é fe GALA bɛ. É kɛɛni ɠana nɔ ga ma zɔɔlaiti, naa ʋɛɛ zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ʋa, ta ma zɔɔlaiti. <verse eid="NUM 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 7:2"/>Pɛlɛyeɠe ɠundiɠiiti, ti ga bolodaiti ta-ɠundiɠiiti ti maaɓuɠani. Tɛiti ti loni gaalugi untuɠɔ. <verse eid="NUM 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 7:3"/>Ti ʋaani ga vebɛaniiti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ: wotolo lɔzita ti maazuʋɛai, ta nikɛ puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12), kundiɠi felegɔ wotolo ɠila, nikɛ ɠilagila. Ti ʋaani ga tiye seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai laaʋɛ.<verse eid="NUM 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 7:4"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 7:5"/>«Ta-vebɛaniiti so. Wotoloi niiti, ta nikɛi niiti, ta lɔ GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi ma wotii zu. Ɗa kaliva Levi nuiti ma, eɠɛʋelei ti ɠilagilagi ta-wotii ɓɛdɛma vai la.» <verse eid="NUM 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 7:6"/>Moize yeezeini wotoloiti bu, ta nikɛiti, é ti ɠaaɠwɛ Levi nuiti ba. <verse eid="NUM 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 7:7"/>É wotolo felegɔ zeɠeni, ta nikɛ naanigɔ, é fe Gɛɛlɛson ná-nuiti zea, eɠɛʋelei ta-wotii ɓɛdɛma vai ɠɛni la. <verse eid="NUM 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 7:8"/>É wotolo naanigɔ ta nikɛ lɔsaʋa ve Melali ná-nuiti zea, tɔɔzei botii liegɔi ʋa, ti ɠɛni kɛɛzu Itamaal yeezu, zalaɠa ɠula nui Aalɔn ná-doun zunui. <verse eid="NUM 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 7:9"/>É la ɠɛni ta veeni Keɠate ná-nuiti zea, mazɔlɔɔ naati ka ani ɲadegaiti ma ɠasɔi ɠɛni ti unma, kɛni ti ɓena ti zeɠe ɠɔma.<verse eid="NUM 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ laalao fai <optbreak/> ma vebɛaniiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 7:10"/>Kundiɠiiti ti ʋaani ga ta-vebɛaniiti, voloi ti zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ veeni la GALA bɛ, ti daalao, ti gulɔ ɲadegai ziɛ ma. Kundiɠiiti ti ʋaani ga ta-vebɛaniiti zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠakalaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 7:11"/>Názu ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni la Moize ma: «Kundiɠiiti ti ʋa ga ta-vebɛaniiti, ti ɠilagilagi pɛ, nu ɠila, folo ɠila, zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ laalao fai zu.»<verse eid="NUM 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 7:12"/>Folo mɔungi, Naason, Aminadaɓe ná-doun zunui ʋaani, é ná-vebɛanii lɛ. Naa ɠa é ɠɛni ga Zuda mavofodai nɔnɔi. <verse eid="NUM 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 7:13"/>É ʋaani ga tazai, é ga walii, buɲɛgi ga kilo ɠila ta tukpɛ (1,5), ta koko ɠila, é ga walii, buɲɛgi ga galamu undɔsaʋa (800), eɠɛʋelei seizu ɲadegai ma ɠɔɠɔgi ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu la, ti felegɔ pɛ daavega ɠɛni de ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi, é ʋa ɠɛ ga vebɛ zalaɠai, <verse eid="NUM 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 7:14"/>ta zanu aniɲaka ɠila, buɲɛgi ga galamu ungila puugɔ (110), daavegai ga ansansegi. <verse eid="NUM 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 7:15"/>É ʋaani ɓalaa ga nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpa gila, ta baala sinɛ wola ɠila, ta kona gila baala sinɛ ɠila, gala zalaɠai vai zu, <verse eid="NUM 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 7:16"/>ta boli zinɛ ɠila, koto gba zalaɠai vai zu, <verse eid="NUM 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 7:17"/>ta nikɛ felegɔ, ta baala sinɛ wola lɔɔlugɔ, ta boli zinɛ lɔɔlugɔ, ta kona gila baala sinɛ lɔɔlugɔ, ti ɠɛ ga ziilɛi zalaɠai. Aminadaɓe ná-doun zunui Naason ná-vebɛanii ɠɛni ga naa.<verse eid="NUM 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 7:18"/>Foloi velesiɛi, Netaneyɛle, Suaal ná-doun zunui, Isakaal mavofodaiti ta-ɠundiɠii ʋaani, é ná-vebɛanii lɛ. <verse eid="NUM 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 7:19"/>É ɠɛni ga tazai, é ga walii, buɲɛgi ga kilo ɠila ta tukpɛ (1,5), ta koko ɠila, é ga walii, buɲɛgi ga galamu undɔsaʋa (800), eɠɛʋelei seizu ɲadegai ma ɠɔɠɔgi ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu la, ti felegɔ pɛ daavega ɠɛni de ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi, é ʋa ɠɛ ga vebɛ zalaɠai, <verse eid="NUM 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 7:20"/>ta zanu aniɲaka ɠila, buɲɛgi ga galamu ungila puugɔ (110), daavegai ga ansansegi. <verse eid="NUM 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 7:21"/>É ʋaani ɓalaa ga nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpa gila, ta baala sinɛ wola ɠila, ta kona gila baala sinɛ ɠila, gala zalaɠai vai zu, <verse eid="NUM 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 7:22"/>ta boli zinɛ ɠila, koto gba zalaɠai vai zu, <verse eid="NUM 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 7:23"/>ta nikɛ felegɔ, ta baala sinɛ wola lɔɔlugɔ, ta boli zinɛ lɔɔlugɔ, ta kona gila baala sinɛ lɔɔlugɔ, ti ɠɛ ga ziilɛi zalaɠai. Suaal ná-doun zunui Netaneyɛle ná-vebɛanii ɠɛni ga naa.<verse eid="NUM 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 7:24"/>Foloi zaʋasiɛi, Eliyaɓe, Ɠelon ná-doun zunui, Zaɓulɔn mavofodaiti ta-ɠundiɠii ʋaani, é ná-vebɛanii lɛ. <verse eid="NUM 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 7:25"/>É ɠɛni ga tazai, é ga walii, buɲɛgi ga kilo ɠila ta tukpɛ (1,5), ta koko ɠila, é ga walii, buɲɛgi ga galamu undɔsaʋa (800), eɠɛʋelei seizu ɲadegai ma ɠɔɠɔgi ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu la, ti felegɔ pɛ daavega ɠɛni de ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi, é ʋa ɠɛ ga vebɛ zalaɠai, <verse eid="NUM 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 7:26"/>ta zanu aniɲaka ɠila, buɲɛgi ga galamu ungila puugɔ (110), daavegai ga ansansegi. <verse eid="NUM 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 7:27"/>É ʋaani ɓalaa ga nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpa gila, ta baala sinɛ wola ɠila, ta kona gila baala sinɛ ɠila, gala zalaɠai vai zu, <verse eid="NUM 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 7:28"/>ta boli zinɛ ɠila, koto gba zalaɠai vai zu, <verse eid="NUM 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 7:29"/>ta nikɛ felegɔ, ta baala sinɛ wola lɔɔlugɔ, ta boli zinɛ lɔɔlugɔ, ta kona gila baala sinɛ lɔɔlugɔ, ti ɠɛ ga ziilɛi zalaɠai. Ɠelon ná-doun zunui Eliyaɓe ná-vebɛanii ɠɛni ga naa.<verse eid="NUM 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 7:30"/>Foloi naanisiɛi, Elisuul, Sedeyuul ná-doun zunui, Luɓɛn mavofodaiti ta-ɠundiɠii ʋaani, é ná-vebɛanii lɛ. <verse eid="NUM 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 7:31"/>É ɠɛni ga tazai, é ga walii, buɲɛgi ga kilo ɠila ta tukpɛ (1,5), ta koko ɠila, é ga walii, buɲɛgi ga galamu undɔsaʋa (800), eɠɛʋelei seizu ɲadegai ma ɠɔɠɔgi ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu la, ti felegɔ pɛ daavega ɠɛni de ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi, é ʋa ɠɛ ga vebɛ zalaɠai, <verse eid="NUM 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 7:32"/>ta zanu aniɲaka ɠila, buɲɛgi ga galamu ungila puugɔ (110), daavegai ga ansansegi. <verse eid="NUM 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 7:33"/>É ʋaani ɓalaa ga nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpa gila, ta baala sinɛ wola ɠila, ta kona gila baala sinɛ ɠila, gala zalaɠai vai zu, <verse eid="NUM 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 7:34"/>ta boli zinɛ ɠila, koto gba zalaɠai vai zu, <verse eid="NUM 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 7:35"/>ta nikɛ felegɔ, ta baala sinɛ wola lɔɔlugɔ, ta boli zinɛ lɔɔlugɔ, ta kona gila baala sinɛ lɔɔlugɔ, ti ɠɛ ga ziilɛi zalaɠai. Sedeyuul ná-doun zunui Elisuul ná-vebɛanii ɠɛni ga naa.<verse eid="NUM 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 7:36"/>Folo lɔɔlusiɛi, Selumiyɛle, Sulisadayi ná-doun zunui, Simiyɔn mavofodaiti ta-ɠundiɠii ʋaani, é ná-vebɛanii lɛ. <verse eid="NUM 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 7:37"/>É ɠɛni ga tazai, é ga walii, buɲɛgi ga kilo ɠila ta tukpɛ (1,5), ta koko ɠila, é ga walii, buɲɛgi ga galamu undɔsaʋa (800), eɠɛʋelei seizu ɲadegai ma ɠɔɠɔgi ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu la, ti felegɔ pɛ daavega ɠɛni de ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi, é ʋa ɠɛ ga vebɛ zalaɠai, <verse eid="NUM 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 7:38"/>ta zanu aniɲaka ɠila, buɲɛgi ga galamu ungila puugɔ (110), daavegai ga ansansegi. <verse eid="NUM 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 7:39"/>É ʋaani ɓalaa ga nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpa gila, ta baala sinɛ wola ɠila, ta kona gila baala sinɛ ɠila, gala zalaɠai vai zu, <verse eid="NUM 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 7:40"/>ta boli zinɛ ɠila, koto gba zalaɠai vai zu, <verse eid="NUM 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 7:41"/>ta nikɛ felegɔ, ta baala sinɛ wola lɔɔlugɔ, ta boli zinɛ lɔɔlugɔ, ta kona gila baala sinɛ lɔɔlugɔ, ti ɠɛ ga ziilɛi zalaɠai. Sulisadayi ná-doun zunui Selumiyɛle ná-vebɛanii ɠɛni ga naa.<verse eid="NUM 7:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 7:42"/>Foloi lɔzitasiɛi, Eliasafe, Deyuwɛle ná-doun zunui, Gade mavofodaiti ta-ɠundiɠii ʋaani, é ná-vebɛanii lɛ. <verse eid="NUM 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 7:43"/>É ɠɛni ga tazai, é ga walii, buɲɛgi ga kilo ɠila ta tukpɛ (1,5), ta koko ɠila, é ga walii, buɲɛgi ga galamu undɔsaʋa (800), eɠɛʋelei seizu ɲadegai ma ɠɔɠɔgi ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu la, ti felegɔ pɛ daavega ɠɛni de ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi, é ʋa ɠɛ ga vebɛ zalaɠai, <verse eid="NUM 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 7:44"/>ta zanu aniɲaka ɠila, buɲɛgi ga galamu ungila puugɔ (110), daavegai ga ansansegi. <verse eid="NUM 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 7:45"/>É ʋaani ɓalaa ga nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpa gila, ta baala sinɛ wola ɠila, ta kona gila baala sinɛ ɠila, gala zalaɠai vai zu, <verse eid="NUM 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 7:46"/>ta boli zinɛ ɠila, koto gba zalaɠai vai zu, <verse eid="NUM 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 7:47"/>ta nikɛ felegɔ, ta baala sinɛ wola lɔɔlugɔ, ta boli zinɛ lɔɔlugɔ, ta kona gila baala sinɛ lɔɔlugɔ, ti ɠɛ ga ziilɛi zalaɠai. Deyuwɛle ná-doun zunui Eliasafe ná-vebɛanii ɠɛni ga naa.<verse eid="NUM 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 7:48"/>Foloi lɔfelasiɛi, Elisama, Amiyude ná-doun zunui, Efelayime mavofodaiti ta-ɠundiɠii ʋaani, é ná-vebɛanii lɛ. <verse eid="NUM 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 7:49"/>É ɠɛni ga tazai, é ga walii, buɲɛgi ga kilo ɠila ta tukpɛ (1,5), ta koko ɠila, é ga walii, buɲɛgi ga galamu undɔsaʋa (800), eɠɛʋelei seizu ɲadegai ma ɠɔɠɔgi ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu la, ti felegɔ pɛ daavega ɠɛni de ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi, é ʋa ɠɛ ga vebɛ zalaɠai, <verse eid="NUM 7:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 7:50"/>ta zanu aniɲaka ɠila, buɲɛgi ga galamu ungila puugɔ (110), daavegai ga ansansegi. <verse eid="NUM 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 7:51"/>É ʋaani ɓalaa ga nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpa gila, ta baala sinɛ wola ɠila, ta kona gila baala sinɛ ɠila, gala zalaɠai vai zu, <verse eid="NUM 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 7:52"/>ta boli zinɛ ɠila, koto gba zalaɠai vai zu, <verse eid="NUM 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 7:53"/>ta nikɛ felegɔ, ta baala sinɛ wola lɔɔlugɔ, ta boli zinɛ lɔɔlugɔ, ta kona gila baala sinɛ lɔɔlugɔ, ti ɠɛ ga ziilɛi zalaɠai. Amiyude ná-doun zunui Elisama ná-vebɛanii ɠɛni ga naa.<verse eid="NUM 7:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 7:54"/>Foloi lɔsaʋasiɛi, Gameliyɛle, Pedasuul ná-doun zunui, Manasé mavofodaiti ta-ɠundiɠii ʋaani, é ná-vebɛanii lɛ. <verse eid="NUM 7:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 7:55"/>É ɠɛni ga tazai, é ga walii, buɲɛgi ga kilo ɠila ta tukpɛ (1,5), ta koko ɠila, é ga walii, buɲɛgi ga galamu undɔsaʋa (800), eɠɛʋelei seizu ɲadegai ma ɠɔɠɔgi ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu la, ti felegɔ pɛ daavega ɠɛni de ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi, é ʋa ɠɛ ga vebɛ zalaɠai, <verse eid="NUM 7:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 7:56"/>ta zanu aniɲaka ɠila, buɲɛgi ga galamu ungila puugɔ (110), daavegai ga ansansegi. <verse eid="NUM 7:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 7:57"/>É ʋaani ɓalaa ga nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpa gila, ta baala sinɛ wola ɠila, ta kona gila baala sinɛ ɠila, gala zalaɠai vai zu, <verse eid="NUM 7:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 7:58"/>ta boli zinɛ ɠila, koto gba zalaɠai vai zu, <verse eid="NUM 7:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 7:59"/>ta nikɛ felegɔ, ta baala sinɛ wola lɔɔlugɔ, ta boli zinɛ lɔɔlugɔ, ta kona gila baala sinɛ lɔɔlugɔ, ti ɠɛ ga ziilɛi zalaɠai. Pedasuul ná-doun zunui Gameliyɛle ná-vebɛanii ɠɛni ga naa.<verse eid="NUM 7:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 7:60"/>Foloi laaʋuusiɛi, Aɓidan, Gideyɔni ná-doun zunui, Ɓɛnzamɛn mavofodaiti ta-ɠundiɠii ʋaani, é ná-vebɛanii lɛ. <verse eid="NUM 7:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 7:61"/>É ɠɛni ga tazai, é ga walii, buɲɛgi ga kilo ɠila ta tukpɛ (1,5), ta koko ɠila, é ga walii, buɲɛgi ga galamu undɔsaʋa (800), eɠɛʋelei seizu ɲadegai ma ɠɔɠɔgi ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu la, ti felegɔ pɛ daavega ɠɛni de ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi, é ʋa ɠɛ ga vebɛ zalaɠai, <verse eid="NUM 7:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 7:62"/>ta zanu aniɲaka ɠila, buɲɛgi ga galamu ungila puugɔ (110), daavegai ga ansansegi. <verse eid="NUM 7:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 7:63"/>É ʋaani ɓalaa ga nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpa gila, ta baala sinɛ wola ɠila, ta kona gila baala sinɛ ɠila, gala zalaɠai vai zu, <verse eid="NUM 7:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 7:64"/>ta boli zinɛ ɠila, koto gba zalaɠai vai zu, <verse eid="NUM 7:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 7:65"/>ta nikɛ felegɔ, ta baala sinɛ wola lɔɔlugɔ, ta boli zinɛ lɔɔlugɔ, ta kona gila baala sinɛ lɔɔlugɔ, ti ɠɛ ga ziilɛi zalaɠai. Gideyɔni ná-doun zunui Aɓidan ná-vebɛanii ɠɛni ga naa.<verse eid="NUM 7:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NUM 7:66"/>Foloi ʋuusiɛi, Ayiyezɛɛl, Amisadayi ná-doun zunui, Dan mavofodaiti ta-ɠundiɠii ʋaani, é ná-vebɛanii lɛ. <verse eid="NUM 7:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NUM 7:67"/>É ɠɛni ga tazai, é ga walii, buɲɛgi ga kilo ɠila ta tukpɛ (1,5), ta koko ɠila, é ga walii, buɲɛgi ga galamu undɔsaʋa (800), eɠɛʋelei seizu ɲadegai ma ɠɔɠɔgi ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu la, ti felegɔ pɛ daavega ɠɛni de ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi, é ʋa ɠɛ ga vebɛ zalaɠai, <verse eid="NUM 7:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NUM 7:68"/>ta zanu aniɲaka ɠila, buɲɛgi ga galamu ungila puugɔ (110), daavegai ga ansansegi. <verse eid="NUM 7:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NUM 7:69"/>É ʋaani ɓalaa ga nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpa gila, ta baala sinɛ wola ɠila, ta kona gila baala sinɛ ɠila, gala zalaɠai vai zu, <verse eid="NUM 7:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="NUM 7:70"/>ta boli zinɛ ɠila, koto gba zalaɠai vai zu, <verse eid="NUM 7:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NUM 7:71"/>ta nikɛ felegɔ, ta baala sinɛ wola lɔɔlugɔ, ta boli zinɛ lɔɔlugɔ, ta kona gila baala sinɛ lɔɔlugɔ, ti ɠɛ ga ziilɛi zalaɠai. Amisadayi ná-doun zunui Ayiyezɛɛl ná-vebɛanii ɠɛni ga naa.<verse eid="NUM 7:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="NUM 7:72"/>Folo puugɔ maazu ɠilasiɛi (11), Pagiyɛle, Wokelan ná-doun zunui Asɛɛl mavofodaiti ta-ɠundiɠii ʋaani, é ná-vebɛanii lɛ. <verse eid="NUM 7:72"/><verse number="73" style="v" sid="NUM 7:73"/>É ɠɛni ga tazai, é ga walii, buɲɛgi ga kilo ɠila ta tukpɛ (1,5), ta koko ɠila, é ga walii, buɲɛgi ga galamu undɔsaʋa (800), eɠɛʋelei seizu ɲadegai ma ɠɔɠɔgi ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu la, ti felegɔ pɛ daavega ɠɛni de ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi, é ʋa ɠɛ ga vebɛ zalaɠai, <verse eid="NUM 7:73"/><verse number="74" style="v" sid="NUM 7:74"/>ta zanu aniɲaka ɠila, buɲɛgi ga galamu ungila puugɔ (110), daavegai ga ansansegi. <verse eid="NUM 7:74"/><verse number="75" style="v" sid="NUM 7:75"/>É ʋaani ɓalaa ga nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpa gila, ta baala sinɛ wola ɠila, ta kona gila baala sinɛ ɠila, gala zalaɠai vai zu, <verse eid="NUM 7:75"/><verse number="76" style="v" sid="NUM 7:76"/>ta boli zinɛ ɠila, koto gba zalaɠai vai zu, <verse eid="NUM 7:76"/><verse number="77" style="v" sid="NUM 7:77"/>ta nikɛ felegɔ, ta baala sinɛ wola lɔɔlugɔ, ta boli zinɛ lɔɔlugɔ, ta kona gila baala sinɛ lɔɔlugɔ, ti ɠɛ ga ziilɛi zalaɠai. Wokelan ná-doun zunui Pagiyɛle ná-vebɛanii ɠɛni ga naa.<verse eid="NUM 7:77"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="NUM 7:78"/>Folo puugɔ maazu velesiɛi (12), Ayila, Enan ná-doun zunui, Nɛfɛtali mavofodaiti ta-ɠundiɠii ʋaani, é ná-vebɛanii lɛ. <verse eid="NUM 7:78"/><verse number="79" style="v" sid="NUM 7:79"/>É ɠɛni ga tazai, é ga walii, buɲɛgi ga kilo ɠila ta tukpɛ (1,5), ta koko ɠila, é ga walii, buɲɛgi ga galamu undɔsaʋa (800), eɠɛʋelei seizu ɲadegai ma ɠɔɠɔgi ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu la, ti felegɔ pɛ daavega ɠɛni de ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi, é ʋa ɠɛ ga vebɛ zalaɠai, <verse eid="NUM 7:79"/><verse number="80" style="v" sid="NUM 7:80"/>ta zanu aniɲaka ɠila, buɲɛgi ga galamu ungila puugɔ (110), daavegai ga ansansegi. <verse eid="NUM 7:80"/><verse number="81" style="v" sid="NUM 7:81"/>É ʋaani ɓalaa ga nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpa gila, ta baala sinɛ wola ɠila, ta kona gila baala sinɛ ɠila, gala zalaɠai vai zu, <verse eid="NUM 7:81"/><verse number="82" style="v" sid="NUM 7:82"/>ta boli zinɛ ɠila, koto gba zalaɠai vai zu, <verse eid="NUM 7:82"/><verse number="83" style="v" sid="NUM 7:83"/>ta nikɛ felegɔ, ta baala sinɛ wola lɔɔlugɔ, ta boli zinɛ lɔɔlugɔ, ta kona gila baala sinɛ lɔɔlugɔ, ti ɠɛ ga ziilɛi zalaɠai. Enan ná-doun zunui Ayila ná-vebɛanii ɠɛni ga naa.<verse eid="NUM 7:83"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="NUM 7:84"/>Voloi ti zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ laalaoni la, ti gulɔ ɲadegai ziɛ ma, kundiɠiiti ta-vebɛaniiti ti ɠɛni ga: wali laza puugɔ maazu fele (12), wali ɠoko puugɔ maazu fele (12), zanu aniɲaka puugɔ maazu fele (12). <verse eid="NUM 7:84"/><verse number="85" style="v" sid="NUM 7:85"/>Wali lazai ɠilagilagi wuɲɛgi ɠɛni ga kilo ɠila ta tukpɛ (1,5), wali ɠoko ɠilagilagi ɠɛni ga galamu undɔsaʋa (800), nii ti kulani, ti pɛ ge ɠɛni ga kilo ʋuufele maazu lɔfela ta tukpɛ (27,5) walii zu, eɠɛʋelei seizu ɲadegai ma ɠɔɠɔgi la. <verse eid="NUM 7:85"/><verse number="86" style="v" sid="NUM 7:86"/>Zanu aniɲakai ɠilagilagi wuɲɛgi ɠɛni ga galamu ungila puugɔ (110), daavegai ga ansansegi, nii ti kulani, naa kpein ge ɠɛni ga galamu waagila unsaʋagɔ (1.300) zanugi zu, eɠɛʋelei seizu ɲadegai ma ɠɔɠɔgi la. <verse eid="NUM 7:86"/><verse number="87" style="v" sid="NUM 7:87"/>Nii ti ʋaani la ga gala zalaɠai, naa ɠɛni ga: nikɛ zinɛ puugɔ maazu fele (12), baala sinɛ wola puugɔ maazu fele (12), kona gila baala sinɛ puugɔ maazu fele (12), é ʋɛɛ vebɛ zalaɠaiti ba, ti ɠɛni pɛɛzu ti ʋa. Ti ʋaani ɓalaa ga boli zinɛ puugɔ maazu fele (12), koto gba zalaɠai vai zu. <verse eid="NUM 7:87"/><verse number="88" style="v" sid="NUM 7:88"/>Ziilɛi zalaɠai ma vai zu, nii ti kulani, naa ɠɛni ga: nikɛ zinɛ ʋuufele maazu naanigɔ (24), baala sinɛ wola ʋuulɔzita (60), boli zinɛ ʋuulɔzita (60), ta kona gila baala sinɛ ʋuulɔzita (60). Vebɛaniiti kɛni ga naati, ti ɠulani zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ laalaosuʋɛ, ti ɓegai ma ga fe GALA bɛ, ti gulɔ ɲadegai ziɛ ma.<verse eid="NUM 7:88"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="NUM 7:89"/>Siɛgi zu Moize ɠɛni lɛɛzu la GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu, ga é ʋa ɓɔɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɔ, é ɠɛni wooi mɛnisu, é ɗa ɓɔɛ pɔ, é zeɠe kesui lakulugi maazuʋɛ seeluɓɛin felegɔiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛ, ti zeiɗai zeele woo ɠesui maazu. É ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu pɔ.<verse eid="NUM 7:89"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NUM 8"/>
  <para style="s">Fitinaiti sei ʋelei ti-zeizuʋɛti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 8:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 8:2"/>«Ɓɔɛ Aalɔn ʋɔ, è ɠɛ ma: Siɛgi zu è fitina lɔfelaiti seizu la ti-zeizuʋɛti, ɗa ti zei ga pagɔ, nii a kɛ ti-ma zezei ɗa ɠula fitina zei anii ɠakala, ʋelela ʋelei.»<verse eid="NUM 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 8:3"/>Aalɔn kɛɛni ɠana. É fitinaiti seini, fitina zei anii ɠa ʋelela ʋelei, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni la Moize ya. <verse eid="NUM 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 8:4"/>Pɛtɛ ʋelei fitina zei anii ɓɛtɛni la, é ɠɛni ga zanu doɠai, é zo kɔɠɔi ma, é lɛ ma wulu ʋuaiti pɔ. Ti fitina zei anii ɓɛtɛni, é zoloo naama ɠazaʋigi ma, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI dɛɛni ga Moize.<verse eid="NUM 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Levi nuiti fee vai GALA bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 8:5"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 8:6"/>«Levi nuiti seɠe Izilayɛle nuiti saama, è ti ɲade. <verse eid="NUM 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 8:7"/>Wɛlɛ ʋelegi ɗa ti ɲade da. Ɗa ziɛi vaza ti ma, nii é ga ɲade ɗɛi, ti kpekai zeɠe, ti ti-ɓusɛi maaʋɛ pɛ bo da, ti ta-zeɠeiti gba. Tɔgi letemazu ti ɲadegai ɠana. <verse eid="NUM 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 8:8"/>Ta nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpa gila seɠe, é ʋɛɛ vebɛ zalaɠai ʋa, nii soloogai ma, naa ɠa é ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi. Ɗɔun ɗa nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpagi velesiɛi zeɠe, é ɠɛ ga koto gba zalaɠai. <verse eid="NUM 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 8:9"/>Ɗa li ga Levi nuiti GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ, è Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti kpein toli. <verse eid="NUM 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 8:10"/>Ɗa Levi nuiti maaɓuɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa, Izilayɛle nuiti ti yeei la ti ma. <verse eid="NUM 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 8:11"/>Aalɔn ɠa Levi nuiti fe nɔ̀un bɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Izilayɛle nuiti bɛ, ta lɔ niina nà-botii zu. <verse eid="NUM 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 8:12"/>Levi nuiti ta yeei ʋɛɛ nikɛ zinɛ felegɔiti unmaʋɛ. Ɗa ti ɠula ga zalaɠai, gilagi ɠɛ ga koto gba zalaɠai, zɔi ɠɛ ga gala zalaɠai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, naa ɠa a kɛ koto gba zalaɠai ɠula Levi nuiti bɛ, eɠɛʋelei tɔgi la. <verse eid="NUM 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 8:13"/>Ɗa Levi nuiti to Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti kakala, è ti ve Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 8:14"/>Pele ɠana, ɗa Levi nuiti sei la yɛ, Izilayɛle nuiti saama, ta ɠɛ ga nɔ̀nɔiti. <verse eid="NUM 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 8:15"/>É zo názu ma niina, ta lɔ botii zu, ti ɗa kɛ GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 8:15">«Maanɛɛʋɛ è Levi nuiti ɲade, è ti ve bɛ̀ ɠana. <verse eid="NUM 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 8:16"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ti veeʋɛ bɛ̀ ɲɛgɛlɛin Izilayɛle nuiti saama, ga Izilayɛle nuiti ti-loun zunu mɔungiti potogi. Gè Levi nuiti seɠeʋɛ ga nɔ̀nɔiti. <verse eid="NUM 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 8:17"/>Mazɔlɔɔ doun zunu mɔungi kpein ka ga nɔ̀nɔ, Izilayɛle nuiti saama, nuiti ti-lointi, ta suaiti ti-ma yiʋoiti. Voloi gè doun zunu mɔungiti paani la Ezipete yooi zu, naama yeei ɠa gè ti makɛni la ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 8:18"/>Gè Levi nuiti seɠeʋɛ, ga Izilayɛle nuiti ti-loun zunu mɔungiti potogi. <verse eid="NUM 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 8:19"/>Gè ti veeʋɛ Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti bɛ Izilayɛle nuiti saama, ga ti Izilayɛle nuiti ta-wotii ɠɛ GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu, ta botii ɠɛ ti ya, koto gba vai zu. Naazu faa ɲɔu la ɠɛa ga Izilayɛle nuiti, mazɔlɔɔ ti la maaɓuɠazu seizu ɲadegai ʋa.»<verse eid="NUM 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 8:20"/>Moize ta Aalɔn, ta Izilayɛle nu ʋɛbɛi kpein, ti naa ɠɛɛni Levi nuiti ta-vaa zu, nii kpein Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni Moize ya, é ʋilɛ ti ʋa. <verse eid="NUM 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 8:21"/>Levi nuiti ti ɓɔɠɔ ɲadeni, ti ta-zeɠeiti gba. Aalɔn ti veeni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, é tɔgi ma ɲade fai laazeeli koto gba vai zu ti ʋɛ, nii a kɛ ti ɲade. <verse eid="NUM 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 8:22"/>Naa ʋoluma, Levi nuiti ti lɔɔni botii zu, GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu, Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti zeezu. Ti kɛɛni ta-vaa zu, eɠɛʋelei nɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni la Moize ya.<verse eid="NUM 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Levi nuiti ta-wotiɠɛ ɠonagi liegɔi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 8:23"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni mɔnɔ Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 8:24"/>«Levi nuiti ti kona ʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔi (25) zɔlɔɔgai, eyɛsu é lɛ zeemaazu, ta lɔ botii zu, ti ɗa kɛ GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="NUM 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 8:25"/>Zɔi a kona ʋuulɔɔlugɔ (50) zɔlɔɔna, naa ná-botii ɠa ɠwɛ niina, é la mɔ botii ɠɛa. <verse eid="NUM 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 8:26"/>Toɠa zoo é ɗa ɓɔ kɛɛɠɛleaiti ba GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu, naati ta-wotiiti su, kɛlɛ tɔ ɓɔɠɔi la mɔ botii ɠɛa. Pele ɠana ɗa Levi nuiti ta-boti vaiti so da.»<verse eid="NUM 8:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NUM 9"/>
  <para style="s">Pake fɛtii ɠula vai teʋebai zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 9:1"/>Konagi velesiɛi ma alu mɔungi ma, ti ɠula ʋoluma Ezipete yooi ʋa, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, Sinayi gizei ma leʋebai zu. É ɠɛni ma: <verse eid="NUM 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 9:2"/>«Kɛni Izilayɛle nuiti ti Pake fɛtii ɠula ma ɠu logai ma. <verse eid="NUM 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 9:3"/>Wa ma vɛtii ɠula niima alugi ma volo puugɔ maazu naanisiɛi (14) ma, kpɔkɔi. Wa ma vɛtii ɠula, eɠɛʋelei nɔ deveiti ta tɔgiti feai la, é lo ba.»<verse eid="NUM 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 9:4"/>Moize ɓɔɛni Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ ga ti Pake fɛtii ɠula. <verse eid="NUM 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 9:5"/>Ti ma vɛtii ɠulani Sinayi teʋebai zu, alu mɔungi ma volo puugɔ maazu naanisiɛi (14) ma, kpɔkɔi, ti kɛ nɔ kpein, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni la Moize ya.<verse eid="NUM 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nuiti ti la ɲadeni, <optbreak/> é ʋa zoloo tɔgi ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 9:6"/>Nui tanigaani ti ɠɛni ná, ti la zooni ti ʋa Pake fɛtii ta ɠula, tɔɔzei ti ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔni ga ti vɔɔɠu vai poomai ta ʋa. Ti liini ma volo ná nɔ Moize ʋɔ bɛ ta Aalɔn, <verse eid="NUM 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 9:7"/>ti ɠɛ ma: «Tɔgi maaʋele ma gi ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔʋɛ, tɔɔzei gi vɔɔɠuʋɛ poomai ʋa. Leeni vaa zu gi maa la nɛɛni, gi ʋa ʋa ga gá-vebɛanii, gi ʋa fe Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ ʋɔɔma, gá Izilayɛle nui zɔiti, ma ɠu logai ma?» <verse eid="NUM 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 9:8"/>Moize ɠɛni ti ma: «À maaɓɔun ʋɛ, gè li, gè woilo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ma, nii é bosu wa-vaa zu.»<verse eid="NUM 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 9:9"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Moize ma: <verse eid="NUM 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 9:10"/>«Ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ, è ɠɛ ti ma: Ni nui ta a ɠɛna ná wo zaama, niizu ɓaa yeeɠɛɠalaiti su ti ʋaazu, a ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔna tɔgi letemazu, tɔɔzei fɔɔɠuʋɛ poomai ta ʋa, ɓaa é siɛ ma ɠoozama, toɠa zoo nɔ é Pake fɛtii ɠula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɛbi vai ma. <verse eid="NUM 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 9:11"/>Alugi velesiɛi ma volo puugɔ maazu naanisiɛi (14) ma, kpɔkɔi ɠa ta Pake fɛtii ɠula la, ti baala ziʋoi mi, ta ɓului nii lɛʋɛ la su, ti pɛɛ tufa wanaiti ba. <verse eid="NUM 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 9:12"/>Ti mina tanɔpɛ zɛ sobu ʋa zeeli, ti mina ma ɠaei tanɔpɛ gale. Ta ziɛ eɠɛʋelei deveiti ti la, é lo Pakegi ʋa. <verse eid="NUM 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 9:13"/>Kɛlɛ zɔi nɔpɛ ɲadegai tɔgi letemazu, é la siɛ ma, é Pake fɛti vai ɠɛ ga faalakobai, naa ɓe ka leʋe ná-nuɓusɛiti ba, ná-faaɠaazagi ma ɠasɔi ɠa la unma, tɔɔzei é la ná-vebɛanii veeni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ ma ɠui ma. <verse eid="NUM 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 9:14"/>Ni wɛɛin ta ɠa zeini wo zaama, é pɔ é Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-Pake fɛtii ɠula, toɠa ziɛ eɠɛʋelei Pakegi ma lɔgi la ta ma leveiti. Seikɔɠɔma nu ʋɛɛ zou nu ʋa, niima lɔ gila kpe nɔ ɠa a zei ti ma.»<verse eid="NUM 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tonaɓiingi nii é ɠɛni ga poogi ga <optbreak/> GALA ka ti zaama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 40:34-38">Ɛgezɔde 40:34-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 9:15"/>Voloi seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ɠaalɔni da, nii zeele woo ɠesui ɠɛni bu, tonaɓiingi ʋɛɛni ma. Kpɔkɔi, eyɛsu sobui, é ɠɛni seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ma eɠɛ abuzogi. <verse eid="NUM 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 9:16"/>É ɠɛni ɠana nɔ yeenɔpɛ su: Foloi, tonaɓiingi ɠɛni ʋɛɛzu seɠe ʋɛlɛi ma, kpidii ma ziɛgi zu, é ɠɛni ɠulazu eɠɛ abuzogi. <verse eid="NUM 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 9:17"/>Siɛgi zu tonaɓiingi ɠɛni wuzeɠezu la, é zeɠe seɠe ʋɛlɛi maazu, názu ɠa Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɓena lii la, ʋɛ a la lona ná, ti ʋu miná. <verse eid="NUM 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 9:18"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-devei ɠa Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɓena zeɠe la ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ, a la ná-devei veena, ti ʋu mɔnɔ. Ni nɔ tonaɓiingi ɠa dɛ ʋɛɛni seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ma, ti la ɠɛni zeɠezu ná. <verse eid="NUM 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 9:19"/>Anɛɛ tonaɓiingi a la lɛbi pa seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai maazu suɠooza, Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɠɛni ɠolozu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ʋɛ, ti la ɠɛni liizu. <verse eid="NUM 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 9:20"/>Tanisu tonaɓiingi ɠɛni foloi tanigaani nɔ ɠɛɛzu seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai maazuʋɛ, siɛnɔpɛ su, ti ɠɛni nɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-devei maaɓɔunsu, ti ʋa ʋu ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ, ɓaa ti ʋa wuzeɠe ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 9:21"/>Tanisu ɓalaa tonaɓiingi ɓena yɛ adaʋɛ ta nɔ kpɔkɔi eyɛsu geelaalao, ɓaa é kɛ nɔ ga folo ɠila, kpidi ɠila, é ɓena wuzeɠe nɔ feya, Izilayɛle nuiti ti wuzeɠe ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 9:22"/>Ni a la yɛna seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ma, é kɛ ga folo felegɔ, ɓaa alu gila, ɓaa é wola lɛbi suɠooza, Izilayɛle nuiti ti la ɠɛni ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ valibosu, eyɛsu tonaɓiingi wuzeɠe. <verse eid="NUM 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 9:23"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓena devei ve pɛ, Izilayɛle nuiti ti ʋa ʋu ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ, ɓaa ti ʋa wuzeɠe ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ. Ti ɠɛni ti-losuʋɛti kpein kɛɛzu, ti ɠolo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-deveiti bɛ, eɠɛʋelei é devei veeni la Moize ya.<verse eid="NUM 9:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NUM 10"/>
  <para style="s">Puʋu felegɔiti <optbreak/> ti ɓɛtɛni ga walii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 10:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 10:2"/>«Puʋu felegɔ ɓɛtɛ ga wali loɠai. Ta ɠɛ è ya, è ɗa bɛbɛi loli da, é ɠɛ ga poogi nuiti bɛ siɛ wo fai zu, wa ɠɛna zeɠea wo-ʋuuzuʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 10:3"/>Ta puʋu felegɔiti fɛɛna ʋɔɔma, bɛbɛi kpein ka maaɓɔ è ʋɔ bɛ, GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 10:4"/>Ni ta puʋu gilagi nɔ vɛɛna, Izilayɛle ɠundiɠiiti, bolodama ɠundiɠiiti nɔ ɠa, ta maaɓɔ è ʋɔ bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 10:5"/>Siɛgi zu wo fɛɛzu la ga goo ɠaaɓaingai, niiti ti ʋuuni folo ɠulazu ʋelei, naati ta wuzeɠe, ti siɛi lɔɔzei. <verse eid="NUM 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 10:6"/>Siɛgi zu wo fɛɛzu la ga goo ɠaaɓaingai, ná zeizu velesiɛi, niiti ti ʋuuni nu yeezazu ʋelei, naati ta wuzeɠe, ti siɛi lɔɔzei. Puʋu goo ɠaaɓaingai ɠa ɠɛ ga siɛ wo fai ma ʋoogi. <verse eid="NUM 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 10:7"/>Wa ɗa fɛ ɓalaa bɛbɛi loli fai ma, kɛlɛ názu wo la puʋugi vɛa ga goo ɠaa ʋa ɓain.<verse eid="NUM 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 10:8"/>«Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ti ga Aalɔn mavofodaiti, naati gila nɔ ɠa ta ɗa puʋugiti fɛ. Naa ɠa ɠɛ ga ɠɔoɠɔ tɔgi, wo-mavofodaiti kpein bɛ.<verse eid="NUM 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 10:9"/>«Siɛgi zu wa ɠɛna la wa-yooi zu, wa ɠɛna lia kɔɔmaʋɛ wo zili nuiti daalɔɠɔma, ti laalɛ wo wu, wa puʋugi vɛ, wo goo ɠaaɓain, naazu nà ɠizɛ wo zu, nɛ̀i gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wa-ƓALAGI. Nà wo unmɔɔ, gè wo ɠula wo zili nuiti zea. <verse eid="NUM 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 10:10"/>Wa puʋugi vɛ, wa-ɠoozunɛ voloiti, ta wa-volo wolaiti, ta alugi ma volo mɔungiti, siɛgi zu wo gala zalaɠaiti kulazu la, ta ziilɛi zalaɠaiti. Toɠa ɠɛ ga zaɓui, wa-ƓALAGI ɠizɛ wo zu. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI.»<verse eid="NUM 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">Siɛi é Zo Sinayi Gizei Ma, <optbreak/> é Zeeli Moaɓe Ɠwɛpelemaʋɛ</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="NUM 10:11-21:35">10:11—21:35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle nuiti seɠe vai <optbreak/> Sinayi gizei ʋɔ bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 10:11"/>Konagi velesiɛi, ma alugi velesiɛi ma volo ʋuufelegɔi (20) ma, tonaɓiingi zeɠeni seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai maazu, nii zeele woo ɠesui ɠɛni bu. <verse eid="NUM 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 10:12"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti zeɠeni Sinayi teʋebai zu, ti li, eɠɛʋelei devei veeni la, é ʋilɛ ta-ziɛ vai ʋa. Tonaɓiingi loni Palan teʋebai zu. <verse eid="NUM 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 10:13"/>Ma mɔun ge ɠɛni ga nii ti ʋa zeɠe ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-devei ɠɛni la, nii ti sɔlɔɔni Moize ya.<verse eid="NUM 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 10:14"/>Nu ɓulugi nii gaalɛai ba Zuda ná-poogi wu, naa ɠa mɔunpa é ʋilɛni pelei ma. Zuda mavofodaiti ta-nu ɓulugiti ti ɠɛni Aminadaɓe ná-doun zunui Naason ná-deveiti bu. <verse eid="NUM 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 10:15"/>Isakaal mavofodaiti ta-nu ɓulugi ɠɛni Suaal ná-doun zunui Netaneyɛle ná-deveiti bu. <verse eid="NUM 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 10:16"/>Zaɓulɔn mavofodaiti ta-nu ɓulugi ɠɛni Ɠelon ná-doun zunui Eliyaɓe ná-deveiti bu.<verse eid="NUM 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 10:17"/>Naa ʋoluma, ti seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ɠulakulani ba, Gɛɛlɛson mavofodaiti ta Melali mavofodaiti ti seɠe, ti ʋilɛ pelei ma.<verse eid="NUM 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 10:18"/>Naa ʋolu, nu ɓulugi nii gaalɛai ba Luɓɛn ná-poogi wu, naa ʋilɛni pelei ma. Luɓɛn mavofodaiti ta-nu ɓulugi ɠɛni Sedeyuul ná-doun zunui Elisuul ná-deveiti bu. <verse eid="NUM 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 10:19"/>Simiyɔn mavofodaiti ta-nu ɓulugi ɠɛni Sulisadayi ná-doun zunui mavofodai Selumiyɛle ná-deveiti bu. <verse eid="NUM 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 10:20"/>Gade mavofodaiti ta-nu ɓulugi ɠɛni Deyuwɛle ná-doun zunui Eliasafe ná-deveiti bu.<verse eid="NUM 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 10:21"/>Naa ʋolu, Keɠate mavofodaiti ti ada ɲadegai ma zɔɔlaiti seɠeni, ti ʋilɛ pelei ma. Levi nui zɔiti ti ɠɛni seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ʋɛɛpɛɛzu ba, ti to, aisa Keɠate nuiti ti ʋa ʋa.<verse eid="NUM 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 10:22"/>Naa ʋolu, nu ɓulugi nii gaalɛai ba Efelayime ná-poogi wu, naa ʋilɛni pelei ma. Efelayime mavofodaiti ta-nu ɓulugi ɠɛni Amiyude ná-doun zunui Elisama ná-deveiti bu. <verse eid="NUM 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 10:23"/>Manasé mavofodaiti ta-nu ɓulugi ɠɛni Pedasuul ná-doun zunui Gameliyɛle ná-deveiti bu. <verse eid="NUM 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 10:24"/>Ɓɛnzamɛn mavofodaiti ta-nu ɓulugi ɠɛni Gideyɔni ná-doun zunui Aɓidan ná-deveiti bu.<verse eid="NUM 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 10:25"/>Naa ʋolu, nu ɓulugi nii gaalɛai ba Dan ná-poogi wu, naa ɠɛni ga ʋoluzui, é ʋilɛ pelei ma. Dan mavofodaiti ta-nu ɓulugi ɠɛni Amisadayi ná-doun zunui Ayiyezɛɛl ná-deveiti bu. <verse eid="NUM 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 10:26"/>Asɛɛl mavofodaiti ta-nu ɓulugi ɠɛni Wokelan ná-doun zunui Pagiyɛle ná-deveiti bu. <verse eid="NUM 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 10:27"/>Nɛfɛtali mavofodaiti ta-nu ɓulugi ɠɛni Enan ná-doun zunui Ayila ná-deveiti bu.<verse eid="NUM 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 10:28"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ta-nu ɓulugiti ta-zeikpasui ɠɛni ga ná, siɛgi zu ta la ɠɛna siɛi woga da, ti ʋa zeɠe ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ.<verse eid="NUM 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 10:29"/>Moize ɠɛni nɛkoi, Madiyan nui Leyuwɛle ná-doun zunui Woɓaɓe ma: «Gá ga li zooi naa zu, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI minazeɠeni la gi ʋɛ, ga toɠa fe gi ʋɛ. Ʋa, ade li, ɗa ɠɛ gaanɛ zu, mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI minazeɠeni ga toɠa faa ʋagɔ ɠɛ Izilayɛle ʋɛ.» <verse eid="NUM 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 10:30"/>Woɓaɓe ɠɛni ma: «Gè la ʋilɛsu è ʋolu. Zìimai ɠa ga gè ɠale ma nà-zooi zu, nà-nuɓusɛiti pɔ bɛ.» <verse eid="NUM 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 10:31"/>Moize ɠilini ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Nà è maanɛɛnɛzu, mina zeɠe gi ʋolu, mazɔlɔɔ è teʋebai nii zuɠwɛɛ gola, ta adaʋɛti gá zoo gi ʋu ná, ɗa ɠɛ gi ʋɛ ga totuɠɔi. <verse eid="NUM 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 10:32"/>Ni ɗa gi maazaana, ɗa ɗɔnɔ zɔlɔɔ naama ani ʋagɔiti kpein su, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋaazu ti veezu gi ʋɛ.»<verse eid="NUM 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 10:33"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti liini, ti zeɠe Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-gizei ma, ti folo saʋagɔ ziɛi woni. Naama volo saʋagɔiti daawu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-minazeɠe kesui ɠɛni loni ti luɠɔ, é ɗa ada ɠaiziɛ ti ʋɛ, ʋɛ ta looɠo ná. <verse eid="NUM 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 10:34"/>Siɛgi zu ta la zeɠena la ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-tonaɓiingi ɠɛni zɛlɛsu ti maazu foloi.<verse eid="NUM 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 10:35"/>Minazeɠe kesui lii la ɠilagila, Moize ɠɛni GALA falii ɠɛɛzu, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Wuzeɠe Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è zili nuiti ti vaza, niiti ti è wɔinzeɠezu, naati ti ʋela è ʋa!» <verse eid="NUM 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 10:36"/>Siɛgi zu ta la zeina la, é ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ma: «Ʋa ʋolu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa-nuɓusɛ ɓulu mɔinmɔingiti saama, ti ga Izilayɛle nuiti!»<verse eid="NUM 10:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NUM 11"/>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle nuiti ta-unsuyeli lo fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 11:1"/>Foloi ta, nuɓusɛiti ti unsuyelii loni, ti daazeeli Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma. Siɛgi zu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI naa mɛnini da, é yiiɠaawanani. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-abui soni ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ, é naa ɠobaʋɛ ɠala. <verse eid="NUM 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 11:2"/>Nuɓusɛiti ti wooɠulani Moize ma, naa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maanɛɛnɛ, abui za. <verse eid="NUM 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 11:3"/>Ti naama adaʋɛ laasei pɛɛni ga Taɓeyela (nii poluʋɛ ga «ada ɠalai»), mazɔlɔɔ ná ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-abui soni ná ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ.<verse eid="NUM 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bɛbɛi suai maaloli fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 11:4"/>Nu ɠiligiti ti ɠɛni ga wɛɛinti Izilayɛle nuiti saama, naati ti-yiimaʋɛ laaveni ga gaazuɠulapɔ vaiti. Názu ɠa Izilayɛle nuiti ti tɔɔzeini la ga kpeei loa, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Ni gá la zoo gi ɗa sua zɔlɔɔ, gi mi! <verse eid="NUM 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 11:5"/>Gá ɠitoozu kalei zu, gi ɠɛni miizu Ezipete yooi zu, geya la ba, ta kilikamaiti, ta pasetɛkegiti, ta yaʋa laa kpaazagiti, ta yaʋa ɓaazagiti, ta yaʋa ʋɛlɛʋɛlɛgiti! <verse eid="NUM 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 11:6"/>Niizu gá ga ɠaɲa. Gi ʋalagɛ anii kpein ma, kɛni nɔ manegi, yeenɔpɛ nɔ manegi!»<verse eid="NUM 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 11:7"/>Manegi ma ɠazaʋigi ɠɛni eɠɛ kɔliandelegi ma ɠaei, gaazuʋɛ ɠɛ eɠɛ gulu mana maku nɛɛnɛgi, daaseigi ga ɓedɛliwume. <verse eid="NUM 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 11:8"/>Nuɓusɛiti ti ɓena ɠula, ti vaza, ti ɗa zɛʋɛ, ti ɗa golowolo ga daamiani siɠa ɠɔtui, ɓaa ti siɠa kodai zu, ti gili diɠii zu, ti kɛ ga ɓulu ʋɛlɛʋɛlɛgi. Ná-nɛɛi ɠɛai eɠɛ ɓulu ʋɛlɛʋɛlɛgi gulɔi ba. <verse eid="NUM 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 11:9"/>É ɠɛni ʋuuzu kpidii ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ, ta nɔɗai.<verse eid="NUM 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 11:10"/>Pɛlɛyeɠei ɠilagilagi ʋuuni ná-seɠe ɠotai laaʋɛ, é ɗa kpeei loo. Moize nuɓusɛiti gooi mɛnini, ti ɗa wɔlɔ. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wola yiiɠaawanani. Moize wola ɠaazuɠilini. <verse eid="NUM 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 11:11"/>É ɠɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma: «Lee vaa ɲɔu ɠa è kɛɛzu ga ze, nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui? Lee vaa zu gè la zaalai zɔlɔɔni è ɠaazu? Ɗa zoo ɠale è niima nuɓusɛiti kpein ta-ɠasɔi la nɔ̀un unma? <verse eid="NUM 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 11:12"/>Nà ɠa gè niima nuɓusɛiti kpein sɔlɔɔga ɓaa? Nà ɠa gè ti ʋilɛga etea ɓaa, è ɠɛɛzu mà: ‹Ti ʋɛɛ yiila, eɠɛʋelei doun deei a ɗa ná-ɲiimiɓɔlegi zo la,› gè naa ɠɛ eyɛsu gi zeeli naama yooi zu, nii è ma minazeɠe boni ti-mɛmɛwolani bɛ, ga ɗa feezu ti ya? <verse eid="NUM 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 11:13"/>Mini ɠa nà suai zɔlɔɔna, gè ʋa gaaɠwɛ niima nuɓusɛiti kpein ba, ti wɔlɔzu kòba, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Suai ve gi ya, gi mi!› <verse eid="NUM 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 11:14"/>Gè la zooga, nà ɠila ko, gè ʋa niima nuɓusɛiti kpein ta-ɠasɔi zeɠe. Gola wuiʋɛ mà! <verse eid="NUM 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 11:15"/>Ni ɗa pɔ è zaalai la mà, zɛ̀nvui zeɠe, aisa è ʋa sò ɠani, gè mina nà-maanɔɠɔi ɠa!»<verse eid="NUM 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kundiɠi ʋuulɔfelaiti (70) pɛɛ vai <optbreak/> Moize ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 11:16"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Moize ma: «Zunu ʋuulɔfela (70) ɠaalɛ ba bɛ̀, è ti ɠula Izilayɛle ɠundiɠiiti saama, zunui niiti è ti ɠwɛɛ ga ta ga sɔɓelama nua, nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠundiɠiiti. Ʋa ga tiye GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ, wo lo ná ʋɔɔma, wa tiye. <verse eid="NUM 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 11:17"/>Nà yeizu ná, gè ɓɔɛ è ʋɔ, nà ta zeɠe zɛnvui naa ʋa, nii é è ʋa, gè fe ti ya, naa ɠa a kɛ, wo niima nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠasɔi zeɠe ʋɔɔma, ɗa ɠila è mina mɔ seɠe. <verse eid="NUM 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 11:18"/>Ɗa ɠɛ nuɓusɛiti ma: ‹À ɓɔɠɔ ɲade lina voloi vaa zu, wa ʋaazu suai miizu, tɔɔzei wo wɔlɔʋɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI woizu ga: Ee, ni gá la zoo gi sua mi! Gi ɠɛa gaanɛ zu Ezipete yooi zu! Naa ɠa é ba, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ʋaazu suai veezu wo ya, wo mi. <verse eid="NUM 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 11:19"/>Wa ʋaazu miizu ɠɔ, é la nɔ ga folo ɠila faa, ɓaa folo felegɔ, ɓaa folo lɔɔlugɔ, ɓaa folo puugɔ, ɓaa folo ʋuufelegɔ (20). <verse eid="NUM 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 11:20"/>Kɛlɛ wa yɛsu miizu eyɛsu alu gila, eyɛsu é ɠula wo-zokpai zu, unpili wɔin ɗa wo zo. Mazɔlɔɔ wo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛlɛʋiliga, nii é wo zaama, wo wɔlɔa gaazu, wo ɠɛ ma: Leeni vaa zu deɠɛmu gi zeɠeai Ezipete yooi zu?› »<verse eid="NUM 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 11:21"/>Moize gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Niima nuɓusɛiti gè ti zaama, gá ga zunu waaundɔzita (600.000), è minazeɠe naati bɛ ga ta suai mi alu gila daawu ɲɛgɛlɛin! <verse eid="NUM 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 11:22"/>Ta baalagiti paa ti ʋɛ, ta nikɛiti, é ʋa kula ɠɛ ti ʋa? Anɛɛ ni nu ɠa kpoloɗɛi wu ɠaleiti kpein kpɛɛzu ti ʋɛ, toɠa kula ɠɛ nɛi?»<verse eid="NUM 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 11:23"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yee ɠa wola ɓuɠa ɓaa? Su la mɔ ɠoozani, ɗa naa ɠa, ni ɠite ʋe, ɓaa zɛɛ ʋe, ga ni nii nà bo, toɠa ɗa ʋilɛ su.»<verse eid="NUM 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA Zɛnvui yei vai <optbreak/> kundiɠi ʋuulɔfelaiti (70) ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 11:24"/>Moize ɠulani, é Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawooi wo nuɓusɛiti ma. Naa ʋolu, é zunu ʋuulɔfelaiti (70) gaalɛɛni ba, ta-ɠundiɠiiti saama, é ti lo seɠe ʋɛlɛi maaɠoolii zu. <verse eid="NUM 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 11:25"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yeini tonaɓiingi zu, é ɓɔɛ pɔ. Zɛnvui nii é ɠɛni Moize ʋa, é ta zeɠeni naa ʋa, é fe kundiɠi ʋuulɔfelaiti (70) zea. Siɛgi zu zɛnvui yeini la ti ma, ti tɔɔzeini ga ɓɔɛa eɠɛ GALA goo wo nua, kɛlɛ ti la ɠɛni lɛbini ga.<verse eid="NUM 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 11:26"/>Zɛnvui yeini ɓalaa zunu felegɔ ma ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ, gilagi laaseigi ɠɛni ga Eledade, zɔi laaseigi ɠɛ ga Medade. Zɛnvui yeini ti ma, mazɔlɔɔ ti-laaseigi zɛʋɛni zunu ʋuulɔfelaiti (70) saama, kɛlɛ ti la ɠɛni zeɠeni ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ, ti ʋa li seɠe ʋɛlɛi ʋɔ bɛ. Ti tɔɔzeini ga ɓɔɛa eɠɛ GALA goo wo nua. <verse eid="NUM 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 11:27"/>Zunu loungoi ta ɓizɛni, é li, é bo Moize ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Eledade ta Medade ta GALA ná-kulakɛlɛma vaiti bosu ade-ʋuuzuʋɛ.» <verse eid="NUM 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 11:28"/>Nun ná-doun zunui Zozuwe, nii é ɠɛni ga Moize ná-kpɔba nui, é zo ná-doungo ziɛgi zu ma, naa ɠɛni ma: «Màliɠii, Moize, pele leʋe ti luɠɔ, ti ɓe naa ɠɛɛzu!» <verse eid="NUM 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 11:29"/>Moize ɠɛni ma: «Ɗa mà lolo ɠulazu? Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-Zɛnvui yei Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti pɛ ma, ti ɠɛ ga GALA goo wo nuiti!» <verse eid="NUM 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 11:30"/>Moize ta Izilayɛle ɠundiɠiiti ti ɠaleni ma ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ.<verse eid="NUM 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kakalogiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 11:31"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI fiilɛi leʋeni kpoloɗɛi ɠa, é ʋa ga kakalogiti, ti ʋu ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ maaɠoolii zu, é ɠaku ná ma ga folo ɠila siɛ liegɔ. Ti zooi maaɓidini, eyɛsu é lɛ ga mɛtɛlɛ ɠila sɔligɔ. <verse eid="NUM 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 11:32"/>Nuɓusɛiti ti loni ɠɔɠɔma naama voloi, ta ma ɓidii kpein, ta mɔnɔ poluma voloi ɲɛgɛlɛin, ti ɗa kakalogiti so. Nu nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni seɠeni, é ʋa yei kilo waasaʋagɔ (3.000) zeeɠɔɠɔwu. Ti ti zuvieni, ti ɗa fɔ ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ maaɠoolii kpein su. <verse eid="NUM 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 11:33"/>Suai naa yɛni nɔ ti-laaʋɛ, ti la dɛ numani, eyɛsu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiiɠaawana ti ma, é maanɔɠɔi ʋɛɛ nuɓusɛiti ba. <verse eid="NUM 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 11:34"/>Ti naama adaʋɛ laaseigi ʋɛɛni ga Kiɓelɔte-Ɠataava (nii poluʋɛ ga «gaazuɠulapɔ ɠabayeɠeiti»), mazɔlɔɔ miná ɠa ti naati ma mɔinmɔin maaɠuluni ná, niiti daamii vai ma ɠaazuɠulapɔi ti zoni.<verse eid="NUM 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 11:35"/>Nuɓusɛiti ti siɛi lɔɔzeini, ti zeɠe Kiɓelɔte-Ɠataava, ti ʋa Ɠaselɔte, ti ʋu miná.<verse eid="NUM 11:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NUM 12"/>
  <para style="s">Miliyame ta Aalɔn <optbreak/> ti vaa vai Moize ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 12:1"/>Moize Kuse anzanui ta zeɠeni ga anza. Miliyame ta Aalɔn ti ɠɛni vaazu ma. <verse eid="NUM 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 12:2"/>Ti ɠɛni ma: «Moize ɠila nɔ lɛi Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛai pɔ! Kpɔɛʋɛ gá ɓalaagi gi ʋɔ!» Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ti-wooi mɛnini. <verse eid="NUM 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 12:3"/>Tama Moize ɠɛni ga ɓɔɠɔmaayei nu gola, é leʋe nui pɛ ba eteai zu. <verse eid="NUM 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 12:4"/>Gaamago nɔ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI Moize lolini, naa ʋɛɛ Aalɔn ʋa, ta Miliyame, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À ɠomi, wo saʋagɔ, GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi ʋɔ bɛ.» Ti liini ná. <verse eid="NUM 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 12:5"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yeini tonaɓiingi zu, é lo seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ maazuʋɛ. É Aalɔn ta Miliyameni tolini. Ti felegɔ ti ʋaani. <verse eid="NUM 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 12:6"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «À woilo, nii é bɛ̀, gè bo wo ma! Siɛgi zu GALA goo wo nu a ɠɛna la wo zaama, nà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà ɗa ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛ la kulakɛlɛmai zu, gè ɓɔɛ pɔ segi zu. <verse eid="NUM 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 12:7"/>Kɛlɛ é la ɠana ga nà-botiɠɛ nui Moize, nii é ga lada nui nà-pɛlɛwu vai kpein su. <verse eid="NUM 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 12:8"/>Nà ɗa ɓɔɛ pɔ ga wooi koleai, faa zuɓidi laade, gè ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛ la, é kà. Lee vaa zu wo la luani, wo ɗa va nà-botiɠɛ nui Moize ma?»<verse eid="NUM 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 12:9"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiiɠaawanani ti laalɔɠɔma, é li. <verse eid="NUM 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 12:10"/>Tonaɓiingi zeɠeni nɔ feya seɠe ʋɛlɛi maazuʋɛ, geei ʋɛɛ Miliyame ma mɛɛ, koleai eɠɛ kobe kolegi. Aalɔn wɛlɛni ba, é ka ga é ɠɛa ga gee nu. <verse eid="NUM 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 12:11"/>Aalɔn ɠɛni Moize ma: «Soma màliɠii, è mina gá-ɠotoi ma ɠasɔi la gi unma, gi kɛai ɠimalalai zu! <verse eid="NUM 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 12:12"/>Ee, de-ʋaazeelai mina ɠɛ eɠɛ doin saai, é ʋa zɔlɔɔ, nii kpusɛi ta luulaai, aisa é ʋa zɔlɔɔ.»<verse eid="NUM 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 12:13"/>Moize wooɠulani Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Ee, GALA, nà è maanɛɛnɛzu, kɛdɛ!»<verse eid="NUM 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 12:14"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Moize ma: «Ni kɛɛɠɛ a la ɠɛni laaɗɛi ʋuuni gaazuʋɛ, é la ɓena yɛ ma unfegi zu, eyɛsu folo lɔfela? À kpɛ, é ɠula wo-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋa, é kɛ su ga folo lɔfela, naa ʋoluma, wa yeezei bu niina, é ʋa wo zaama.»<verse eid="NUM 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 12:15"/>Miliyame ɠulani ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋa, é kɛ ga folo lɔfela. Nuɓusɛiti ti yɛni ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ, eyɛsu é ʋa, é lɔ ti zaama mɔnɔ. <verse eid="NUM 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 12:16"/>Naa ʋoluma, ti zeɠeni Ɠaselɔte, ti li, ti ʋu Palan teʋebai zu.<verse eid="NUM 12:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NUM 13"/>
  <para style="s">Kanaan yooi zuʋɛtɛ fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 1:19-33">Tɔ Sɛʋɛi Velesiɛi 1:19-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 13:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 13:2"/>«Zunuiti teʋe, ti Kanaan yooi zuʋɛtɛ, gè feezu Izilayɛle nuiti bɛ. Yeelo nu ɠila ba, bolodai ɠilagilagi zu, seɠeai kundiɠiiti saama.»<verse eid="NUM 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 13:3"/>Moize Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi zoni, é zunuiti teʋeni, ti zeɠe Palan teʋebai zu. Izilayɛle nuiti ta-ɠundiɠiiti ti ɠɛni ga tiye.<verse eid="NUM 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 13:4"/>Ti-laaseigiti ti ɠɛni ga:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 13:4">Luɓɛn ná-bolodai nɔnɔi ɠɛni ga: Samua, Zakuul ná-doun zunui.<verse eid="NUM 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 13:5"/>Simiyɔn ná-bolodai nɔnɔi ɠɛni ga: Safate, Woli ná-doun zunui.<verse eid="NUM 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 13:6"/>Zuda ná-bolodai nɔnɔi ɠɛni ga: Kalɛɓe, Yefuné ná-doun zunui.<verse eid="NUM 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 13:7"/>Isakaal ná-bolodai nɔnɔi ɠɛni ga: Yigale, Zozɛfe ná-doun zunui.<verse eid="NUM 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 13:8"/>Efelayime ná-bolodai nɔnɔi ɠɛni ga: Wozé, Nun ná-doun zunui.<verse eid="NUM 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 13:9"/>Ɓɛnzamɛn ná-bolodai nɔnɔi ɠɛni ga: Palati, Lafu ná-doun zunui.<verse eid="NUM 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 13:10"/>Zaɓulɔn ná-bolodai nɔnɔi ɠɛni ga: Gadiyɛle, Sodi ná-doun zunui.<verse eid="NUM 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 13:11"/>Zozɛfe ná-bolodai nii é ga Manasé nɔnɔi, naa ɠɛni ga: Gadi, Susi ná-doun zunui.<verse eid="NUM 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 13:12"/>Dan ná-bolodai nɔnɔi ɠɛni ga: Amiyɛle, Gemali ná-doun zunui.<verse eid="NUM 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 13:13"/>Asɛɛl ná-bolodai nɔnɔi ɠɛni ga: Setuul, Mikayɛle ná-doun zunui.<verse eid="NUM 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 13:14"/>Nɛfɛtali ná-bolodai nɔnɔi ɠɛni ga: Naaɓi, Vɔfesi ná-doun zunui.<verse eid="NUM 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 13:15"/>Gade ná-bolodai nɔnɔi ɠɛni ga: Geyuwɛle, Maki ná-doun zunui.<verse eid="NUM 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 13:16"/>Zunuiti daaseigiti kana, niiti Moize ti leʋeni ga ti Kanaan yooi zuʋɛtɛ. Moize Nun ná-doun zunui Wozé laasei pɛɛni ga Zozuwe.<verse eid="NUM 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 13:17"/>Moize ti leʋegai ma ga ti Kanaan yooi zuʋɛtɛ, é ɠɛni ti ma: «À leʋe ga lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazuʋɛ yooi zu ʋele, wo zeeli gize yooi ʋɔ pelei, <verse eid="NUM 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 13:18"/>wo ɠida zooi ná-fai wu. Wo ka ʋelei é la, ta nuiti ti zeini ná, wo ti ʋɛtɛ ni ti zulogɛ, ɓaa ni zɛbɛ la ti ya, ni ti mɔinʋɛ, ɓaa ni ti la mɔinni. <verse eid="NUM 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 13:19"/>Wo zooi ʋɛtɛ, ʋɛ ti zeini ná, ni pagɛ, ɓaa ni ɲɔuʋɛ, ta-laa wolaiti ta ɠale, ni siɠigi ɠa ti ma, ɓaa ni é la ti ma, <verse eid="NUM 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 13:20"/>ani ɓɛtɛ you ʋe, ɓaa ani la ɓɛtɛa ga, gulua ta ga, ɓaa ti la ná? À yiilɔɔ! À zooi zu wulu waai tanigaa zeɠe.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 13:20">É ɠɛni ga leezɛn waa mɔungi ma yeeɠɛɠalai.<verse eid="NUM 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 13:21"/>Zunui naati ti liini, ti zooi zuʋɛtɛ, é tɔɔzei Sin teʋebai zu eyɛsu Leɠɔɓe, Leɓo-Ɠamate ɠobaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 13:22"/>Ti lɛɛni lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazuʋɛ yooi zu, ti zeeli Eɓelɔn. Ayiman ta Sesayi ta Talamayi nuiti ti zeini ná, Anake mavofodaiti. Eɓelɔn laai loni, é kɛ ga kona dɔfela aisa Soan ʋa lo, nii é Ezipete yooi zu. <verse eid="NUM 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 13:23"/>Ti zeeliai ma Esekɔle nɛmɛi zu, ti leezɛn ansaɠɔgi ma ɓeke gila teʋeni ba, nii leezɛn ɠɔpɔgi ɠɛni zɛlɛni ba. Bui ʋelei ma, ti dɔɔni gului ɠa, nu felegɔ da ɠɔma, ti seɠe. Ti gelenade wului ma waaiti seɠeni ɓalaa, ta kooleɠoolegiti. <verse eid="NUM 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 13:24"/>Ti naama adaʋɛ laasei pɛɛni ga Esekɔle nɛmɛi (nii poluʋɛ ga «anii ɠɔpɔgi ma nɛmɛi»), tɔɔzei leezɛn ɠɔpɔgi ʋa, Izilayɛle nuiti ti teʋeni ná. <verse eid="NUM 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 13:25"/>Ti ɠaleni ma, ti zeɠe zooi ʋɛtɛsuʋɛ, folo ʋuunaanigɔ (40) ɠa ti kɛɛni.<verse eid="NUM 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nɛnɛ puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12) <optbreak/> ta-ʋoluvaawo gooi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 13:26"/>Ti ʋaani, ti Moize ɠa, ta Aalɔn, ta Izilayɛle ʋɛbɛi kpein, Palan teʋebai zu Kadɛse. Ti ʋoluvaawo ti ma ga nii kpein ti kaani, ti zooi zu wulu waaiti dɛɛ ga tiye. <verse eid="NUM 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 13:27"/>Wɛlɛ poluvaawo gooi ʋa, ti boni Moize ma: «Gi zeelini zooi naa zu, ʋɛ è gi leʋeni ná. Gaamazu, zou ʋe, ʋɛ nɔnɔi ta kɔin gulɔi ʋooʋaai ná, naa wulu waaiti pɛtɛ. <verse eid="NUM 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 13:28"/>Kɛlɛ-o, nuiti ti zeini ná, ti wola zuɓaaʋɛ. Taaiti bɔɔlɔʋɛ, siɠigi ti ma. Gi Anake mavofodaiti ɓalaa pɛtɛgɛ ná. <verse eid="NUM 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 13:29"/>Amalɛke nuiti ta zeini nu yeezazu ʋelei. Ɠɛte nuiti, ta Yeɓuse nuiti, ta Amool nuiti ta zeini gize yooi zu. Kanaan nuiti ta zeini Kpoloɗɛ Wolai laaʋɛ, ta Zuludɛn nɛmɛi zu.»<verse eid="NUM 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 13:30"/>Názu ɠa Kalɛɓe ɠaaɓaani la ga é nuɓusɛiti gaaɓɛ, niiti ti tɔɔzeini niina ga wuzeɠea Moize laalɔɠɔma. É ɠɛni ti ma: «Ade li ná! Ada vɔni zooi ma, de seɠe. Mazɔlɔɔ ma ɠaaɓaai ɠa ade ya.»<verse eid="NUM 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 13:31"/>Kɛlɛ zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga ná-siɛpoluiti, naati ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ma: «Ma zobo ge la ade ʋɛ, de ʋa laalɛ nuuma nuɓusɛiti bu, mazɔlɔɔ ti zuɓaaʋɛ de ʋa.» <verse eid="NUM 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 13:32"/>Ti tɔɔzeini Izilayɛle nuiti gaazu ga zooi naa ná-fai zuvalaga, nii ti liini ti ka, ti ɠɛni ma: «Zooi nii gi suɓizaai, gi suʋɛtɛ, toɠa ga zooi nii é naati paazu, niiti ti ʋaazu, ti zei ga. Nuiti kpein gi ti ɠaai ná, ta ga nu ɠoozagiti. <verse eid="NUM 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 13:33"/>Gi kooza nuiti kaaʋɛ ná ɓalaa, Anake mavofodaiti, nu ɠoozagiti ma zuwuzui. Gi ɠɛa ti ɠoba, é ɠɛ gi ɠaazu, eɠɛ gá ɠɛ ga kotogiti nɔ, tiya ɓalaa, ti ɠaazu, gi ɠɛni eɠɛ kotogaa nɔ!»<verse eid="NUM 13:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="NUM 14"/>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle nuiti kpaka fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 14:1"/>Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti kpein ti kpeei looni, ti ɲii wɔlɔzu naama ɓidii. <verse eid="NUM 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 14:2"/>Ti unsuyelii loni Moize ta Aalɔn laalɔɠɔma. Nuɓusɛiti kpein ti ɠɛni ti ma: «Ni suɠila gi zaani Ezipete yooi zu, ɓaa teʋebai zu! <verse eid="NUM 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 14:3"/>Leeni vaa zu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI pɔ ga é ʋa ga giye niima yooi zu, ti ʋa gi ʋaa ga kɔɔi, gi-anzaiti, ta gi-lointi, ti ʋa ɠɛ ga gi zili nuiti daamianigi? É la ɠɛa gi ʋɛ ga faa ʋagɔ ɓaa, ga gi ɠale ma Ezipete yooi zu?» <verse eid="NUM 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 14:4"/>Ti ɠilagilagiti ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ɓɔɠɔ ma: «Ade yeelo kundiɠi ɠila ba, de ɠale ma Ezipete yooi zu!»<verse eid="NUM 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 14:5"/>Moize ta Aalɔn ti looni zooi ma, ti laaʋɛɛ Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti kpein gaazu, ti ɠaalɛai ba. <verse eid="NUM 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 14:6"/>Zozuwe, Nun ná-doun zunui, ta Kalɛɓe, Yefuné ná-doun zunui, nu felegɔi naati, ti ɠɛni zɔiti ba, tɛiti ti liini zooi zuʋɛtɛsu, ti felegɔ ti ta-zeɠeiti balini ga kidaaʋiligi maaʋele ma, <verse eid="NUM 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 14:7"/>ti ɠɛ Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti kpein ma: «Zooi nii gi suɓizaai, gi suʋɛtɛ, toɠa ga zou ʋagɔ wola. <verse eid="NUM 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 14:8"/>Ni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ade ʋɛ, toɠa ade lɔ zooi naa zu, é fe de ʋɛ, ʋɛ nɔnɔi ta kɔin gulɔi ʋooʋaai ná. <verse eid="NUM 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 14:9"/>Toɠa nɔ ga, à mina wuzeɠe Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laalɔɠɔma. À mina lua zooi naa zu nuiti ba, mazɔlɔɔ ta ɠɛɛzu nɔ ga ade-ɠɔnɔ, niinigi é ɠɛa ti makɛsu, naa maaɠooza ti ʋa, tama Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ade ʋa. Deɠɛmu, à mina lua ti ʋa pa!»<verse eid="NUM 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 14:10"/>Nuɓusɛiti kpein ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu, ti ti zɔɔ ga kɔtui, ti ti ʋaa, kɛlɛ gaamanɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-lɛbiyai ɠulani kɛlɛma Izilayɛle nuiti bɛ GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi maazu. <verse eid="NUM 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 14:11"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Moize ma: «Niima nuɓusɛiti ta yɛsu bɛ̀lɛʋilisu eyɛsu siɛgi ɓɛgele zu? Ta yɛsu ɠɛlɛzu ga ti mina la dà, eyɛsu siɛgi ɓɛgele zu? Anɛɛ gè poo gola mɔinmɔin kɛa ti zaama. <verse eid="NUM 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 14:12"/>Nà ɗɔfɔ zeeɓɛi ʋɛɛzu ti ʋa, gè ti-ma zuwu ɠaaleʋe, naa ʋolu nà zii ɓɛtɛzu, é ɠula è zu, nii sɛbɛi a wɔɔlɔ, ta é mɔin Izilayɛle ʋa!»<verse eid="NUM 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 14:13"/>Moize Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ezipete nuiti ti kwɛɛ ga ɗa ɠa è niima nuɓusɛiti kula ta-yooi ʋa ga è-zɛbɛi. <verse eid="NUM 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 14:14"/>Ti bogɛ niima you zu nuiti kpein ma. Ti mɛnigɛ ga ɗa, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa niima nuɓusɛiti saama, ɗa ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛzu kpezekele. Ti mɛnigɛ ga ɗa-lonaɓiingi ɠa zɛlɛni ti maazu, ɗa losu ti luɠɔ foloi tonaɓiingi zu, ta kpidii abuzogi zu. <verse eid="NUM 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 14:15"/>Ni ɗa niima nuɓusɛi kpein paana eɠɛ nu ɠila, zooiti ti è-ɠɛɛ vaiti ma woomɛniga, è ti ɠɛai, naati ta ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu ma: <verse eid="NUM 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 14:16"/>‹Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI la ɓena zobo sɔlɔɔ, é ʋa li ga nuɓusɛi tɛiti zooi naa zu, nii é ma ɠona woni ga é fe ti ya, naa ɠa é kɛai é ti ʋaa teʋebai zu.› <verse eid="NUM 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 14:17"/>Niizu Màliɠii, nà è maanɛɛnɛzu, ɗa-zobogi ɠula kɛlɛma ga zɛbɛi pɛ, eɠɛʋelei è boni la gi ma ga: <verse eid="NUM 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 14:18"/>‹Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yii la ɗa ga ɠula fala, kpɛtɛʋɛ wooɠɛɠiladai zu, toɠa ɗa faaɠaaza golai zuvaayɛ ta tɔ koloɠologi. Kɛlɛ é la ɗa ga sɔba nui levea ga sɔbalala nu, toɠa doun kɛɛɠɛiti ta-vaa ɲɔi ʋotokula ti-lointi ma, eyɛsu yamani zaʋasiɛi ɓaa naanisiɛi.› <verse eid="NUM 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 14:19"/>Nà è maanɛɛnɛzu, niima nuɓusɛiti suvaayɛ ga ta-vaaɠaaza golai, ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai maaʋele ma, eɠɛʋelei nɔ è niima nuɓusɛiti suvaayɛsu da, è zo ti ɠula voloi ma Ezipete yooi ʋa, é zeeli za ma.»<verse eid="NUM 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 14:20"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni ma: «Gè ti maavaayɛga, eɠɛʋelei è falia la. <verse eid="NUM 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 14:21"/>Kɛlɛ eɠɛʋelei gè vulua la ga ɠite, nɛ̀i gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà-lɛbiyai eteai pɛ daavegai, gè ɠonaa ga: <verse eid="NUM 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 14:22"/>Nui niiti ti nà-lɛbiyai ɠaani, ta poo golaiti gè ti ɠɛɛni Ezipete yooi zu, ta teʋebai zu, ti sùɠɔɠɔ daa ɠɛa puu, ti la ɠoloni bɛ̀, <verse eid="NUM 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 14:23"/>ti taɠila kpalaa ge la zooi naa ɠaa, nii gè ma minazeɠe boni, gè ɠona su ti-mɛmɛwolani bɛ. Tɛiti kpein ti bɛ̀lɛʋiligai, taɠila kpalaa ge la lɛa ná. <verse eid="NUM 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 14:24"/>Kɛlɛ nà-botiɠɛ nui Kalɛɓe, ɠi kili ka é ɠɛni naa ʋɛ, kɛɛʋɛ bɛ̀ ga wooɠɛɠila nu eyɛsu ɠɔ. Naa ɠa é ba, nà lɛ ga naa, ma yooi zu, ʋɛ é liini ná, mavofodaiti ta naa zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="NUM 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 14:25"/>Tɛi Amalɛke nuiti ta Kanaan nuiti ti zeini nɛmɛi zu, lina sobu nɔ, wa nuiti gaaɠalesu ma teʋebai zu, wo li ga Seeli Kpoloɗɛi ʋɔ pelei.»<verse eid="NUM 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 14:26"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Moize ta Aalɔn ma: <verse eid="NUM 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 14:27"/>«Nà niima nuɓusɛ ɲɔiti zɛsu ná, ti ɗa unsuyelii lo dàalɔɠɔma, eyɛsu yeelɛ? Mazɔlɔɔ gè Izilayɛle nuiti ta-unsuyeliiti mɛnigɛ, ti tosu dàalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="NUM 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 14:28"/>Ɠɛ ti ma: ‹Eɠɛʋelei gè vulua la ga ɠite, nà wo zosu, eɠɛʋelei wo wooiti bogai la gòizu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. <verse eid="NUM 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 14:29"/>Wa za teʋebai tɛi su, wo-ma ʋoomaiti ti la ná. Wɔiti dɔin ti wo ɠaaluni, é zo kona ʋuufelegɔ (20) ma, é lɛ zeemaazu, mazɔlɔɔ wo unsuyelii logɛ dàalɔɠɔma, <verse eid="NUM 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 14:30"/>wo la mɔ lɔa zooi naa zu, nii gè ma minazeɠegi woni, gè ɠona ga wa zei ga, kɛni Kalɛɓe, Yefuné ná-doun zunui, ta Zozuwe, Nun ná-doun zunui. <verse eid="NUM 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 14:31"/>Kɛlɛ wo-lointi, wo ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ma ta ɠɛ ga wo zili nuiti daamiani, nà liizu ga tiye ma yooi zu, ta zooi naa ɠwɛɛ, nii wo bɛlɛʋiligai. <verse eid="NUM 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 14:32"/>Kɛlɛ wɔun, wa zaazu teʋebai tɛi su. <verse eid="NUM 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 14:33"/>Wo-lointi ta ɠɛɛzu ga teʋeteʋe nuiti, kona ʋuunaanigɔ (40) laawu. Ta wa-wooʋaladai ma zalai zɔlɔɔ ɠana, nii wo kɛa ga ze, eyɛsu wo pɛ wo za teʋebai zu. <verse eid="NUM 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 14:34"/>Folo ʋuunaanigɔ (40) ɠa wo kɛɛni zooi zuʋɛtɛsuʋɛ, tama, wa wa-vaaɠaaza golai ma zalai zɔlɔɔ kona ʋuunaanigɔ (40) laawu, kona gila, folo ɠilagi ʋotogi zu. Wa kwɛɛ naazu ga wa ɠɛlɛna bà, wa ɓala.› <verse eid="NUM 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 14:35"/>Nà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà ɠa kpɔ̀ɛai. Ungo, zekana gè ʋaazu niima nuɓusɛ ɲɔiti sosu da, ti ɠiliai ʋa, ti wuzeɠe dàalɔɠɔma. Ta ɲɛɛlɛzu teʋebai tɛi su, ti za ná.»<verse eid="NUM 14:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 14:36"/>Zunuiti Moize ti leʋeni ga ti zooi zuʋɛtɛ, ti ɠalegai ma ma, ti nuɓusɛiti unsuleʋeni, ti unsuyelii lo daalɔɠɔma, ga zooi zu vaiti suvala pelei. <verse eid="NUM 14:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 14:37"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zunui naati doɠani, ti za, tɔɔzei ti zooi ná-fai zuvalani. <verse eid="NUM 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 14:38"/>Zunuiti ti liini zooi zuʋɛtɛsu, ti pɛ ti zaani, kɛni Zozuwe, Nun ná-doun zunui, ta Kalɛɓe, Yefuné ná-doun zunui, naati nɔ ɠa ti yɛni vulua.<verse eid="NUM 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Woozotala niinɛi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 1:41-46">Tɔ Sɛʋɛi Velesiɛi 1:41-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 14:39"/>Siɛgi zu Moize Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawooi woni da Izilayɛle nuiti ma, nuɓusɛiti gola ɠaalɛini. <verse eid="NUM 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 14:40"/>Poluma zobui, ti wuzeɠeni ga sobuzobui, ti lɛ gize yooi ʋɔ pelei, ti ɠɛ ma: «Gi koto ɠɛa, kɛlɛ gá ga lɛ, ʋɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛai, é ʋilɛ ná ʋa.»<verse eid="NUM 14:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 14:41"/>Moize ɠɛni ti ma: «Leeni vaa zu wo zeɠezu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ʋolu? Wo la zobo sɔlɔɔga! <verse eid="NUM 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 14:42"/>À mina lɛ, mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI la wo zaama. Wo zili nuiti ti mina wo ʋaa fuun. <verse eid="NUM 14:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 14:43"/>Mazɔlɔɔ wa Amalɛke nuiti kaazu luɠɔ, ta Kanaan nuiti, wa ɓɔɠɔ ʋaa. Ʋelei wo ʋoluavegai da Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa, é la mɔ ɠɛa wo ʋa.»<verse eid="NUM 14:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 14:44"/>Ti daani mɛɛ, kɛni ti lɛɛni gize yooi ʋɔ pelei, kɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-minazeɠe kesui la ɠɛni liini, ta Moize ɓalaa, ti ʋa ɠula ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋa. <verse eid="NUM 14:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 14:45"/>Amalɛke nuiti ta Kanaan nuiti ti ɠɛni ʋuuni gize yooi zu, naati ti yeini, ti Izilayɛle nuiti sakpe, ti ti ɠoloɠolo, ti ʋilɛ ti ʋolu, eyɛsu ti li, ʋɛ ná laaseigi ga Ɠɔɔlema.<verse eid="NUM 14:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="NUM 15"/>
  <para style="s">Tɔgi é lo vebɛaniiti ba, <optbreak/> ta puya zalaɠaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 15:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 15:2"/>«Ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ, è ɠɛ ti ma: Siɛgi zu wo zeelizu la zooi naa zu, gè ʋaazu feezu wo ʋɛ ga wo zei ná, <verse eid="NUM 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 15:3"/>wa ɠɛna pɔ wo zalaɠaiti kula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, nii abui galazu, gala zalaɠai, ɓaa minazeɠe daazeeli zalaɠai, ɓaa vebɛanii nui daai ɠisu, ɓaa zalaɠai nii é ʋilɛsu wa-ƓALA fai ma vɛti voloi ta ʋa, wa kɛ ga nikɛi, ɓaa baalagi, ɓaa bolii, nii é ɠalazu, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 15:4"/>Wa vebɛ zalaɠaiti kpɔ zalaɠa zua ɠilagilagi pɛ ba. Wa ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi kilo saʋagɔ ɓɔ ba, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi litɛlɛ ɠila ta tukpɛ (1,5), <verse eid="NUM 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 15:5"/>ta puya zalaɠai ɠɛ ga dɔɔi litɛlɛ ɠila ta tukpɛ (1,5), ni zalaɠa zuai ɠa ga baala ziʋoi. <verse eid="NUM 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 15:6"/>Ni baala sinɛ wolai ʋe, wa vebɛ zalaɠai ɠɛ ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi kilo lɔzita, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi litɛlɛ felegɔ, <verse eid="NUM 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 15:7"/>ta puya zalaɠai ɠɛ ga dɔɔi litɛlɛ felegɔ. Naama zalaɠaiti makugi ɠa nɛɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 15:8"/>Ni nikɛ zinɛi ɠa wo kulazu ga zalaɠai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, é ɠɛ ga gala zalaɠai, ɓaa minazeɠe daazeeli zalaɠai, ɓaa é ɠɛ ga ziilɛi zalaɠai, <verse eid="NUM 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 15:9"/>wa ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi kilo taaʋuugɔ ɓɔ ba ga vebɛ zalaɠai, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi litɛlɛ saʋagɔ, <verse eid="NUM 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 15:10"/>ta puya zalaɠai ɠɛ ga dɔɔi litɛlɛ saʋagɔ. Zalaɠai ʋe, nii abui galazu, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ.<verse eid="NUM 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 15:11"/>«Pele ɠana wo maanɛai wo nikɛ zinɛ zalaɠai ɠula la, ɓaa baala sinɛi, ɓaa baala sinɛ yiʋoi, ɓaa boli yiʋoi. <verse eid="NUM 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 15:12"/>Toganii mɔin ʋa ʋele-o-ʋele, vebɛanii ɠa ʋɛɛ ti ɠilagilagi ʋa. <verse eid="NUM 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 15:13"/>Izilayɛle nu ɓɔɔɓɔgi kpein maanɛɛʋɛ é naama lɔgi zo, a ɠɛna zalaɠai ɠulaa, nii abui galazu, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 15:14"/>Tɔ gilagi naa nɔ ɠa a zei nuɓusɛi pɛ ma, ga faa ɠila nɔ anɛɛ wɛɛin é ga seikɔɠɔma nui, ɓaa ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wo zaama wo-mavofodaiti kpein su, ni ta pɔ ti zalaɠa ɠula, nii abui galazu, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 15:15"/>Nuɓusɛi pɛ ka tɔgi naa zo, ga faa ɠila nɔ toɠa la ɛsɛ gilagilagi pɛ ma, Izilayɛle nu ʋɛɛ seikɔɠɔma nu ʋa. Naa ɠa ɠɛ ga ɠɔoɠɔ tɔgi, wo-mavofodaiti kpein bɛ, ta seikɔɠɔma nui, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. <verse eid="NUM 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 15:16"/>Tɔ gilagi, ta deve ɠilagi nɔ ɠa a ɠɛ ná wo pɛ bɛ, wa seikɔɠɔma nui.»<verse eid="NUM 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓulu mɔungiti ma vebɛanii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 15:17"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Moize ma: <verse eid="NUM 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 15:18"/>«Ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ, è ɠɛ ti ma: Siɛgi zu wo zeelizu la zooi zu, ʋɛ gè losu wo luɠɔ, wo li ná, <verse eid="NUM 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 15:19"/>wo ma you zu ɓului miizu, wa gilazu zeɠe ba ga vebɛanii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 15:20"/>Siɛgi zu wo ɓului mɔsu da, wa ma mɔungi zeɠe ba, wo kula bɛ̀ ga zalaɠai, eɠɛʋelei wa ɗa molo niinɛi nɔnɔi zeɠe ba la. <verse eid="NUM 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 15:21"/>Vebɛanii ɠana, wa fe Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, é ɠula wa-vuului ná-botii ɠɛa mɔungi zu, wo-mavofodaiti kpein su.<verse eid="NUM 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Teʋezea ɠotoi ma zalaɠai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 15:22"/>«Ni wa koto ɠɛɛna, wo la gaaɠilini ma, wo la tɔgi niiti kpein soni, niiti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ti veai Moize ya, <verse eid="NUM 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 15:23"/>é zo naama voloi ma Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI deveiti feeni la, eyɛsu é li wo-mavofodaiti pɔ ʋelela ʋelei, <verse eid="NUM 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 15:24"/>ni faaɠaazagi a ɠɛɛna, é la ɠɛɛni ga gaaɠilima, é ɠɛ ga nuɓusɛiti kwɛɛtala zu vaa, nuɓusɛi kpein ka nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpa gila kula ga gala zalaɠai, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, é ɓɔ vebɛ zalaɠai ʋa, ta puya zalaɠai, eɠɛʋelei deveai la tɔgi zu, ta boli zinɛi, nii a ɠɛ ga koto gba zalaɠai. <verse eid="NUM 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 15:25"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa kotoi gba Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti kpein bɛ, suvaa ɠa yɛ ti ʋɛ, tɔɔzei faaɠaazagi ʋe, ti kɛai, ti la gaaɠilini ma. Siɛgi zu ti ʋaazu la ga ta-zalaɠai, nii abui galazu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ta koto gba zalaɠai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, tɔɔzei ta-vaaɠaazagi vaa ʋa, ti kɛai, ti la gaaɠilini ma, <verse eid="NUM 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 15:26"/>suvaa ɠa yɛ Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti kpein bɛ, ta seikɔɠɔma nuiti, mazɔlɔɔ nuɓusɛiti ti naama vaaɠaazagi ɠɛɛʋɛ, ti la gaaɠilini ma.<verse eid="NUM 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 15:27"/>«Ni nu ɠila kpe nɔ ʋe, é kotoi ɠɛai, é la gaaɠilini ma, toɠa kona gila boli zaai ɠula ga koto gba zalaɠai. <verse eid="NUM 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 15:28"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa kotoi gba Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, nui naa ʋɛ, nii é kotoi ɠɛai, é la gaaɠilini ma. Siɛgi zu é kotoi gbazu la bɛ, naa zuvaa ɠa yɛ bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 15:29"/>Siɛgi zu nu a koto ɠɛɛna la, nii é la gaaɠilini ma, tɔ gilagi nii nɔ ɠa a zei nui pɛ ma, Izilayɛle nuiti ti ga zou lointi, ta seikɔɠɔma nuiti.<verse eid="NUM 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 15:30"/>«Kɛlɛ nu-o-nu, nii a gaaɠili ma, é kotoi ɠɛ, Izilayɛle nui, é ga zou loin, ɓaa seikɔɠɔma nui, é Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɔɠɔi ɠoloɠologa, kpe ka leʋe ná-nuɓusɛiti ba, é ɠula ti zaama. <verse eid="NUM 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 15:31"/>É Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawooi ʋɛlɛʋiliga, é ná-deveiti koloɠolo, kɛni kpe ge leʋe ná-nuiti ba. Ná-faaɠaaza golai ma ɠasɔi ɠa la unma.»<verse eid="NUM 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dooɠo foloi zo fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 15:32"/>Tɛi Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɠɛni teʋebai zu, ti zunui ta ɠaani, é ɗa koʋii ɠale dooɠo foloi. <verse eid="NUM 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 15:33"/>Tɛiti ti soni ná, ti ʋaani la Moize ʋɔ ta Aalɔn, ta nuɓusɛiti kpein pɔ. <verse eid="NUM 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 15:34"/>Ti makɛni ma ga pagɔ, tɔɔzei faa nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni dɛ leveni, é ʋa ʋilɛ naa ʋa, nii a zoo é ɠɛ la. <verse eid="NUM 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 15:35"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Moize ma: «Ta naama zunui ʋaa. Wa lii la wo-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋoluʋɛ, nuɓusɛi kpein ge sɔ ga kɔtui.» <verse eid="NUM 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 15:36"/>Názu ɠa nuɓusɛiti ti ɠulani la la, ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋoluʋɛ, ti sɔ ga kɔtui, eyɛsu é za, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni la Moize ya.<verse eid="NUM 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Geze yiizayiizagi ma levei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 15:37"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Moize ma: <verse eid="NUM 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 15:38"/>«Bo Izilayɛle nuiti ma ga, tiya-o, ti-mavofodaiti-yo, ti geze yiizayiizagi lo ta-ʋɛɛkɔma zeɠeiti goizuʋɛ, ta geze ɠaali ɓiinii. <verse eid="NUM 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 15:39"/>Siɛgi zu wo geze yiizayiizagiti kaazu la, wa ɠizɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-deveiti su, wo ɗa kɛ, wo la ɓɔɠɔ ɠakaga, wo ʋa ʋilɛ wo yiima vaiti polu, ta wa-ɠaazuɠulapɔiti, niiti ti wo lɔɔzu wooʋaladai zu. <verse eid="NUM 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 15:40"/>Naazu wa ɠizɛ nà-deveiti kpein su, wo ɠolo ti ʋɛ. Wa ɲade wa-ƓALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 15:41"/>Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI, nii é wo ɠulaai Ezipete yooi ʋa, ga é ɠɛ ga wa-ƓALAGI. Ungo, nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI.»<verse eid="NUM 15:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="NUM 16"/>
  <para style="s">Kolé ɓaka fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 16:1"/>Kolé, Yiseɠaal ná-doun zunui, Keɠate ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu, Levi ná-bolodai zu zunui ta ɠɛni de, é Luɓɛn ná-bolodai zu zunu saʋagɔ ʋɛɛni ɓɔɠɔ ʋa, Datan ta Aɓilame, Eliyaɓe ná-doun zunuiti, ta Won, Pelɛte ná-doun zunui, <verse eid="NUM 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 16:2"/>ti wuzeɠeni Moize laalɔɠɔma, ti Izilayɛle nuiti nu unfelegɔ puulɔɔlugɔ (250) ʋɛɛni ɓɔɠɔ ʋa, niiti ti ɠɛni ga nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠundiɠiiti, ti ɠɛni ga ɓalaa nuiti tɛnɛ nuiti maaɓɔgiti su, ti ga nuiti unfemai ti ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 16:3"/>Ti ɠaalɛɛni ba Moize ta Aalɔnni daalɔɠɔma, ti ɠɛ ti ma: «É kula ɠɛa! Nuɓusɛi kpein ka ɲadegai, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ade pɛ ba. Zobogi ɓɛgele ɠa é wo ya, ga wo zei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-bɛbɛi ɠa ɲii?»<verse eid="NUM 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 16:4"/>Siɛgi zu Moize naama yelilomaiti mɛnini da, é laaʋɛɛni zooi ma. <verse eid="NUM 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 16:5"/>Naa ʋolu é ɓɔɛni Kolé ʋɔ, ta polu nuiti, é ɠɛ ma: «Lina sobu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa naa lɛ, nii é ga nɔnɔi ta nii ɲadegai, a zoo maaɓuɠazu ba, nii é yiimazeɠezu la. <verse eid="NUM 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 16:6"/>Wɛlɛ nii wo ʋaazu kɛɛzu, Kolé ta polu nuiti kpein ta ansanse gala liɠiiti seɠe, <verse eid="NUM 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 16:7"/>ti ti laave ga abulekaiti, ti ansansegi ʋu ga, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. Nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI a yiimazeɠe la, naa ɠa ɲadegai. É kula ɠɛa, Levi ma zuwuzuiti!»<verse eid="NUM 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 16:8"/>Moize ɠɛni Kolé ma mɔnɔ: «À woilo gòoi ma ga pagɔ, Levi nuiti! <verse eid="NUM 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 16:9"/>Naa ɠa wo ɠaazu ga faa go ɓaa, ga Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI yiimazeɠe ga woye yɛ, Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti saama, é zobo fe wo ʋɛ, wo maaɓuɠa ba, wo ɗa botii ɠɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai wu, wo lo nuɓusɛiti untuɠɔ, wo botii ɠɛ tɔun bɛ? <verse eid="NUM 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 16:10"/>É ma zobogi veeʋɛ wo ʋɛ ga wo ɗa maaɓuɠa ba, wa è-ɠɛɛleaiti, Levi nuiti. Naa ɠa wo zalaɠa ɠula nui losuʋɛ ɠaiziɛzu mɔnɔ? <verse eid="NUM 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 16:11"/>Naa ɠa é kɛa ɗa-o, ɗa-nuiti-yo, wo gilia ba, wo wuzeɠe Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laalɔɠɔma! Mazɔlɔɔ Aalɔn ɠa ga ɓɛ, wo ʋa ɠɛ unsuyelii losu daalɔɠɔma?»<verse eid="NUM 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 16:12"/>Moize nu leʋeni ga ti Datan loli ta Aɓilame, Eliyaɓe ná-doun zunuiti. Kɛlɛ ti ɠɛni ma: «Gi la liizu! <verse eid="NUM 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 16:13"/>È gi ɠula zou ʋagɔi ʋa, ʋɛ nɔnɔi ta kɔin gulɔi ʋooʋaai ná, é ʋa ga giye teʋebai zu ga gi za, faa go ɠana ɓaa? Ɗa ɠɛɛzu mɔnɔ, è zei gi unda ɓaa? <verse eid="NUM 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 16:14"/>È la ʋaani ga giye zou zu, ʋɛ nɔnɔi ta kɔin gulɔi ʋooʋaai ná! È la kpalagaa veeni gi ya, ɓaa kpelea ga gɔnɔ. Ɗa niima nuiti kpein kaazu ga gaazuɠole nuiti? Ɓa-o, gi la liizu pɛ!» <verse eid="NUM 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 16:15"/>Moize wola yiiɠaawanani, é ɠɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma: «Mina yeezei ta-vebɛ zalaɠai wu! Gè la tanɔpɛ kɔli kulani zea, folo ɠila ɓalaa, anɛɛ soovale gila kpalaa, gè la dɛ faa ɲɔu ɠɛɛni ga taɠila ɓalaa!»<verse eid="NUM 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 16:16"/>Moize ɠɛni Kolé ma: «Ɗa-o, è ʋolu nuiti-yo, é ɓɔ Aalɔn ʋa, à ɠula kɛlɛma lina Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠakala. <verse eid="NUM 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 16:17"/>Wo ɠilagilagi, ansanse gala liɠii zeɠe, è ansansegi ʋu su, è ʋa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠakala. Wa ʋa ga ansanse gala liɠi unfelegɔ puulɔɔlugɔ (250), ɗa-o, Aalɔn-o, wo ɠilagilagi ɠa nɔnɔi zo ya.»<verse eid="NUM 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 16:18"/>Ti ɠilagilagi, ti ta-ansanse gala liɠii zeɠeni, ti abulekaiti pu su, ti ansansegi ʋu ga. Ti pɛ ti loni GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ, Moize ɓalaagi ta Aalɔn. <verse eid="NUM 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 16:19"/>Kolé bɛbɛi ɠaalɛɛni ba ti laalɔɠɔma GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 16:19">Naazu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-lɛbiyai ɠulani kɛlɛma bɛbɛi kpein bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 16:20"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Moize ta Aalɔn ma: <verse eid="NUM 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 16:21"/>«À ɠula niima nuɓusɛiti saama, nà ti undaaʋilisu ɠaniɠanigi nɔ!» <verse eid="NUM 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 16:22"/>Kɛlɛ Moize ta Aalɔn ti laaʋɛɛni zooi ma, ti maanɛɛnɛi wo, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ee, GALA! GALAGI nii deve kpɛtɛaniiti kpein zɛnvui ma, ɗa ʋaazu bɛbɛi kpein sosu ga nu ɠilagi ná-kotoi?»<verse eid="NUM 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 16:23"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Moize ma: <verse eid="NUM 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 16:24"/>«Ɓɔɛ nuɓusɛiti pɔ, è devei ve ti ya ga ti maaɠooza Kolé ta Datan ta Aɓilameni ta-zeɠe ɠotaiti ba.»<verse eid="NUM 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 16:25"/>Moize wuzeɠeni zooi ma. Izilayɛle ɠundiɠiiti ti ʋilɛni polu, ti li Datan ta Aɓilame ʋɔ bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 16:26"/>É ɠɛni nuɓusɛiti ma: «À maaɠooza kotoba nui tɛiti ta-zeɠe ɠotaiti ba. À mina vɔɔɠu ti-yeaɠɔligi tanɔpɛ ba, ni wo la wɔinni, wo undaa ʋa ʋili ta-ɠotoiti faa zu!» <verse eid="NUM 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 16:27"/>Naazu, ti maaɠoozani Kolé ta Datan ta Aɓilameni ta-zeɠe ɠotaiti ba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 16:27">Datan ta Aɓilame ti ɠulani, ti lo ta-zeɠe ɠotaiti daaʋɛ, ta ti-anzaiti, ta ti-loun zunuiti, ta ti-lounlointi. <verse eid="NUM 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 16:28"/>Moize ɠɛni ma: «Nii ɠa wa kwɛɛ da ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é tèʋega, ga gè kɛɛwotii niiti kɛ, gè la faa nɔpɛ kɛɛzu ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ ɠana nɔ. <verse eid="NUM 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 16:29"/>Ni niima nuɓusɛiti ta zaana ga nu zaa ʋele nɔ, eɠɛʋelei deveai la nuɓusɛi ma ga é za, naazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laade é ʋa vali mà, é ʋa tèʋe. <verse eid="NUM 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 16:30"/>Kɛlɛ ni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI a fai ta ɠɛɛna, nii kɛɠala la dɛ ɠɛɛni, ni zooi a laalaona, é ti ɓɔle ta ti-yeaɠɔligiti kpein, ti ma vului yei gɔvɛalaazu, wa kwɛɛ naazu ga nui niiti ti ɲɛɛɠulaʋɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zu.»<verse eid="NUM 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 16:31"/>Moize ɓeni nɔ ga woo ɠaaɓela, zooi ʋalini ga Datan ta Aɓilameni kɔɠɔwu. <verse eid="NUM 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 16:32"/>Zooi laalaoni, é ti ɓɔle, ta ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti, ta Kolé ná-nuiti, ta ti-ɠɔligiti. <verse eid="NUM 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 16:33"/>Naama nuiti ti yeini gɔvɛalaazu ga ti ma vului, ta tɔnɔiti kpein. Zooi laaɠuluni ti ma ʋolu. Pele ɠana ti ɠaalani da, nuɓusɛiti saama. <verse eid="NUM 16:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 16:34"/>Ta-ɓee wooi mɛnigai ma, Izilayɛle nuiti kpein ti ɠɛni loni ná maaɠoolii zu, ti ɓizɛni, ti ɗa kpeei loo, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ade ɓizɛ, zooi mina ade ɓɔle, ada ɓalaa!» <verse eid="NUM 16:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 16:35"/>Abui ɠulani Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɔ bɛ, é zunu unfelegɔ puulɔɔlugɔiti (250) gala, niiti ansansegi ɠɛni ti ya.<verse eid="NUM 16:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="NUM 17"/>
  <para style="s">Ɓɛ ɠa a zoo <optbreak/> é maaɓuɠa GALA ba?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 17:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 17:2"/>«Ɓɔɛ Eleazaal ʋɔ, zalaɠa ɠula nui Aalɔn ná-doun zunui, bo ma ga é ansanse gala liɠiiti kula abui zu, é abulekaiti pu ya ɠoozama, mazɔlɔɔ diɠii naati ti ɲadega. <verse eid="NUM 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 17:3"/>Nui niiti, ti zaai ta-ɠotoi maaʋele ma, à ta-ansanse gala liɠiiti seɠe, wo ti loɠa, wo ti ɓɛtɛ ga kɔlu ɓɔi sɛpɛgiti, nii a ʋɛɛ zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma. Diɠii naati ti ɲadega, mazɔlɔɔ ti ʋaaʋɛ ga tiye pɔ̀. Ta ɠɛ ga poogi Izilayɛle nuiti bɛ.»<verse eid="NUM 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 17:4"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui Eleazaal ansanse gala liɠiiti seɠeni, niiti ti ga kɔlu ɓɔigi, zunuiti niiti ti ʋaani ga tiye, abui naati galani. Ti ti loɠani, ti ti ɠɛ ga ma zɛpɛgiti, ti pɛɛ zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma. <verse eid="NUM 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 17:5"/>Naa ɠa é ga ɠizɛsui Izilayɛle nuiti bɛ, ga nu nɔpɛ nii é la ga Aalɔn mavofodai, maa la nɛɛni, é ʋa maaɓuɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa, é ʋa ansanse kula ga zalaɠai gaazu, a ʋa ɠɛ eɠɛ Kolé ta ná-nuɓusɛiti, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI devei veeni la Moize ya ga é bo ma.<verse eid="NUM 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nuɓusɛiti ti zelii lo fai <optbreak/> Moize ta Aalɔn ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 17:6"/>Poluma zobui Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti kpein ti ɠɛni zelii losu Moize ta Aalɔn ma, ti ɠɛ ma: «Wo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-nuɓusɛiti paaʋɛ!» <verse eid="NUM 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 17:7"/>Ti maaɓɔni ba Moize ta Aalɔn maaɠoolii zu. Ti ɠɛai ma latisu GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi ʋɔ pelei, pɛtɛ, tonaɓiingi ʋɛɛni ma, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-lɛbiyai ɠulani kɛlɛma. <verse eid="NUM 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 17:8"/>Moize ta Aalɔn ti liini, ti lo GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 17:9"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Moize ma: <verse eid="NUM 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 17:10"/>«À ɠula bɛbɛi tɛi saama, nà ti-ma zuwu ɠaaleʋezu ɠani nɔ.» Ti laaʋɛɛni zooi ma. <verse eid="NUM 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 17:11"/>Naa ʋolu Moize ɠɛni Aalɔn ma: «Ɗa-ansanse gala liɠii zeɠe fala, abulekaiti seɠe zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ, è pu su, è ansansegi ʋu ga. Suvilɛ, è lii la nuɓusɛiti pɔ bɛ, è koto gba vai ɠɛ, mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-ziiɠaawanai lokoleʋea, niizu maanɔɠɔi tɔɔzeiɗa.»<verse eid="NUM 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 17:12"/>Aalɔn naa ɠɛɛni, nii Moize boni ma. É ansanse gala liɠii zeɠeni, é ɓizɛ, é li nuɓusɛiti saama. Naazu maanɔɠɔi tɔɔzeini niina ga zeelia nuɓusɛiti ma. É ansansegiti galani, é koto gba vai ɠɛ nuɓusɛiti bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 17:13"/>É loni nuiti saama, niiti ti zaa ɠɛni de na, ta niiti ti ɠɛni vulua, maanɔɠɔi ɓeni. <verse eid="NUM 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 17:14"/>Nui liegɔi é zaani naama maanɔɠɔi zu, é ɠɛni ga nu waapuugɔ maazu naanigɔ undɔfela (14.700), é ɠula niiti polu, ti undaaʋilini Kolé ná-fai zu. <verse eid="NUM 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 17:15"/>Aalɔn ɠaleni ma Moize ʋɔ bɛ GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ, siɛgi zu maanɔɠɔi ɓeni la.<verse eid="NUM 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aalɔn ná-tukpɔi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 17:16"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 17:17"/>«Devei ve Izilayɛle nuiti zea, ga bolodama ɠundiɠii ɠilagilagi tukpɔi ɠila fe è ya. Tukpɔ puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12) ɠa bolodama ɠundiɠiiti ta fe è ya. È ti ɠilagilagi laaseigi zɛʋɛ ɛsɛ nɔnɔ ma. <verse eid="NUM 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 17:18"/>Ɗa Aalɔn laaseigi zɛʋɛ Levi ná-bolodai ná-tukpɔi ma, mazɔlɔɔ bolodama ɠundiɠi ɠilagilagi ná-tukpɔi ɠa ɠɛ ná. <verse eid="NUM 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 17:19"/>Ɗa ti la GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu, zeele woo ɠesui ɠakalaʋɛ, ʋɛ ada ɠɛ ɠomisu ná. <verse eid="NUM 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 17:20"/>Zunui nii gè yiimazeɠezu la, naa ná-tukpɔi ɠa ʋɔnɔ ba, naa ɠa a kɛ gè Izilayɛle nuiti ta-unsuyelii ɓe, nii ti bosu gòizu yeenɔpɛ wo laalɔɠɔma.»<verse eid="NUM 17:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 17:21"/>Moize naama leveiti feeni Izilayɛle nuiti zea. Bolodama ɠundiɠiiti gilagilagi tukpɔ ɠilagila feeni zea, é ɠɛ ga tukpɔ puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). Aalɔn ná-tukpɔi ɠɛni tɔnɔiti saama. <verse eid="NUM 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 17:22"/>Moize ti laani Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu, nii zeele woo ɠesui ɠɛni bu.<verse eid="NUM 17:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 17:23"/>Poluma zobui, Moize lɛɛni seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu. É kaani ga Aalɔn ná-tukpɔi, nii é laani Levi ná-bolodai laaseigi zu, é ʋɔnɔni ba, ma ʋuaiti gaaʋuye, gulu waai é ga amandegi, naa ma ɓɔigi ɠɛni ba. <verse eid="NUM 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 17:24"/>Moize tukpɔi kpein seɠeni ʋolu seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, é li, é dɛɛ ga Izilayɛle nuiti. Ti naa ɠaani nii kɛai, ɛsɛ ge ná-tukpɔ zeɠeni.<verse eid="NUM 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 17:25"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Moize ma: «Aalɔn ná-tukpɔi la ʋolu zeele woo ɠesui ɠakalaʋɛ. Toɠa makɛsu ná eɠɛ poogi niiti bɛ, ta ɠɛ ti ɓaka, naa ɠa a kɛ è ti ɓeteʋe unsuyeli lo fai ʋa gàazu, ti ʋa za.» <verse eid="NUM 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 17:26"/>Moize kɛɛni ɠana. É Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi zoni, eɠɛʋelei naa deveni la.<verse eid="NUM 17:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 17:27"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɠɛni Moize ma: «Wɛlɛ, gi loa ya, gá zaazu ɲɛgɛlɛin! <verse eid="NUM 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 17:28"/>Nu-o-nu a maaɓuɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ʋa, naa ɠa zaazu! Zekana gi pɛ gi ɠaaɓelazu la?»<verse eid="NUM 17:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="NUM 18"/>
  <para style="s">Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti <optbreak/> ta Levi nuiti tosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 18:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Aalɔn ma: «Ɗa-o, è-loun zunuiti-yo, ta è-ɠɛɛ mavofodaiti, faaɠaaza golaiti kpein ti ɠɛɛzu seizu ɲadegai laalɔɠɔma, ma ɠasɔi ɠa la wo unma. Ɗa-o, è-loun zunuiti-yo, faaɠaaza golaiti kpein ti ɠɛɛzu, wa-zalaɠa ɠula wotii ma ziɛgi zu, wa ɠa naama ɠasɔi a la wo unma. <verse eid="NUM 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 18:2"/>È-ɠɛɛleaiti maaɓuɠa ɓɔɠɔ ʋa, Levi ná-bolodai, è-ɠɛɛ ná-bolodai, ti ɠili è ʋa, ti ɓɔ è ʋa, wa è-loun zunuiti wo ɠɛ botii zu seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu, nii zeele woo ɠesui bu. <verse eid="NUM 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 18:3"/>Ta ɗa-levei zo, ti ɗa seɠe ʋɛlɛi kpein makɛ, kɛlɛ ti la maaɓuɠaa seizu ɲadegai ma zɔɔlaiti ba, anɛɛ zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɓalaa, wa ʋa lia zaazu, tiya-o, wa-o. <verse eid="NUM 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 18:4"/>Ta ɠɛ wo ʋa, ɗa-wotii zu, ta ɠɛ GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu wotii kpein su, ti ɗa botii pɛ kɛ, nii maanɛai ga ti kɛ. Kɛlɛ nu ɠili nɔpɛ ge la maaɓuɠaa wo ʋa. <verse eid="NUM 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 18:5"/>Wa ɠa seizu ɲadegai ma ɠasɔi a ɠɛ wo unma, ta zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ, nà-ziiɠaawanai loko la leʋea naazu, é ʋa yei Izilayɛle nuiti daalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="NUM 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 18:6"/>À wɛlɛ, gè yiimazeɠeni ga wo-ɠɛɛleaiti, Levi nuiti, Izilayɛle nui zɔiti saama, ta ga nɔ̀nɔi, gè ti veeʋɛ wo ya ga ti GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi ma wotii ɠɛ. <verse eid="NUM 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 18:7"/>Ɗɔun ɗa Aalɔn, wa è-mavofodaiti, wa wa-zalaɠa ɠula wotii ɠɛ, naa kpein su nii é ʋilɛsu zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ʋa, ta nii é ada ɲadega wolai, kwɛpele seɠezuɠoozagi ʋoluʋɛ, wo-ɠasɔi ɠana. Gè wa-zalaɠa ɠula wotii veeʋɛ wo ʋɛ ga faanɛɛi. Zɔi nɔpɛ a maaɓuɠana ná ʋa, ga wo ɠɛʋele, ta naama nui ʋaa.»<verse eid="NUM 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ti-laamiizuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 18:8"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Aalɔn ma: «Woilo, nii dɔin Izilayɛle nuiti ti kulazu vebɛani ɲadegaiti ba, nà ɓɔɠɔi gè naa makɛ vai ɠaliva è ma. Gè fea è ʋɛ, wa è-mavofodaiti, wɔnɔi ɠa ná, naa ɠa ɠɛ ga ɠɔoɠɔ tɔgi. <verse eid="NUM 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 18:9"/>Wɛlɛ nii a ɠɛ ga wɔnɔi vebɛani ɲadegaiti su, nii é ga nɔ̀nɔi, naa a zeɠena ba, é ɠala: nii dɔin Izilayɛle nuiti ti kɛɛzu bɛ̀ ga vebɛ zalaɠaiti moloi zu, ta koto gba zalaɠaiti, ta ná-faa zuɓɛtɛ zalaɠaiti, ti ʋaazu ga tiye pɔ̀. Naama ani ɲadega wolaiti ta ɠɛ ga ɗɔnɔ, wa è-loun zunuiti. <verse eid="NUM 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 18:10"/>Wa ti mi ada ɲadegai ta. Zunuiti nɔ ɠa ta mi. Ta ɠɛ ga ani ɲadega wolaiti wo ʋɛ.<verse eid="NUM 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 18:11"/>«É ɓudɛ naa maazu, vebɛanii niiti Izilayɛle nuiti ti feezu bɛ̀, ɗa naa ɠilazuʋɛ zeɠe. Gè naa kpein fea è ʋɛ, wa è-loun zunuiti, ta è-loun anzanuiti, naa ɠa ga ɠɔoɠɔ tɔgi. Nuiti kpein ta ɠɛ ɗa-ʋɛlɛi wu, ti la tɔ koloɠoloni, ta zoo ti ta mi. <verse eid="NUM 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 18:12"/>Zooi ʋaalɔnɔ mɔungiti ti feezu bɛ̀, gè naati ɓalaa fea wo ʋɛ, naa ɠa é ga gulɔi, ta dɔɔ niinɛi, ta moloi, <verse eid="NUM 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 18:13"/>zooi ʋaalɔnɔ mɔungi kpein ti ʋaazu la Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɔ. Nuiti kpein ta ɠɛ ɗa-ʋɛlɛi wu, ti la tɔ koloɠoloni, ta zoo ti ta mi.<verse eid="NUM 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 18:14"/>«Nii kpein Izilayɛle nuiti ta konana mà ga nɔ̀nɔi, naa ɠɛa ɓalaa ga wɔnɔ. <verse eid="NUM 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 18:15"/>Doun mɔungiti, ta togani mɔungiti, ta ti ve Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, naati ta ɠɛ ga ɗɔnɔ. Kɛni è doun zunu mɔungi unmɔɔ, è togani yiʋo zinɛ mɔungi ɓalaa unmɔɔ, nii é la zooga é ʋa ɠula ga zalaɠa. <verse eid="NUM 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 18:16"/>Zunu loin unmɔɔ ganii ɠa ɠula, a alu gila sɔlɔɔna, sɔngɔi ɠa ɠɛ ga wali ɠae lɔɔlugɔ, seizu ɲadegai ma valibogi zu, naama wali ɠae ɠilagi ɠa ga galamu puugɔ. <verse eid="NUM 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 18:17"/>Kɛlɛ mina va bu, ti ʋa nikɛ yiʋo mɔungi unmɔɔ, ɓaa baala ziʋo mɔungi, ɓaa boli yiʋo mɔungi, ta ga zalaɠa ani ɲadegaiti. Wa ti-ma ɲamai vaza zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma, wo ti-ma wulɔi ɠula ga zalaɠai, nii abui galazu, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 18:18"/>Ti-ma zuai ɠa ɠɛ ga ɗɔnɔ, eɠɛʋelei zalaɠa zuaiti ta ɗa ɠɛ la, ma ɠekegi ta ma ɓalai é ga zeezazu ʋelei, niiti ti ɠula ga datɛɠɛ vai ma ʋoogi. <verse eid="NUM 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 18:19"/>Ani ɲadegaiti kpein Izilayɛle nuiti ti seɠezu ba Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ ta-vebɛaniiti su, gè naati fea wo ʋɛ, ɗa-o, è-loun zunuiti-yo, è-loun anzanuiti-yo, naa ɠa ga ɠɔoɠɔ tɔgi. Toɠa ga minazeɠegi é la ɠoloɠologa ta é la valiboga, wo yɔɠɔzu wa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ta è-mavofodaiti.»<verse eid="NUM 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 18:20"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Aalɔn ma: «È la zou zɔlɔɔga, ga è ɓɔɠɔ gele, Izilayɛle yooi zu, ɗɔnɔ nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛa ná, ti zaama. Nà ɠa gè ga ɗɔnɔi ta ɗa-ɓɛtɛi Izilayɛle nuiti saama.<verse eid="NUM 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Levi nuiti ti-laamiizuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 18:21"/>«Puusiɛi nii kpein Izilayɛle nuiti ti kulazu, gè naa vea Levi nuiti bɛ ga tɔnɔ, botii vaa zu ti kɛɛzu, nii ti kɛɛzu GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="NUM 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 18:22"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti la mɔ maaɓuɠaa GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi ʋa, ti ʋa koto zeɠe, ti ʋa za. <verse eid="NUM 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 18:23"/>Levi nuiti nɔ ɠa ta ɠɛ GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu wotiiti kɛɛzu, ni faaɠaaza gola ɠa ɠɛɛna ná, tiya ɠa ma ɠasɔi a la ti unma. Toɠa ɠɛ ga ɠɔoɠɔ tɔgi, wo-mavofodaiti kpein bɛ. Ti la zou zɔlɔɔga Izilayɛle nuiti saama, <verse eid="NUM 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 18:24"/>mazɔlɔɔ nà puusiɛi kpein feezu Levi nuiti bɛ ga tɔnɔ, nii Izilayɛle nuiti ti kulazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. Naa ɠa é kɛa, gè boni ti ma ga ti la zou zɔlɔɔga Izilayɛle nuiti saama.»<verse eid="NUM 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Levi nuiti ta-ʋuusiɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 18:25"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Moize ma: <verse eid="NUM 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 18:26"/>«Bo Levi nuiti ma ga: ‹Siɛgi zu Izilayɛle nuiti ti ʋaazu ga puusiɛiti wo ʋɔ, gè feezu wo ya ga wɔnɔ, wa puusiɛi ɠula ba ga vebɛanii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, naa ɠa é ɠɛɛzu ga puusiɛi ma ʋuusiɛi. <verse eid="NUM 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 18:27"/>Wɔnɔ ma ɠuladai naa ɠa levezu ga, eɠɛʋelei naa la, nii é ɠulazu molo loɠazuʋɛ ta dɔɔ ɓɛtɛzuʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 18:28"/>Pele ɠana wa ta ɠula da la, wa ɓalaagi, é ɠɛ ga vebɛanii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, é ɠula puusiɛi kpein ba, wo sɔlɔɔsu Izilayɛle nuiti zea. Wa fe zalaɠa ɠula nui Aalɔn ya, é ɠɛ ga zalaɠai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 18:29"/>Faanɛɛi kpein wo sɔlɔɔsu, wa vebɛanii zeɠe ba Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, wa ma ʋagɔi zeɠe ba, é ɠɛ ga ma ʋagɔ ɲadegai seɠeai ba yɛ.›<verse eid="NUM 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 18:30"/>«Ɗa ɠɛ ti ma mɔnɔ: ‹Wa ma ʋagɔi ɠulana ba, mɔtai ɠa ɠɛ wo ʋɛ, Levi nuiti, eɠɛʋelei naa la, nii é ɠulazu molo loɠazuʋɛ ta dɔɔ ɓɛtɛzuʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 18:31"/>Wa mi, ʋɛ nɔpɛ ná nɛai wo ʋɛ, wa wa-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti, mazɔlɔɔ wo-zalai ɠana, botii kpein faa zu nii wo kɛɛzu GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="NUM 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 18:32"/>Wo la faaɠaaza nɔpɛ kɛa ga naa, tɔɔzei wo ma ʋagɔi zeɠeʋɛ ba bɛ̀. Naazu wo la Izilayɛle nuiti ta-vebɛani ɲadegaiti kɔzɔa ɲɛgɛlɛin, wo ʋa za.› »<verse eid="NUM 18:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="NUM 19"/>
  <para style="s">Ɲade ɗɛi ná-fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 19:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ta Aalɔn ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ti ma: <verse eid="NUM 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 19:2"/>«Pɛtɛ, devei nii ɠa é Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-tɔgi zu: À bo Izilayɛle nuiti ma, ti ʋa ga nikɛ zaa ɓɔigi, nii nɛɛʋuzu la ba, ɓaa maa ʋa lɛɠɛfɛ, nii é la dɛ wozawolini. <verse eid="NUM 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 19:3"/>Wa fe zalaɠa ɠula nui Eleazaal ya. Naa ɓalaagi ɠa lii la wo-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋoluʋɛ, ti kɔdaaleʋe gaazu. <verse eid="NUM 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 19:4"/>Toɠa ma ɲamai ta zo, é yeeɓeɠai lɔ bu, é faza ná zeizu ɠɛ lɔfela GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi letema ʋelei. <verse eid="NUM 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 19:5"/>Naa ʋolu, ta nikɛ zaai naa ɠala gaazu: ma ɠɔlɔi, naa ʋɛɛ ma zuai ʋa, ta ma ɲamai, naa ʋɛɛ ma ɓooiti pɛ ba. <verse eid="NUM 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 19:6"/>Naa ʋolu, zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa sɛdele gulu ɓuɠai zeɠe, ta ɠizɔɔpe tufa ɓifɔgi, ta geze ɓɔi sɔsɔgi, é ti ʋili abuzogi zaamaʋɛ, ʋɛ nikɛ zaa ɓɔigi ɠalazu ná. <verse eid="NUM 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 19:7"/>Naa pɛ poluma, zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa ná-seɠeiti gba, é ɓɔɠɔ maagba, aisa é ʋa ɠale ma wo-ʋuuzuʋɛ, anɛɛ naa ʋe, kɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de tɔgi letemazu eyɛsu kpɔkɔi zeeli. <verse eid="NUM 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 19:8"/>Zɔi ɓalaagi a nikɛ zaai ɠala, naa ɠa ná-seɠeiti gba, é ɓɔɠɔ maagba, kɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de eyɛsu kpɔkɔi zeeli. <verse eid="NUM 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 19:9"/>Zunu ɠila nii ɲadegai tɔgi letemazu, naa ɠa nikɛ zaai ma yuʋui ɠaalɛ ba, é lii la wo-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋoluʋelei, é pu ada ɲadegai ta, ʋɛ a makɛ ná Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti bɛ, ɲade ɗɛi ɓɛtɛ vai zu, koto gba vai zu. <verse eid="NUM 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 19:10"/>Zɔi a nikɛ zaai ma yuʋui ɠaalɛ ba, naa ɓalaa ɠa ná-seɠeiti gba, kɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de eyɛsu kpɔkɔi zeeli. Izilayɛle nuiti ta seikɔɠɔma nuiti, ta tɔgi nii zo eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="NUM 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 19:11"/>«Nu-o-nu a vɔɔɠu nu ʋooma ʋa, kɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de, tɔgi letemazu, folo lɔfela laawu. <verse eid="NUM 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 19:12"/>Ni a ɓɔɠɔ ɲadena foloi zaʋasiɛi ta dɔfelasiɛi, ga niima ɗɛi, toɠa ɲade. Ni naa la ɠɛɛni, kɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de. <verse eid="NUM 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 19:13"/>Nu-o-nu nii a vɔɔɠu nu ʋooma ʋa, é la ɓɔɠɔ ɲade fai ɠɛɛni, toɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ɠɔzɔzu. Naama nui ɓe ka leʋe Izilayɛle nuiti ba. Tɔɔzei ɲade ɗɛi la vazani ma, kɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de.<verse eid="NUM 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 19:14"/>«Tɔgi ʋɛtɛ, nii maanɛai ga wo so: Ni nu a zaana seɠe ɠotai wu, niiti kpein ti lɛɛzu ná, ta niiti kpein ti ɠɛni ná, ti ɠɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de folo lɔfela laawu. <verse eid="NUM 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 19:15"/>Aniɲakai kpein daalaogai, dakulu ge la ʋɛɛni da, naa ɠa ɠɔzɔ. <verse eid="NUM 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 19:16"/>Ni nu a vɔɔɠuna nu ʋooma ʋa dɔɓɔi zu, nu paa, ɓaa é za ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, ɓaa é vɔɔɠu nu ɠaei ɓaa kabai ʋa, kɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de folo lɔfela laawu.<verse eid="NUM 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 19:17"/>«Nii a kɛ é ɲade, ta nikɛ zaai ma yuʋui zeɠe, nii kulaai ga zalaɠai, é ɠala, koto gba vai zu, ti pu aniɲakai zu, ti ziɛungi zu ɗɛi ʋu ma. <verse eid="NUM 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 19:18"/>Zunui nii ɲadegai tɔgi letemazu, naa ɠa ɠizɔɔpe tufa ɓifɔgi gila seɠe, é dɔ ziɛi wu, é ta vaza seɠe ɠotai wu, ʋɛ nui ta zaai ná, ta aniɲakaiti ma, ta nuiti kpein ma ti ɠɛni ná. Toɠa kɛ ɠana nɔ naama nui ʋɛ, nii fɔɔɠuai nu ɠaeiti ba, ɓaa nu ʋoomai ʋa, nii nui ta paai, ɓaa saai ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, ɓaa nii fɔɔɠuai kabai ʋa. <verse eid="NUM 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 19:19"/>Nui nii ɲadegai tɔgi letemazu, naa ɠa a ziɛi vaza zɔi ma nii kɔzɔai. Toɠa naa ɠɛ foloi zaʋasiɛi ta dɔfelasiɛi ma. Folo lɔfelasiɛi, zunui kɔzɔai, naa ɠa ná-seɠeiti gba, é ɓɔɠɔ maagba. Kpɔkɔi, toɠa ɲade.<verse eid="NUM 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 19:20"/>«Kɛlɛ ni zunui nii kɔzɔai, é la ɓɔɠɔ ɲadeni, kpe ka leʋe Izilayɛle nuiti ba, mazɔlɔɔ toɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zeizu ɲadegai ɠɔzɔzu. Tɔɔzei ɲade ɗɛi la vazani ma, kɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de.<verse eid="NUM 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 19:21"/>«Izilayɛle nuiti ta niima lɔgi zo eyɛsu ɠɔ. Zɔi a ɲade ɗɛi vazana, naa ɠa ná-seɠeiti gba. Zɔi a vɔɔɠuna naama ɗɛi ʋa, naa ɠa ɠɔzɔ eyɛsu kpɔkɔi zeeli. <verse eid="NUM 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 19:22"/>Zunui kɔzɔai, anii kpein a vɔɔɠu ba, naati ta ɠɔzɔ, nu-o-nu a vɔɔɠu nui ʋa, nii kɔzɔai, tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ɠa ɠɔzɔ eyɛsu kpɔkɔi.»<verse eid="NUM 19:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="NUM 20"/>
  <para style="s">Miliyame zaa vai <optbreak/> ta Meliɓa ɗɛi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">Ɛgezɔde 17:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 20:1"/>Konagi ma alu mɔungi, Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti ti zeelini Sin teʋebai zu, ti ʋu Kadɛse. Miná ɠa Miliyame zaani ná, ti maaɠulu ná.<verse eid="NUM 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 20:2"/>Ziɛ la ɠɛni ná. Nuɓusɛiti ti ɠaalɛɛni ba Moize ta Aalɔn laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="NUM 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 20:3"/>Ti kpɔɛi ʋɛɛni Moize ʋa, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ee, ni gá la ɠɛni zaani, siɛgi zu gi-ɠɛɛleaiti ti ɠɛni zaazu la, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu! <verse eid="NUM 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 20:4"/>Leeni vaa zu wo ʋaai ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-nuɓusɛiti niima leʋebai zu, gi za gá gá-loganiiti? <verse eid="NUM 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 20:5"/>Leeni vaa zu wo zeɠeai ga giye Ezipete yooi zu, wo ʋa ga giye niima adaʋɛ nimizai zu? Nu la zooga é ʋa ani nɔpɛ sin ʋɛ. Nu la kooleɠoole gulu ɠaazu ʋɛ, ɓaa kpelei, ɓaa gelenade gului. Ziɛ vɔlɔ ɠa é la ná, nu ʋa ɓɔɔle.»<verse eid="NUM 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 20:6"/>Moize ta Aalɔn ti maaɠoozani bɛbɛi ʋa, ti li GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ, náʋɛ ɠa ti looni ná, ti laaʋɛɛ zooi ma. Názu ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-lɛbiyai ɠulani la ti ʋɛ kɛlɛma. <verse eid="NUM 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 20:7"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 20:8"/>«Ɗa-lukpɔi zeɠe, wa è-liɛ Aalɔn, wo nuɓusɛiti gaalɛ ba. Wa ɓɔɛ fasa ɠɔtui ʋɔ ti ɠaazu, é ziɛi ve. Ɗa ziɛi ɠulazu fasa ɠɔtui naa ʋa, è fe nuɓusɛiti zea, ti ɓɔɔle ta ta-loganiiti.»<verse eid="NUM 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 20:9"/>Moize liini, é ná-tukpɔi zeɠe Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, eɠɛʋelei naama levei veeni la zea. <verse eid="NUM 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 20:10"/>Moize ta Aalɔn ti bɛbɛi lolini fasa ɠɔtui ʋɔ bɛ, nii é lɛɛni ga tiye. Moize ɠɛni ti ma: «À woilo, wɔiti wo ga kololala nuiti! Wo laaʋɛ da ɓaa, ga gá zoo gi ziɛi ɠula fasa ɠɔtui tɛi ba wo ʋɛ?» <verse eid="NUM 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 20:11"/>Moize yeewuzeɠeni, é fasa ɠɔtui loɠa la ɠɛ fele ga ná-tukpɔi. Ziɛi ɠulani ga bɔɔlɔa. Nuɓusɛiti ta toganiiti ti zooni ti ɓɔɔle.<verse eid="NUM 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 20:12"/>Kɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Moize ta Aalɔn ma: «Tɔɔzei wo la laani dà, wo ʋa nà-ɲadedai wɔɔlɔ Izilayɛle nuiti gaazu, naa maaʋele ma, wa la mɔ de, wa lo niima ʋɛbɛi luɠɔ, wo ʋa lii la naama yooi zu, nii gè feezu ti ʋɛ.»<verse eid="NUM 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 20:13"/>Meliɓa ɗɛiti kana, Meliɓa laaseigi ɠa é ga «sakpegi». Ná ɠa Izilayɛle nuiti ti kpɔɛi ʋɛɛni ná Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa. Ná ɠa mɔnɔ é ná-lɛbiyai ɠulani ná kɛlɛma ti ʋɛ.<verse eid="NUM 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Edɔme masagi ɠɛlɛ vai <optbreak/> Izilayɛle leʋe fai ʋa ná-zooi zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 20:14"/>Moize keelaiti teʋeni, ti zeɠe Kadɛse, ti li Edɔme masagi ʋɔ bɛ. Ti ɠɛni ma: «È-ɠɛɛloin Izilayɛle ɠɛ, è kpɔlɔiti kpein kwɛɛ, nii gi sɔlɔɔgai. <verse eid="NUM 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 20:15"/>Kaite gi-mɛmɛwolani ti liini Ezipete yooi zu, gi zeini ná kona mɔinmɔin daawu. Kɛlɛ Ezipete nuiti ti gi zopele ɲɔuni, eɠɛʋelei ti gi-mɛmɛwolani sopele ɲɔuni la. <verse eid="NUM 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 20:16"/>Gi ɓainni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI woizu, é gi woomɛni. É ná-geezuɠeelai leʋeni, é gi ɠula Ezipete yooi ʋa. Niizu gá Kadɛse, taai nii é ʋuuni ɗa-yooi ma ɠwɛpelemaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 20:17"/>Va bu, gi leʋe ɗa-yooi zu. Gi la ziɛzu kpalagaa zu, ɓaa kpelea, gi la wa-ɠɔlɔyeɠe ɗɛ ɓɔlezu. Gá ʋilɛsu nɔ pele wolai nɔ ma, gi la zeɠezu ba, gi ʋa li ga yeezazu ʋele, ɓaa ɠɔʋɛzu ʋele, eyɛsu gi ɗa-yooi maazuɓudɛ.»<verse eid="NUM 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 20:18"/>Edɔme masagi gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Wo la leʋesu nà-zooi zu. Ni naa laade, nà kɔɔi ʋɛɛ wo ʋa.»<verse eid="NUM 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 20:19"/>Izilayɛle ɠeelaiti ti ɠɛni ma: «Gá ziɛzu nɔ ga pele wolai, ni gá ɗa-ɗɛi ta ɓɔlena, gá gá-loganiiti, gá sɔngɔi ve è ya. Gi la faa ɠili nɔpɛ maaɠaazaɠabosu è ma, kɛni nɔ è va bu, gi ziɛ ɠɔɠɔa, gi leʋe ɗa-yooi zu.»<verse eid="NUM 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 20:20"/>Masagi ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Wo la leʋesu ʋɛ!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 20:20">Edɔme nuiti ti Izilayɛle laaɠomini ga kɔɔɓɔgi, ti wola mɔin, ti wola yeeɠaaɓaai, <verse eid="NUM 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 20:21"/>ti pele ɓesa ti luɠɔ, ti ʋa leʋe ta-yooi zu, naa ɠa é kɛɛni Izilayɛle nuiti ti liini la ga pele ɠili.<verse eid="NUM 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aalɔn zaa vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 20:22"/>Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti kpein ti zeɠeni Kadɛse, ti zeeli Ɠɔɔl gizei ma. <verse eid="NUM 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 20:23"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ta Aalɔn ʋɔ, Ɠɔɔl gizei ma, Edɔme yooi ma ɠwɛpelemaʋɛ, é ɠɛ ti ma: <verse eid="NUM 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 20:24"/>«Aalɔn ɠana ʋa liizu mɛmɛwolani pɔ, ti zaai. É la lɔɔzu zooi naa zu, nii gè ʋaazu feezu Izilayɛle nuiti zea, mazɔlɔɔ wo woozotalai ɠɛɛni ga nà-deveiti, Meliɓa ɗɛi ná-faa zu. <verse eid="NUM 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 20:25"/>Aalɔn zeɠe ta ná-doun zunui Eleazaal, è lɛ ga tiye Ɠɔɔl gizei ma. <verse eid="NUM 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 20:26"/>Ɗa Aalɔn ná-zalaɠa ɠula zeɠeiti kula kɔba, è ti loo ná-doun zunui Eleazaal ɠɔba. Naazu Aalɔn ɠa li niina mɛmɛwolani pɔ, toɠa za miná.»<verse eid="NUM 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 20:27"/>Moize naa ɠɛɛni, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI deveni la. Ti saʋagɔ, ti lɛɛni Ɠɔɔl gizei ma, nuɓusɛiti gaazu. <verse eid="NUM 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 20:28"/>Moize Aalɔn ná-seɠeiti kulani kɔba, é ti loo ná-doun zunui Eleazaal ɠɔba. Aalɔn zaani ná, gize unmaʋɛ. Moize ta Eleazaal ti yeini, ti zeɠe gize unmaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 20:29"/>Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti kpein ti suɠwɛɛni ga Aalɔn zaa. Nuɓusɛiti kpein ti ná-wɔlɔi woni folo ʋuusaʋagɔ (30) laawu.<verse eid="NUM 20:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="NUM 21"/>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle nuiti ti zobo sɔlɔɔ fai <optbreak/> Kanaan nui tanigaa ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 21:1"/>Masagi Alade, Kanaan nui, é ɠɛni zeini lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazuʋɛ yooi zu, é mɛnini ga Izilayɛle nuiti ta leʋesu ga Atalime ʋelei. É laalɛɛni ti wu, é tanigaa zo ti zaama ga duɔi. <verse eid="NUM 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 21:2"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti minazeɠeni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ni ɗa niima nuɓusɛiti dɔɔna gi yeezu, gá ta-laaiti kpein koloɠolo mɛtu.» <verse eid="NUM 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 21:3"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI Izilayɛle nuiti gooi zoni, é zobogi ve ti ʋɛ, ti pilɛ sɔlɔɔ Kanaan nuiti ma. Izilayɛle nuiti ti ti zuwuɠaaleʋeni, ti ta-laaiti koloɠolo. Ti naama adaʋɛ laaseigi ʋɛɛni ga Ɠɔɔlema (nii poluʋɛ ga «é ɠoloɠologa»).<verse eid="NUM 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kaali ɲɔiti ta-vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 21:4"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti zeɠeni Ɠɔɔl gizei ma, ti li ga Seeli Kpoloɗɛi ʋɔ pelei, nii a kɛ ti Edɔme yooi maala. Kɛlɛ nuɓusɛiti iɲɔ ge leʋeni pelei zu. <verse eid="NUM 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 21:5"/>Ti tɔɔzeini ga ɓɔɛa GALA daalɔɠɔma ta Moize, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Lee vaa zu wo gi ɠulaai Ezipete yooi ʋa, wo ʋa ga giye, gi ʋa za teʋebai zu? Mazɔlɔɔ ɓulu la ná, ziɛ la ná, niima maanɔɠɔ laamianigi wɔinzeɠea gi ma!»<verse eid="NUM 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 21:6"/>Názu ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI kaali ɲɔiti teʋeni la nuɓusɛiti daalɔɠɔma, ti ɗa ti ɲi. Izilayɛle nuɓusɛi zaani ga gola. <verse eid="NUM 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 21:7"/>Nuɓusɛiti ti ʋaani, ti Moize ɠa, ti ɠɛ ma: «Gi kotoi ɠɛɛni, siɛgi zu gi ɓɔɛa la Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laalɔɠɔma ta ɗa ɓɔɠɔi. Niizu, soma è Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maanɛɛnɛ, é kaalii tɛiti kula gi ma!» Moize maanɛɛnɛi woni nuɓusɛiti bɛ.<verse eid="NUM 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 21:8"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Kaalii ɓɛtɛ ga kɔlui, è sɛlɛ gulu ɠoozagi ʋa. Zɔi nɔpɛ kaali a ɲiina, é ɠaazuwuzeɠe, é wɛlɛ kaalii tɔna ba, naa la zaa.» <verse eid="NUM 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 21:9"/>Moize kaalii ɓɛtɛni ga kɔlu ɓɔigi, é sɛlɛ gulu ɠoozagi ʋa. É zo názu ma, nu nɔpɛ kaalii a la ɲiina, é ɠaazuwuzeɠe, é wɛlɛ kaalii ʋa, é ga kɔlu ɓɔigi, naa la mɔ ɠɛni za.<verse eid="NUM 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Minazeɠe zooi ma ɠwɛpelemaʋɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 21:10"/>Naa ʋoluma, Izilayɛle nuiti ti zeɠeni ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ, ti li, ti ʋu Wɔɓɔte. <verse eid="NUM 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 21:11"/>Ti zeɠeni miná, ti li Ye-Aɓalime, nii é teʋebai zu, gaaʋotegai Moaɓe yooi ma, folo ɠulazu ʋelei. <verse eid="NUM 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 21:12"/>Naa ʋoluma, ti liini, ti ʋu Zelɛde nɛmɛi zu, <verse eid="NUM 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 21:13"/>naa ʋolu ti liini, ti ʋu ziɛ wolai Aalanɔn ʋoluʋelei, ziɛi naa ɠa é yeizu teʋebai zu, é ɗa ɠula Amool nuiti ta-yooi zu, é ga kwɛpelegi Moaɓe yooi ta Amool nuiti ta-yooi yɔɠɔzu. <verse eid="NUM 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 21:14"/>Naa ɠa é ba, bogɛ é ɠole, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-kɔɔ vaiti ma zɛʋɛi zu ga: «Waɠɛɓe nii é Sufa, ta ma ɓekegiti, ta Aalanɔn, <verse eid="NUM 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 21:15"/>é ɓɔ ma ɓekegiti ba, ti yeizu Aal taai ʋɔ pelei, tiya ɠa ti ga Moaɓe ɠwɛpelegiti.»<verse eid="NUM 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 21:16"/>Ti zeɠeni miná, ti li Ɓeel. Kɔlɔyeɠei naa ná-fai ɠa é kɛɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Moize ma: «Nuɓusɛiti gaalɛ ba, nà ziɛi veezu ti ya.» <verse eid="NUM 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 21:17"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti niima wuyei looni, ti ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:17">«Ziɛi ɠula kɔlɔyeɠei zu, é lɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:17">À maamusɛi wo!<verse eid="NUM 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 21:18"/>À kɔlɔyeɠei ʋɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:18">nii kundiɠiiti ti bɔɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:18">nii nu wolaiti ti bɔɔni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:18">ga ta-lukpɔi ta ta-ɓakɔiti.»</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 21:18"/>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 21:18">Ti zeɠeni teʋebai zu, ti li Matana, <verse eid="NUM 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 21:19"/>ti li Naɠaliyɛle, ta Ɓamɔte. <verse eid="NUM 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 21:20"/>Ti liini nɛmɛi zu, nii é Moaɓe yooi zu, gizei nii daaseigi ga Pizega, naa unmaʋɛ, ʋɛ ná zɛlɛgai teʋebai maazu.<verse eid="NUM 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle pilɛ sɔlɔɔ fai masagi Siɠon ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 2:26-3:11">Tɔ Sɛʋɛi Velesiɛi 2:26—3:11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 21:21"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti keelaiti teʋeni Amool nuiti ta-masagi Siɠon ma, ti ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 21:22"/>«Va bu, gi leʋe ɗa-yooi zu. Gi la ziɛzu kpalagaa zu, ɓaa kpelea, gi la wa-ɠɔlɔyeɠe ɗɛ ɓɔlezu. Gá ʋilɛsu nɔ pele wolai nɔ ma, eyɛsu gi ɗa-yooi maazuɓudɛ.»<verse eid="NUM 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 21:23"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, Siɠon ɠɛlɛni, é la ɓeni ti ʋa, ti ʋa ziɛ ná-zooi zu. É ná-kɔɔɠɔ nuiti pɛ gaalɛɛni ba, é li Izilayɛle nuiti daalɔɠɔma teʋebai zu, é kɔɔi ʋɛɛ ti ʋa Yaɠase. <verse eid="NUM 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 21:24"/>Kɛlɛ Izilayɛle nuiti ti vɔnini ma, ti ná-zooi pɛ seɠe, é zo ziɛ wolai Aalanɔn ma, nu yeezazu ʋelei, é li ziɛ wolai Yaɓɔke ʋɔ pelei, nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ, eyɛsu é li Amɔn nuiti ta-ɠwɛpelemaʋɛ, folo ɠulazu ʋelei, ná makɛga ɠɛni de kpekpe. <verse eid="NUM 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 21:25"/>Izilayɛle Amool nuiti ta-laaiti kpein soni, é zei ti zu, Ɠɛsɛɓon taai la ma mɛɛ, ta maaɠoolii zu geleiti pɛ. <verse eid="NUM 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 21:26"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɛsɛɓon ɠɛni ga taa wola, ʋɛ Amool nuiti ta-masagi Siɠon ɠɛni zeini ná, é zo naama ziɛgi zu ma, é kɔɔi ʋɛɛni la Moaɓe masagi ʋa, é zooi kpein seɠeni, é zeeli ziɛ wolai Aalanɔn ma. <verse eid="NUM 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 21:27"/>Naa ɠa é ba, faaɠwɛ nuiti ti boni la, ti ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:27">«À ʋa Ɠɛsɛɓon!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:27">Siɠon ná-taai lo ʋolu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:27">é lo ʋolu!<verse eid="NUM 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 21:28"/>Mazɔlɔɔ abui ɠa vukazu, é ɗa ɠula Ɠɛsɛɓon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">abuzogi vazaga, é ɗa ɠula Siɠon ná-taazuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">é Aal ɠala Moaɓe yooi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">ta Aalanɔn ada ɠaaɠoozagiti maliɠiiti.<verse eid="NUM 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 21:29"/>Maanɔɠɔi ɠa è ʋɛ, Moaɓe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">È loa ya, Kemɔse ná-nuɓusɛi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">È-loun zunuiti ti ʋela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">È-loun anzanuiti ti ɠɛa ga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">Amool nuiti ta-masagi ná-duɔiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">ungo, Siɠon masagi.<verse eid="NUM 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 21:30"/>Gi gá-mɛɛinti pilini Amool nuiti ma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:30">Niizu zooi pɛ ge ɠoloɠologa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:30">é zo Ɠɛsɛɓon, eyɛsu é zeeli Diɓon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:30">Eyɛsu é li Nofa, é li ɠite Medeɓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:30">gi ti kpein koloɠoloni!»<verse eid="NUM 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 21:31"/>Zekana Izilayɛle nuiti ti zeini la Amool nuiti ta-yooi zu. <verse eid="NUM 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 21:32"/>Moize zou zuʋɛtɛ nuiti teʋeni, ti li, ti Yazɛɛl taai ʋɛtɛ. Taaiti kpein ti ɠɛni ba, Izilayɛle nuiti ti naati soni, ti Amool nuiti kpɛ ná.<verse eid="NUM 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle nuiti ti pilɛ sɔlɔɔ fai <optbreak/> Ɓasan masagi Wɔge ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 21:33"/>Naa ʋolu ti latini, ti li ga Ɓasan ʋele. Ɓasan masagi Wɔge ɠulani, ta ná-kɔɔɠɔ nuiti kpein, ti ti laaɠomi, ti ʋa kɔɔi ʋɛɛ ti ʋa Edeleyi. <verse eid="NUM 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 21:34"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Moize ma: «Mina lua tɔun ba, mazɔlɔɔ gè dɔa è yeezu, ta ná-kɔɔɠɔ nuiti kpein, é ʋɛɛ ná-zooi ʋa. Ɗa so, eɠɛʋelei è Amool nuiti ta-masagi Siɠon zoni da, nii é ɠɛni zeini Ɠɛsɛɓon.»<verse eid="NUM 21:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 21:35"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti Wɔge ʋaani ta ná-doun zunuiti, ta ná-kɔɔɠɔ nuiti kpein. Nu ɠila kpalaa ge la ɠulani. Ti ná-zooi zoni.<verse eid="NUM 21:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="NUM 22"/>
  <para style="ms1">Izilayɛle Nuiti Kɛai Ma <optbreak/> Moaɓe Nɛmɛi Zu</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="NUM 22:1-36:13">22:1—36:13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Ɓalaame ta Ɓalake ta-vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 22:1"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti liini mɔnɔ, ti ʋu Moaɓe nɛmɛi zu ziɛ wolai Zuludɛn folo ɠulazu ʋelei, Zeliko letemaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 22:2"/>Sipɔɔl ná-doun zunui Ɓalake naa kpein kaani, nii Izilayɛle kɛɛni ga Amool nuiti. <verse eid="NUM 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 22:3"/>Moaɓe nuiti ti wola luani nuɓusɛiti mɔin vai ʋa. Moaɓe nuiti sasuɓalini Izilayɛle nuiti tuɠɔ. <verse eid="NUM 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 22:4"/>Ti ɓɔɠɔ ɠaani ta Madiyan nuiti ta-ɠundiɠiiti, ti ɠɛ naati ma: «Niima ʋɛbɛ wolai ɠa ʋaazu, ti zooi ta maaɠoolii kpein koloɠolo, eɠɛʋelei nikɛiti ta ɗa tufaiti gaamii la dɔɓɔiti su.» Naama ziɛgi zu Sipɔɔl ná-doun zunui Ɓalake ɠɛni masadai ɠɛɛzu Moaɓe yooi unda. <verse eid="NUM 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 22:5"/>É keelaiti teʋeni Ɓeyɔɔl ná-doun zunui Ɓalaame ma Petɔɔl, ziɛ wolai Efelate ɠobaʋɛ, zooi naa ɠa é zɔlɔɔni su, é ɠɛ naa ma: «Wɛlɛ nuɓusɛiti kulaʋɛ Ezipete! Ti vazaga adaʋɛ pɛ, ti zeiɗa nà-zooi letemaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 22:6"/>Niizu nà è maanɛɛnɛzu ga è ʋa. Niima nuɓusɛiti foovo bɛ̀, mazɔlɔɔ ti-zɛbɛi wɔɔlɔʋɛ nɔ̀nɔi ʋa. Tanisu nà zoo naazu gè vala ti ʋa, gè vɔni ti ma, gè ti ɓɛ, ti ɠula zooi ʋa. Mazɔlɔɔ gè kwɛɛ, zɔi ɗa tuya loo bɛ, tuyai ɠa naa ʋɛ, zɔi ɗa foovo, naa voovooʋɛ.»<verse eid="NUM 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 22:7"/>Moaɓe ɠɛwolaiti ta Madiyan ɠɛwolaiti ti liini ga lobɛanii, ungaiziɛ vai zu, ti ʋa fe Ɓalaame ya. Ti zeelini Ɓalaame ʋɔ bɛ, ti Ɓalake laawooi wo ma. <verse eid="NUM 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 22:8"/>Ɓalaame ti wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «À yɛ ʋɛ za kpɔkɔi. Lina, nà nà-gooɠaaʋotegi ve wo ya, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI a ɓɔɛ la pɔ̀.» Moaɓe ɠundiɠiiti ti ɲiini pɔ bɛ.<verse eid="NUM 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 22:9"/>GALA ge ʋaani Ɓalaame ʋɔ bɛ, é gaazaɠa, é ɠɛ ma: «Nui ɓɛgele ɠa ga niiti ti è ʋɔ bɛ?»<verse eid="NUM 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 22:10"/>Ɓalaame gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Nuiti be Sipɔɔl ná-doun zunui Ɓalake, Moaɓe masagi ti leʋegai, ga ti ɠɛ mà: <verse eid="NUM 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 22:11"/>‹Nuɓusɛiti ti ɠulaai Ezipete yooi ʋa, niizu ti ʋɛa zooi zu mɛɛ. Ʋa, è ti voovo bɛ̀, tanisu nà zoo naazu gè ti zakpe, gè ti ɓɛ.› » <verse eid="NUM 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 22:12"/>Kɛlɛ GALA ge ɠɛni Ɓalaame ma: «Mina ʋilɛ ti ʋolu, wo ʋa li. È la niima nuɓusɛiti foovoa, mazɔlɔɔ tuyai ɠa ti ma.»<verse eid="NUM 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 22:13"/>Poluma zobui, Ɓalaame liini, é ɠɛ kundiɠiiti ma, niiti Ɓalake ti leʋeni: «À ɠale ma wa-yooi zu, mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI la yeezeini bu ga gè ʋilɛ wo ʋolu.»<verse eid="NUM 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 22:14"/>Moaɓe zou zu ɠundiɠiiti ti wuzeɠeni, ti ɠale ma Ɓalake ʋɔ bɛ, ti ɠɛni ma: «Ɓalaame la kɛɛni, é ʋa ʋilɛ gi ʋolu, gi ʋa ʋa.»<verse eid="NUM 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 22:15"/>Ɓalake kundiɠi ɠiligaa leʋeni, ti mɔin gola, é leʋe ma mɔungi ʋa, ta unfemai veezu ti ʋɛ, é leʋe mɔun keleiti ba. <verse eid="NUM 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 22:16"/>Ti ʋaani Ɓalaame ʋɔ bɛ, ti ɠɛ ma: «Sipɔɔl ná-doun zunui Ɓalake ɠɛ ma: ‹Soma, è mina ɠɛlɛ, è ʋa è ɓɔ bà. <verse eid="NUM 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 22:17"/>Nà è wola wɔɔlɔ, nà naa pɛ kɛ, nii ɗa maaɠaazaɠabo mà. Kɛlɛ kɛni è ʋa, è nuɓusɛi tɛiti foovo bɛ̀.› »<verse eid="NUM 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 22:18"/>Ɓalaame Ɓalake ná-botiɠɛ nuiti gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Anɛɛ ni Ɓalake ɠa ʋaazu ga walii ta zanugi, nii é ná-masa pɛlɛi laavegai, é fe zèa, gè la Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà-GALAGI ná-devei tanɔpɛ koloɠologa, ma wola, ɓaa ma go. <verse eid="NUM 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 22:19"/>Kɛlɛ tama, wa ɓalaa, à yɛ ʋɛ za kpɔkɔi. Nà pɔ gè naa ɠwɛɛ, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa pɔ é fai ta wo mà dɛ.» <verse eid="NUM 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 22:20"/>Kpidii GALA ge ʋaani, é ɠɛ Ɓalaame ma: «Ni niima zunuiti ti ʋaa è lolisu, à li wa tiye. Kɛlɛ mina faa nɔpɛ kɛ, kɛni nii nà bona è ma.» <verse eid="NUM 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 22:21"/>Ɓalaame wuzeɠeni sobui, é ná-soovale saai maaɠili, ti li ta Moaɓe ɠundiɠiiti.<verse eid="NUM 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Geezuɠeelai pele leʋe vai <optbreak/> Ɓalaame luɠɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 22:22"/>GALA ge yiiɠaawanani siɛ vai naa zu. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai loni pelei zu, é ɓesa tuɠɔ. Ɓalaame ɠɛni ná-soovale saai ɠɔma, ná-botiɠɛ nu felegɔ ʋilɛgai polu. <verse eid="NUM 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 22:23"/>Soovale saai geezuɠeelai ɠaani, boɠa zɔkpɔi zea, kulaai maalaɠagi zu, é loni pele zaamaʋɛ. É zeɠeni pelei ʋa, é li ga dɔɓɔi zu ʋele. Ɓalaame tɔɔzeini ga doɠaa, é ʋaa la pelei zu.<verse eid="NUM 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 22:24"/>Geezuɠeelai liini, é lo ɠoozama pele zokogi zu, leezɛn ɓeleiti zɔɠɔzu, kɔtu ziɠigi zɔɔla ʋele, é zɔɔla ʋele. <verse eid="NUM 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 22:25"/>Soovale saai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ɠaani, é ziɠa kɔtu ziɠigi ʋa, é Ɓalaame ɠɔɠɔi ɓata kɔtu ziɠigi ʋa. Naa ɓalaa tɔɔzeini ga doɠaa.<verse eid="NUM 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 22:26"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai leʋeni ti ʋa mɔnɔ, é li, é lo pele ɓoɠologi zu, ʋɛ nu la zooga é ʋa leʋe ná, ga nu yeezazu ʋele, ɓaa nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋele. <verse eid="NUM 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 22:27"/>Siɛgi zu soovale saai kaani la, é ʋɛɛni zooi ma, Ɓalaame wu. Ɓalaame yiiɠaawanani, é tɔɔzei ga suloɠaa ga ná-tukpɔi. <verse eid="NUM 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 22:28"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI soovale saai laaʋɛ vieni, é ɓɔɛ Ɓalaame ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: «Leeni ɠa gè kɛai ga ɗe, è dòɠa ná zeizu ɠɛa saʋa?» <verse eid="NUM 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 22:29"/>Ɓalaame gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Mazɔlɔɔ è ɲɛɛɠulaʋɛ sù. Ee, ni boɠa zɔkpɔ ɠɛni zèa, gè ɠɛa è ʋaazu ɠani nɔ!» <verse eid="NUM 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 22:30"/>Soovale saai gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Nà laade gè ʋa ɠɛ ga ɗa-zoovale saai, nii ɗa ɗa zei kɔma yeenɔpɛ? Zekaa nɛi nà ɗa è zo da pɔlɔmazu ɓaa?» É gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɓa!»<verse eid="NUM 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 22:31"/>Gaamago nɔ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI Ɓalaame ɠaazuʋɛ zeɠeni ma, é Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ɠa, é loni pele zaamaʋɛ, ná-boɠa zɔkpɔi zea, kulaai maalaɠagi zu. Ɓalaame ʋilɛni ɲiibiɠa, é nɔkɔ, é unpilɛ zooi ma. <verse eid="NUM 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 22:32"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ɠɛni ma: «Leeni vaa zu è ɗa-zoovale saai loɠaai ná zeizu ɠɛ saʋa? Nà ɠa pàai, gè pele leʋe è luɠɔ, mazɔlɔɔ siɛi nii è tɔɔzeiɗai, undaaʋili pelei ʋe. <verse eid="NUM 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 22:33"/>Soovale saai kàaʋɛ, é màala ná zeizu ɠɛ saʋa. Ni é la ɠɛni màalaani, é ga gè è ʋaa, gè tɔun zɛ vulua.»<verse eid="NUM 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 22:34"/>Ɓalaame ɠɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ma: «Gè gaazaʋɛ, mazɔlɔɔ gè la ɠɛa kwɛɛ ga ɗa loni tùɠɔ pelei zu. Ni siɛi nii wanaʋɛ è ma, gè ɠale ma.» <verse eid="NUM 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 22:35"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ɠɛni ma: «À li wa zunui tɛiti, kɛlɛ kɛni nɔ è ɗa woo ɠilagi nɔ wo, nii nà bo è ma.» Ɓalaame ta kundiɠiiti Ɓalake ti leʋeni, ti ʋilɛni pelei zu, ti ɗa li.<verse eid="NUM 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 22:36"/>Siɛgi zu Ɓalake mɛnini da ga Ɓalaame ʋaa, é liini, é daaɠomi Moaɓe taa wolai zu, nii é zou ɠwɛmaʋɛ ɠobaʋɛ, ziɛ wolai Aalanɔn ɠobaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 22:37"/>Ɓalake Ɓalaame ɠaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: «Gè la keela mɔungiti teʋeni ɓaa, ga è ʋa? Leeni vaa zu è la ʋaani gaamago nɔ pɔ̀ bɛ? È ɠɛni ɠisiɛzu ga gè la zooga gè ʋa è wɔɔlɔ?» <verse eid="NUM 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 22:38"/>Ɓalaame Ɓalake wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Wɛlɛ, gè ʋaa è ʋɔ bɛ. Ɗa kaazu niina ga nà zoo ɓɔɛzu è ʋɔ ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ ɠana nɔ? Wooi nii GALA ka pu dà, naa nɔ ɠa nà bo è ma.»<verse eid="NUM 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 22:39"/>Ɓalaame ʋilɛni Ɓalake ʋolu, ti li Kiliyate-Ɠusɔte. <verse eid="NUM 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 22:40"/>Ɓalake nikɛiti ta baalagiti kulani ga zalaɠai, é Ɓalaame nɔnɔi leʋe ma, ta kundiɠiiti ti yɛni polu, ti ʋa.<verse eid="NUM 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓalaame tuya loo vai <optbreak/> Izilayɛle nuiti bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 22:41"/>Poluma zobui, Ɓalake ʋaani, é Ɓalaame laaɠomi, ti lɛ Ɓamɔte-Ɓaale, ʋɛ é ɠɛni Izilayɛle nuɓusɛi ɠilazuʋɛ ɠaazu ná.<verse eid="NUM 22:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="NUM 23"/>
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 23:1"/>Ɓalaame ɠɛni Ɓalake ma: «Zalaɠa ɠulazu lɔfela lo bɛ̀ ʋɛ, è nikɛ zinɛ lɔfela ta baala sinɛ lɔfela ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ bɛ̀ ʋɛ.» <verse eid="NUM 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 23:2"/>Ɓalake naa ɠɛɛni, nii Ɓalaame boni. Ɓalake ta Ɓalaame ti nikɛ zinɛ ɠila ta baala sinɛ ɠila kulani ga zalaɠai, zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠilagilagi. <verse eid="NUM 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 23:3"/>Ɓalaame ɠɛni Ɓalake ma: «Ɠaalɔ, è lo ɗa-ɠala zalaɠai ɠoba. Nà maaɠoozazu, tanisu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ʋaazu é dàaɠomi. Nà naama wooi laazeeli è ma, nii a kula kɛlɛma bɛ̀.» É liini gizei ta ma, nii gulu la ma. <verse eid="NUM 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 23:4"/>GALA ge ɠulani kɛlɛma Ɓalaame ʋɛ, naa ɠɛni ma: «Gè zalaɠa ɠulazu lɔfela logɛ, gè nikɛ zinɛi ta baala sinɛi ɠulaʋɛ ga zalaɠai, zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠilagilagi.»<verse eid="NUM 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 23:5"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ʋuuni Ɓalaame la, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɠale ma Ɓalake ʋɔ bɛ, è ɓɔɛ pɔ ɠani.» <verse eid="NUM 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 23:6"/>Ɓalaame ɠaleni ma Ɓalake ʋɔ bɛ, nii é ɠɛni ná-gala zalaɠai ɠoba, ta Moaɓe ɠundiɠiiti. <verse eid="NUM 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 23:7"/>Ɓalaame faalaalii nii woni, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">«Moaɓe masagi Ɓalake zeɠeʋɛ ga ze</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">Siili yooi zu gizeiti su.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">É ɠɛ mà: ‹Ʋa, è Zakɔɓe mavofodai voovo bɛ̀!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">Ʋa, è ɗa-yiiɠaawanai yei Izilayɛle laalɔɠɔma!›<verse eid="NUM 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 23:8"/>Nà naa voovoozu ɠale, nii GALA ge la foovooni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:8">Nà yiiɠula ɠale nuɓusɛiti ma, siɛgi zu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yii la ɠulani la?<verse eid="NUM 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 23:9"/>Nà yɛsu fasa ɠizeiti unmaʋɛ, gè pɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">nà yɛna gizeiti unmaʋɛ, gè pɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">nuɓusɛ ʋe é zeizu yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">zɔɠɔzu ɠa ti ʋa ta zii zɔiti.<verse eid="NUM 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 23:10"/>Ɓɛ ɠa a zoo é Zakɔɓe mavofodai ma ʋɛbɛi ɠaalu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">ɓaa é Izilayɛle nu ɓulugi ɠaalu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">Gè za, eɠɛʋelei sɔle nui zaa ʋelei la.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">Gàaɓela ʋelei ɠɛ ga nɔnɔi ɠɛʋelei.»<verse eid="NUM 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 23:11"/>Ɓalake ɠɛni Ɓalaame ma: «Leeni ɠa è kɛa ga ze? Gè è zeɠeʋɛ ga è sìli nuiti foovo, wɛlɛ ɗa ba, è ɗa tuya loo ti ʋɛ!» <verse eid="NUM 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 23:12"/>É ɠɛni ma: «Nà ɠɛna ɓɔɛa, gè la naa woga ɓaa, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI pua dà?»<verse eid="NUM 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓalaame ná-tuyai velesiɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 23:13"/>Ɓalake ɠɛ ma: «Ʋa pɔ̀ bɛ, de li ada taɠili, ʋɛ ɗa ti ɠa ná. Ɗa ti ɠilazuʋɛ nɔ ɠa, è la ti pɛ kaa, miná ɠa ɗa ti voovo ná nɔ̀un bɛ.»<verse eid="NUM 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 23:14"/>É liini la Sɔfime kpalagaʋɛ, Pizega gizei unmaʋɛ, é zalaɠa ɠulazu lɔfela lo, é nikɛ zinɛ ɠila ta baala sinɛ ɠila kula ga zalaɠai, ti ɠilagilagi maazu. <verse eid="NUM 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 23:15"/>Ɓalaame ɠɛni ma: «Lo ʋɛ ɗa-ɠala zalaɠai ɠoba, gè li munu, gè Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laaɠomi.»<verse eid="NUM 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 23:16"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠulani kɛlɛma Ɓalaame ʋɛ, é wooi ʋu da, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɠale ma Ɓalake ʋɔ bɛ, è ɓɔɛ pɔ ɠani.» <verse eid="NUM 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 23:17"/>Ɓalaame ɠaleni ma Ɓalake ʋɔ bɛ, naa ɠɛni loni ná-gala zalaɠai ɠobaʋɛ, ta Moaɓe ɠundiɠiiti. Ɓalake ɠɛni ma: «Leeni ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI bogai?»<verse eid="NUM 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 23:18"/>Ɓalaame faalaalii nii woni, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:18">«Ɓalake wuzeɠe, è woilo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:18">Sipɔɔl ná-doun zunui, woilo gòoi ma!<verse eid="NUM 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 23:19"/>GALA ge la ga nuɓusɛi, é ʋa zɛɛi wo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">ɓaa nu vulu, é ʋa zeɠe kpɔɛ wooi ʋa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">Nii é bogai, é la naa ɠɛa ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">Toɠa woo wo, é la su vai ɠɛa?<verse eid="NUM 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 23:20"/>Wɛlɛ, gè devei zɔlɔɔga ga gè tuya loo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:20">GALA ge tuya loa, gè la seɠezu ma.<verse eid="NUM 23:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 23:21"/>É la telebotala vaa ɠaani Zakɔɓe ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">é la sɔletala vaa ɠaani Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti ba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, é ga ná-GALAGI, naa ɠa tɔun polu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">toɠa masadai ma ɠoozunɛɛi zɔlɔɔ ti ʋɔ bɛ.<verse eid="NUM 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 23:22"/>GALA ge ti ɠulani Ezipete yooi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:22">suvikɛi ɠulaʋɛ ga teɠui zuvikɛi ti ʋɛ.<verse eid="NUM 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 23:23"/>Zoɠolai la ga faa nɔpɛ Zakɔɓe mavofodai ɠaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">ɓaa ungaiziɛ vai Izilayɛle laalɔɠɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">Yeeɠɛɠala ʋagɔi ma, toɠa ɗa wo Zakɔɓe ta Izilayɛle ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">nii kpein GALA ge kɛɛzu.<verse eid="NUM 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 23:24"/>Niima nuɓusɛiti ta wuzeɠezu eɠɛ zalai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">toɠa ɠaalɔsu eɠɛ zalai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">é ɗa ná-sua zogai mi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">é ɗa ná-sua zogai ma ɲamai ɓɔle,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">naa ʋoluma ɠa niina a ɗa laa la.»<verse eid="NUM 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 23:25"/>Ɓalake ɠɛni Ɓalaame ma: «Ni è la ti voovooni, mina tuya loo ti ʋɛ, ga tago ɓalaa.» <verse eid="NUM 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 23:26"/>Ɓalaame gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Gè la boni è ma ɓaa ga nà naati kpein nɔ ɠɛ, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI bosu?»<verse eid="NUM 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓalaame ná-tuyai zaʋasiɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 23:27"/>Ɓalake ɠɛni Ɓalaame ma: «Ʋa deɠɛmu, nà liizu ga ɗe adaʋɛ taɠili, tanisu GALA ka pɛtɛ názu ga ɗa nuɓusɛi niiti foovo nɔ̀un bɛ.» <verse eid="NUM 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 23:28"/>Ɓalake liini ga Ɓalaame Peyɔɔl gizei unmaʋɛ, nii é zɛlɛni teʋebai maazu. <verse eid="NUM 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 23:29"/>Ɓalaame ɠɛni Ɓalake ma: «Zalaɠa ɠulazu lɔfela lo bɛ̀, è nikɛ zinɛ lɔfela ta baala sinɛ lɔfela ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ bɛ̀ ʋɛ.» <verse eid="NUM 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 23:30"/>Ɓalake naa ɠɛɛni, nii Ɓalaame boni. É nikɛ zinɛ ɠila ta baala sinɛ ɠila kulani ga zalaɠai, zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠilagilagi.<verse eid="NUM 23:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="NUM 24"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 24:1"/>Ɓalaame pɛtɛni ga nɛɛʋɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ ga tuyai loo Izilayɛle ʋɛ, é la mɔ ɠɛni liini kulakɛlɛma ɠili gaiziɛzu, eɠɛ pelegi é ɠɛni kɛɛzu la zɔɔma ziɛgiti su, kɛlɛ é ɠaazu latini teʋebai letema ʋelei. <verse eid="NUM 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 24:2"/>É ɠaazuwuzeɠeni, é Izilayɛle ɠa ʋuuni, eɠɛʋelei ná-bolodaiti ti la. Názu ɠa GALA Zɛnvui yeini la tɔun ma. <verse eid="NUM 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 24:3"/>Ɓalaame faalaalii nii laazeelini, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:3">«Ɓeyɔɔl ná-doun zunui Ɓalaame ná-keela wooi ɠaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:3">zunui nii gaazuzeɠeai ma, ná-keela wooi ɠaa,<verse eid="NUM 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 24:4"/>nui nii é GALA gooiti mɛnisu, naa ná-keela wooi ɠaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:4">é Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii ná-kulakɛlɛmai ɠaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:4">siɛgi zu é loozu la suɠili, gaazuzeɠe ma:<verse eid="NUM 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 24:5"/>Ee Zakɔɓe, ɗa-zeɠe ɠotaiti wola ʋagɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:5">ta è-ɲiizuʋɛti ɓalaa, Izilayɛle!<verse eid="NUM 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 24:6"/>Ti ɗa yei ga zuviega eɠɛ laasamagiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">eɠɛ kpeleiti, ti ziɛ ɠobaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">eɠɛ alɔwɛ gului, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI siingai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">eɠɛ sɛdele gului, ti ziɛlaʋɛ.<verse eid="NUM 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 24:7"/>Ziɛi ɠa yeizu, é ɗa ɠula seizuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">ziɛ mɔinmɔingiti ta ná-ani zuwuiti fae.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">Ná-masagi ɠa zobogi zɔlɔɔ Agage ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">ná-masadai zɛbɛi ɠa wɔɔlɔ.<verse eid="NUM 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 24:8"/>GALA ge kulaʋɛ Ezipete yooi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">teɠui zɛbɛi ɠɛɠalai ɠa é zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">toɠa zobo sɔlɔɔ ziiti ma, ti ga sili nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">é ti-ma ɠaeiti golowolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">é ti zɔ ga ná-mɛɛinti.<verse eid="NUM 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 24:9"/>Toɠa ɓili, é ʋɛɛ eɠɛ zala zinɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">eɠɛʋelei zala zaai la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">ɓɛ ɠa a kata ga é wuzeɠe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">Nui nii a tuya loo è ʋɛ, tuya ɠa naa ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">nui nii a è voovo, foovooi ɠa naa zo.»<verse eid="NUM 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 24:10"/>Ɓalake yiiɠaawanani Ɓalaame ma, é yealoɠani, é ɠɛni Ɓalaame ma: «Gè è loligɛ ga è ʋa, è sìli nuiti foovo, wɛlɛ, ná zeizu ɠɛa saʋa, è ɗa tuya loo ti ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 24:11"/>Tɛi é ɠɛa ɠana, liina ɗa-yooi zu! Gè boni ga nà faanɛɛ mɔinmɔin kɛ è ʋɛ, kɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI è ʋalagɛ faanɛɛiti sɔlɔɔ fai ma.»<verse eid="NUM 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓalaame GALA ná-kulakɛlɛmaiti bo fai <optbreak/> Izilayɛle ná-faa zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 24:12"/>Ɓalaame Ɓalake wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Gè ɓɔɛni ɠani keelaiti pɔ, è ti leʋeni mà: <verse eid="NUM 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 24:13"/>‹Anɛɛ ni Ɓalake ɠa ʋaazu ga walii ta zanugi, nii é ná-masa pɛlɛi laavegai, é fe zèa, gè la zooga faa nɔpɛ kɛɛzu ga ma ʋagɔ, ɓaa ma ɲɔu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-devei laalɔɠɔma. Nà naa nɔ wo, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI a bo mà.› <verse eid="NUM 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 24:14"/>Niizu nà ga li nà-nuɓusɛiti pɔ. Ʋa, nà naa lɛɛzu ga ɗe, nii Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti ti ʋaazu kɛɛzu ga ɗa-nuɓusɛiti, yeeɠɛɠalaiti su ti ʋaazu.» <verse eid="NUM 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 24:15"/>Ɓalaame faalaalii nii laazeelini, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:15">«Ɓeyɔɔl ná-doun zunui Ɓalaame ná-keela wooi ɠaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:15">zunui nii gaazuzeɠeai ma, ná-keela wooi ɠaa,<verse eid="NUM 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 24:16"/>nui nii é GALA gooiti mɛnisu, naa ná-keela wooi ɠaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">nii é Anii-Pɛ-Unda ná-faaɠwɛgiti feai zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">é Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii ná-kulakɛlɛmai ɠaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">siɛgi zu é loozu la suɠili, gaazuzeɠe ma:<verse eid="NUM 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 24:17"/>Nà pɛtɛsu, kɛlɛ niizu laade dɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">nà sumɔsu, kɛlɛ maa la dɛ ɓuɠani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">ʋelela ʋelei, somideɠai ta ɠa ɠulazu Zakɔɓe mavofodai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">masadai ma lukpɔi ɠa ɠɛ Izilayɛle zaama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">nii a ɠɛ Moaɓe nuiti goizuloɠazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">toɠa Sɛte ná-doun zunuiti kpein doɠa tɔungi zu.<verse eid="NUM 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 24:18"/>Toɠa Edɔme yooi zo, é ɠɛ ga nɔnɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:18">sili nuiti su, Seyiil yooi ɠa zo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:18">Izilayɛle ɠa ná-zeeɠaaɓaai lɛ.<verse eid="NUM 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 24:19"/>Nui nii é ɠulazu Zakɔɓe mavofodai zu, naa ɠa masadai ɠɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:19">toɠa naati undaaʋili, niiti ti ʋelazu, ti ɠula taaiti ba.»<verse eid="NUM 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓalaame Izilayɛle zili nuiti <optbreak/> koloɠolo fai wo fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 24:20"/>Ɓalaame Amalɛke ɠaani. É faalaalii nii laazeelini, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:20">«Amalɛke ɠa é ga ziiti pɛ ti-ma mɔungi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:20">Kɛlɛ gaaɓelasu, toɠa ɠoloɠolosu.»<verse eid="NUM 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 24:21"/>É Ken nuiti kaani. É faalaalii nii laazeelini, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:21">«È-zeizuʋɛ logɛ kpe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:21">è-laɠagi logɛ fasa ɠizei ma.<verse eid="NUM 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 24:22"/>Kɛlɛ Ken nuiti ta ɠɛ ga abui laamianigi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:22">Gaaɓelasu, Asuul nuiti ta li ga woye, ti wo ɠɛ ga kasoɠa nuiti.»<verse eid="NUM 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 24:23"/>Gaaɓelasu, é faalaalii nii laazeelini, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:23">«Ee, maanɔɠɔi nii é ʋaazu! Ɓɛ ɠa a yɛ vulua GALA ná-kɛɛwotii luɠɔ?<verse eid="NUM 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 24:24"/>Kɛlɛ keingiti ti ziɛi ɠa, ti ʋaazu, ti zeɠe Kitime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:24">ta Asuul nuiti maanɔɠɔ, ti Eɓɛɛl nuiti maanɔɠɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:24">Tɔ ɓalaa toɠa liizu undaaʋiligi zu.»<verse eid="NUM 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 24:25"/>Ɓalaame liini, é ɠale ma ná-zooi zu. Ɓalake ɓalaagi liini ga ʋɔ pelei.<verse eid="NUM 24:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="NUM 25"/>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɓɔɠɔ lɔɔ vai <optbreak/> kɔɔɠɔ gani kɔɔ vaiti su</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 25:1"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti zeini Sitime. Nuɓusɛiti ti tɔɔzeini ga ɓɔɠɔ lɔa koloɠologi zu, ta Moaɓe anzanu lointi. <verse eid="NUM 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 25:2"/>Naati ti ti lolini ga ti zalaɠai ɠula ta-ɠalagiti bɛ. Nuɓusɛiti ti vaani bu, ti zalaɠa laamii wo, ti nɔkɔ naati ta-ɠalagiti bu. <verse eid="NUM 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 25:3"/>Ti ʋɔɔpɛɛni naati ta-ɠalagi Ɓaale-Peyɔɔl lɛbi vai ʋa. Naama vai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiiɠaawanani ti laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="NUM 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 25:4"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Moize ma: «Nuɓusɛiti kpein gaalɛ ba, è ta-ɠundiɠiiti sɛlɛ guluiti ba, foloi ɠa, gàazu, naa ɠa a kɛ nà-ziiɠaawanai zeɠe Izilayɛle maala.» <verse eid="NUM 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 25:5"/>Moize ɠɛni Izilayɛle lukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti ma: «Wo ɠilagilagi ná-nuiti paa, niiti ti ʋɔɔpɛai Ɓaale-Peyɔɔl lɛbi vai ʋa.»<verse eid="NUM 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 25:6"/>Zunu ɠila ge ɠɛni Izilayɛle nuiti saama, é ʋaani ga Madiyan anzanu ɠila kɛɛɠɛlointi saama, Moize ta Izilayɛle ʋɛbɛi kpein gaazu, naazu naati ti ɗa wɔlɔ, GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 25:7"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui Aalɔn ná-doun zunui Eleazaal ná-doun zunui Fineyase naama vai ɠaai ma, é wuzeɠeni bɛbɛi zaama, é kpɛɛin zeɠe, <verse eid="NUM 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 25:8"/>é ʋilɛ Izilayɛle zunui ʋolu ná-seɠe ɠotai wu, é ti felegɔ pɛ sɔ ʋɔɔma, kpɛɛin zunui volokula, é anzanui zo kobuʋɛ. Naazu maanɔɠɔ vai ɓeni Izilayɛle nuiti saama. <verse eid="NUM 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 25:9"/>Nu waaʋuufelegɔ maazu naanigɔ (24.000) ɠa é zaani maanɔɠɔi naa zu.<verse eid="NUM 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 25:10"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 25:11"/>«Zalaɠa ɠula nui, Aalɔn ná-doun zunui Eleazaal ná-doun zunui Fineyase ɠa é nà-ziiɠaawanai zeɠea Izilayɛle nuiti maala, nà-ziizoolɛi ɠa é ma ti zaama, naa ɠa é kɛa, nɛ̀i gè ga GALAGI, nà pɔ ga ti nà ɠila nɔ dɛ̀bi, nà-ziiɠaawanai zu, gè la mɔ Izilayɛle nuiti ma zuwu ɠaaleʋeni. <verse eid="NUM 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 25:12"/>Naa ɠa é ba, ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Gè minazeɠegi ɠɛa tɔun bɛ, nii a ɠɛ ga ziilɛigi ma ungi. <verse eid="NUM 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 25:13"/>Toɠa ɠɛ ga tɔun nɔnɔ, ta mavofodaiti. Zalaɠa ɠula wotii ɠa ɠɛ ga tɔnɔ, yeeɠɛɠalai pɛ su, tɔɔzei é ná-ziizoolɛi ɠulaʋɛ kɛlɛma ná-GALAGI ʋɛ, é koto gba vai ɠɛɛʋɛ Izilayɛle nuiti ta-vaa zu.› »<verse eid="NUM 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 25:14"/>Izilayɛle zunui ti paani ta Madiyan anzanui ʋɔɔma, daaseigi ɠɛni ga Zimili, Salu ná-doun zunui. É ɠɛni ga Simiyɔn ná-pɛlɛyeɠe ɠundiɠii ta. <verse eid="NUM 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 25:15"/>Madiyan anzanui nii ti paani, daaseigi ɠɛni ga Koziɓi, kɛɛɠɛ laaseigi ɠɛni ga Suul, nii é ɠɛni ga bolodama mɔinmɔin ma ɠundiɠii, kulaai bolodai gila su Madiyan yooi zu.<verse eid="NUM 25:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 25:16"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 25:17"/>«Vala Madiyan nuiti ba, è ti-ma zuwu ɠaaleʋe. <verse eid="NUM 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 25:18"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ti ɠɛni ga wo zili nuiti, ti laavegai ga keleɠele ɲɔi, Peyɔɔl ná-fai zu, ta Koziɓi, nii é ɠɛni ga Madiyan ɠundiɠii ta ná-doun anzanui, nii é zaani ga maanɔɠɔi, tɔɔzei Peyɔɔl ná-fai ʋa.»<verse eid="NUM 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle nuiti gaalu daa velesiɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 25:19"/>Maanɔɠɔ vai naa leʋega ʋoluma,<verse eid="NUM 25:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="NUM 26"/>
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 26:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Moize ta zalaɠa ɠula nui Eleazaal ma, nii é ga Aalɔn ná-doun zunui: <verse eid="NUM 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 26:2"/>«À Izilayɛle ʋɛbɛi kpein gaalu, é zo kona ʋuufelegɔ (20) ma, é lɛ zeemaazu, eɠɛʋelei ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti ti la, Izilayɛle nuiti kpein su, niiti ta zoo ti li kɔɔmaʋɛ.» <verse eid="NUM 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 26:3"/>Moize ta zalaɠa ɠula nui Eleazaal, ti ɓɔɛni ti ʋɔ Moaɓe nɛmɛi zu, Zuludɛn ɠobaʋɛ, Zeliko letemaʋɛ, ti ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 26:4"/>«Ada ʋaazu gaalugi wosu, é zo kona ʋuufelegɔ (20) ma, é lɛ zeemaazu, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni la Moize ya.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 26:4">Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti pɛtɛ, niiti ti ɠulani Ezipete yooi ʋa:<verse eid="NUM 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 26:5"/>Izilayɛle nii daa ga Zakɔɓe, ná-doun zunu mɔungi é sɔlɔɔni, daaseigi ɠɛni ga Luɓɛn. Luɓɛn ná-doun zunuiti ti-mavofodaiti, ti ɠɛni ga: Enɔke mavofodaiti, Palu mavofodaiti, <verse eid="NUM 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 26:6"/>Ɠɛsɛlon mavofodaiti, ta Kaalemi mavofodaiti. <verse eid="NUM 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 26:7"/>Luɓɛn mavofodaiti tiegɔi ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuunaani maazu saʋagɔ undɔfela puusaʋagɔ (43.730). <verse eid="NUM 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 26:8"/>Palu ná-doun zunui ɠɛni ga Eliyaɓe. <verse eid="NUM 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 26:9"/>Naa ɠa é ɠɛni ga Nemuwɛle kɛɛɠɛ, ta Datan, ta Aɓilame. Datan naa, ta Aɓilame ti ɠɛni ga kundiɠiiti bɛbɛi untuɠɔ, ti wuzeɠeni Moize ta Aalɔn laalɔɠɔma, ta Kolé ná-nu ɓulugiti, siɛgi zu ti wuzeɠeni la Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="NUM 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 26:10"/>Zooi laaʋalini, é ti maalɔɔɠu, ta Kolé, siɛgi zu ná-nu ɓulugiti ti zaani la, ta siɛgi zu abui zunu unfelegɔ puulɔɔlugɔ (250) ɠalani la. Ti ɠɛni nuɓusɛiti bɛ ga kizɛsu vai. <verse eid="NUM 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 26:11"/>Kɛlɛ Kolé ná-doun zunuiti ti la ɠɛni zaani.<verse eid="NUM 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 26:12"/>Simiyɔn ná-doun zunuiti, eɠɛʋelei ti-mavofodaiti ti la, ti ɠɛni ga: Nemuwɛle mavofodaiti, Yamin mavofodaiti, Yakin mavofodaiti, <verse eid="NUM 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 26:13"/>Zela mavofodaiti, ta Sayile mavofodaiti. <verse eid="NUM 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 26:14"/>Simiyɔn mavofodaiti tiegɔi ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuufele maazu fele unfelegɔ (22.200).<verse eid="NUM 26:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 26:15"/>Gade ná-doun zunuiti, eɠɛʋelei ti-mavofodaiti ti la, ti ɠɛni ga: Sefon mavofodaiti, Ɠagi mavofodaiti, Suni mavofodaiti, <verse eid="NUM 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 26:16"/>Wozeni mavofodaiti, Eli mavofodaiti, <verse eid="NUM 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 26:17"/>Alode mavofodaiti, ta Aleli mavofodaiti. <verse eid="NUM 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 26:18"/>Gade mavofodaiti tiegɔi ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuunaanigɔ undɔɔlugɔ (40.500).<verse eid="NUM 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 26:19"/>Zuda ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga Ɛɛl ta Wonan. Ɛɛl ta Wonan ti zaani Kanaan yooi zu. <verse eid="NUM 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 26:20"/>Zuda ná-doun zunuiti, eɠɛʋelei ti-mavofodaiti ti la, ti ɠɛni ga: Sela mavofodaiti, Pelɛze mavofodaiti, ta Zela mavofodaiti. <verse eid="NUM 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 26:21"/>Pelɛze ná-doun zunuiti ti-mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni ga: Ɠɛsɛlon mavofodaiti ta Ɠamule mavofodaiti. <verse eid="NUM 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 26:22"/>Zuda mavofodaiti tiegɔi ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuulɔfela maazu lɔzita undɔɔlugɔ (76.500).<verse eid="NUM 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 26:23"/>Isakaal ná-doun zunuiti, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la, ti ɠɛni ga: Tola mavofodaiti, Puva mavofodaiti, <verse eid="NUM 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 26:24"/>Yasuɓe mavofodaiti, ta Similon mavofodaiti. <verse eid="NUM 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 26:25"/>Isakaal mavofodaiti tiegɔi ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuulɔzita maazu naani unsaʋagɔ (64.300).<verse eid="NUM 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 26:26"/>Zaɓulɔn ná-doun zunuiti, eɠɛʋelei ti-mavofodaiti ti la, ti ɠɛni ga: Selɛde mavofodaiti, Elon mavofodaiti, ta Yaleyɛle mavofodaiti. <verse eid="NUM 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 26:27"/>Zaɓulɔn mavofodaiti tiegɔi ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuulɔzita undɔɔlugɔ (60.500).<verse eid="NUM 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 26:28"/>Zozɛfe ná-doun zunuiti, eɠɛʋelei ti-mavofodaiti ti la, ti ɠɛni ga: Manasé ta Efelayime. <verse eid="NUM 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 26:29"/>Manasé ná-doun zunuiti ti-mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni ga: Makiil mavofodaiti, Galaade mavofodaiti, nii é ɠɛni ga Makiil ná-doun zunui. <verse eid="NUM 26:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 26:30"/>Galaade ná-doun zunuiti ti-mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni ga: Yezɛɛl mavofodaiti, Ɠelɛke mavofodaiti, <verse eid="NUM 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 26:31"/>Asaliyɛle mavofodaiti, Sikɛme mavofodaiti, <verse eid="NUM 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 26:32"/>Semida mavofodaiti, ta Ɠefɛɛl mavofodaiti. <verse eid="NUM 26:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 26:33"/>Ɠefɛɛl ná-doun zunui Selofeɠade la ɠɛni doun zunua zɔlɔɔni, kɛlɛ é doun anzanuiti sɔlɔɔni, ti-laaseigiti kaa: Maala, Noa, Wogela, Milika ta Tiilesa. <verse eid="NUM 26:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 26:34"/>Manasé mavofodaiti tiegɔi ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuulɔɔlugɔ maazu felegɔ undɔfela (52.700).<verse eid="NUM 26:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 26:35"/>Efelayime ná-doun zunuiti, eɠɛʋelei ti-mavofodaiti ti la, ti ɠɛni ga: Sutela mavofodaiti, Ɓekɛɛl mavofodaiti, ta Taɠan mavofodaiti. <verse eid="NUM 26:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 26:36"/>Sutela ná-doun zunuiti ti-mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni ga: Elan mavofodaiti. <verse eid="NUM 26:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 26:37"/>Efelayime mavofodaiti tiegɔi ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuusaʋagɔ maazu felegɔ undɔɔlugɔ (32.500). Zozɛfe ná-doun zunuiti kana, eɠɛʋelei ti-mavofodaiti ti la.<verse eid="NUM 26:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 26:38"/>Ɓɛnzamɛn ná-doun zunuiti, eɠɛʋelei ti-mavofodaiti ti la, ti ɠɛni ga: Ɓela mavofodaiti, Asaɓɛle mavofodaiti, Ayilame mavofodaiti, <verse eid="NUM 26:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 26:39"/>Sufame mavofodaiti, ta Ɠufame mavofodaiti. <verse eid="NUM 26:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 26:40"/>Ɓela ná-doun zunuiti ti-mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni ga: Aalede mavofodaiti ta Naaman mavofodaiti. <verse eid="NUM 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 26:41"/>Ɓɛnzamɛn mavofodaiti tiegɔi ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuunaani maazu lɔɔlugɔ undɔzita (45.600).<verse eid="NUM 26:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 26:42"/>Dan ná-doun zunuiti, eɠɛʋelei ti-mavofodaiti ti la, ti ɠɛni ga: Suɠame mavofodaiti. <verse eid="NUM 26:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 26:43"/>Suɠame mavofodaiti tiegɔi ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuulɔzita maazu naanigɔ unnaanigɔ (64.400).<verse eid="NUM 26:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 26:44"/>Asɛɛl ná-doun zunuiti, eɠɛʋelei ti-mavofodaiti ti la, ti ɠɛni ga: Yimina mavofodaiti, Yisivi mavofodaiti, ta Ɓelia mavofodaiti. <verse eid="NUM 26:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 26:45"/>Ɓelia ná-doun zunuiti ti-mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni ga: Ɠeɓɛɛl mavofodaiti ta Malekiyɛle mavofodaiti. <verse eid="NUM 26:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 26:46"/>Anzanu loun ɠɛni Asɛɛl ya, daaseigi ɠɛni ga Sela. <verse eid="NUM 26:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 26:47"/>Asɛɛl mavofodaiti tiegɔi ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuulɔɔlugɔ maazu saʋagɔ unnaanigɔ (53.400).<verse eid="NUM 26:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 26:48"/>Nɛfɛtali ná-doun zunuiti, eɠɛʋelei ti-mavofodaiti ti la, ti ɠɛni ga: Yaseyɛle mavofodaiti, Guni mavofodaiti, <verse eid="NUM 26:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 26:49"/>Yesɛɛl mavofodaiti, ta Sileme mavofodaiti. <verse eid="NUM 26:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 26:50"/>Nɛfɛtali mavofodaiti tiegɔi ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuunaanigɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ unnaanigɔ (45.400).<verse eid="NUM 26:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 26:51"/>Izilayɛle nuiti tiegɔi ɠɛni ga zunu waaundɔzita maazu ɠila undɔfela puusaʋagɔ (601.730).<verse eid="NUM 26:51"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zooi ɠaaɠwɛɛ vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 26:52"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 26:53"/>«Zooi ɠaaɠwɛ bolodaiti ba, é zoloo nuiti tiegɔiti ma. <verse eid="NUM 26:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 26:54"/>Bolodaiti ti mɔinɗai, ɗa zooi ve ti ya ga bɔɔlɔa, niiti ti lɔiɗai, è zooi tago ve ti ya. Ɛsɛ gilagilagi ná-zooi ɠa ve zea, é zoloo ti-liegɔi ma. <verse eid="NUM 26:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 26:55"/>Kɛlɛ zooi ɠaa ɠa ɠwɛ ga kpakutoomai. Ta ti zɔlɔɔ ga tɔnɔ, eɠɛʋelei ti-ɠɛɛni ta-wolodaiti daaseigi la. <verse eid="NUM 26:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 26:56"/>Zooi ɠaa ɠa ɠwɛ ga kpakutoomai, naati zɔɠɔzu, niiti ti wola mɔinɗai, ta niiti ti wola la mɔinni.»<verse eid="NUM 26:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Levi nuiti gaalu daa velesiɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 26:57"/>Levi nuiti, ti ɠaaluni, eɠɛʋelei ti-mavofodaiti ti la, ti ɠɛni ga: Gɛɛlɛson mavofodaiti, Keɠate mavofodaiti, ta Melali mavofodaiti. <verse eid="NUM 26:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 26:58"/>Levi mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni ga: Liɓini mavofodaiti, Eɓelɔn mavofodaiti, Maali mavofodaiti, Musi mavofodaiti, ta Kolé mavofodaiti. Keɠate Amalame zɔlɔɔni. <verse eid="NUM 26:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 26:59"/>Amalame anzai laaseigi ɠɛni ga Yokeɓɛde, Levi ná-doun anzanui, nii é zɔlɔɔni Levi ʋɛ Ezipete yooi zu. É dounɠa zɔlɔɔni Amalame ʋɛ ga Aalɔn ta Moize, ta Miliyame, nii é ɠɛni ga ti-ʋaazeelai. <verse eid="NUM 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 26:60"/>Niiti ti zɔlɔɔni Aalɔn ʋɛ ti ɠɛni ga Nadaɓe, Aɓiyu, naa ʋɛɛ Eleazaal ʋa, ta Itamaal. <verse eid="NUM 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 26:61"/>Nadaɓe ta Aɓiyu ti zaani, naa ɠɛni siɛgi zu ti ʋaani la ga abu ɠiligi Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠakala.<verse eid="NUM 26:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 26:62"/>Niiti ti ɠaaluni, zunuiti kpein é zo alu gila ma, é lɛ zeemaazu, zunuiti ta zunu lointi, ti ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuufele maazu saʋagɔ (23.000). Ti la ɠɛni ti ʋɛɛni Izilayɛle nuiti ba, ti ʋa ti ɠaalu, mazɔlɔɔ zou la ɠɛni veeni ti ya Izilayɛle nuiti saama.<verse eid="NUM 26:62"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gaalugi unseizuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 26:63"/>Naati ka Moize ta Eleazaal ti ti ɠaaluni Moaɓe nɛmɛiti su, Zuludɛn ɠobaʋɛ, Zeliko letemaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 26:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 26:64"/>Niiti kpein Moize ta zalaɠa ɠula nui Aalɔn ti ti ɠaaluni Sinayi teʋebai zu, naa tanɔpɛ ge la mɔ ɠɛni niiti saama. <verse eid="NUM 26:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 26:65"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni ti ma: «Ta zaazu teʋebai zu.» Gila kpalaa ge la ɠɛni yɛni vulua, é ɠula Yefuné ná-doun zunui Kalɛɓe ʋolu, ta Nun ná-doun zunui Zozuwe.<verse eid="NUM 26:65"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="NUM 27"/>
  <para style="s">Tɔgi é lo anzanuiti <optbreak/> ta-ʋogani zeɠe vaiti ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 27:1"/>Anzanu loun lɔɔlugɔ ɠɛni ná, ti-laaseigi ga: Maala, Noa, Wogela, Milika, ta Tiilesa. Ti-ɠɛɛ laaseigi ɠɛni ga Selofeɠade, Ɠefɛɛl ná-doun zunui, nii mɛmɛwolani ti ɠɛni ga Galaade, ta Makiil, ta Manasé, ta Zozɛfe. Anzanui naati ka ti ʋaani, <verse eid="NUM 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 27:2"/>ti lo Moize ɠakala, ta Eleazaal, ta kundiɠiiti, ta bɛbɛi kpein, GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ, ti ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 27:3"/>«Gi-ɠɛɛ zaaʋɛ teʋebai zu, kɛlɛ é la ɠɛni naati ta-ɓɔgi zu, niiti ti wuzeɠeni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laalɔɠɔma, Kolé ná-nu ɓulugiti, kɛlɛ é zaani ga kpɔɠɔ ɠotoi maaʋele, doun zunu la ɠɛni zea. <verse eid="NUM 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 27:4"/>Leeni vaa zu gi-ɠɛɛ laaseigi a ɠula ná-bolodai zaama, tɔɔzei doun zunu ʋalagi maaʋele ma? Gi-ʋɔɔda ve, gi-ɠɛɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi saama.»<verse eid="NUM 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 27:5"/>Moize liini ga ti-maavai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠakala. <verse eid="NUM 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 27:6"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Moize ma: <verse eid="NUM 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 27:7"/>«Gaamai ɠa Selofeɠade ná-doun anzanuiti ti bosu. Ɗa zooi ve ti ya, é ɠɛ ga tɔnɔi, ti-ɠɛɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi saama. Tiya ɠa ɗa ti-ɠɛɛ nɔnɔi leʋe ti ʋɔ. <verse eid="NUM 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 27:8"/>Ɗa ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ, è ɠɛ ti ma: Siɛgi zu zunui ta zaazu la, é la doun zunu yɛni, wa ná-poganii ve ná-doun anzanui ya. <verse eid="NUM 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 27:9"/>Ni doun anzanu la zea, wa ná-poganii ve kɛɛɠɛlointi zea. <verse eid="NUM 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 27:10"/>Ni kɛɛɠɛlounɠa ti la bɛ, wa ná-poganii ve kɛɛɠɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi zea. <verse eid="NUM 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 27:11"/>Ni kɛɛɠɛlounɠa ti la kɛɛɠɛ ʋɛ, wa ná-poganii leʋe ná-nu ɠiteɠitegi ta ʋɔ bolodai zu, naa ɠa a yɛ zea. Toɠa ɠɛ ga devei ta tɔgi Izilayɛle nuiti bɛ, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni la Moize ya.»<verse eid="NUM 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zozuwe ɠɛɛ vai ga Moize ʋotogi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 31:1-8">Tɔ Sɛʋɛi Velesiɛi 31:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 27:12"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Moize ma: «Lɛ Aɓalime ɠizei nii ma, è wɛlɛ zooi ʋa, gè feezu Izilayɛle nuiti bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 27:13"/>Ɗa wɛlɛzu ba, kɛlɛ ɗa ɓalaagi ɗa zaazu, è li è-mɛmɛwolani pɔ, ti zaai, eɠɛʋelei è-ɠɛɛloin Aalɔn zaani la, é li mɛmɛwolani pɔ ti zaai. <verse eid="NUM 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 27:14"/>Mazɔlɔɔ wo ɠɛɛʋɛ ga kololala nuiti nà-devei laalɔɠɔma, Sin teʋebai zu, siɛgi zu bɛbɛi zu nuɓusɛiti ti maaɠaalii ɠɛɛni la, ti kpɔɛi ʋɛɛ bà. Wo la ɠɛni nà-ɲadedai maawuini nuɓusɛiti gaazu, é lo ziɛi vai ʋa, ti ɠɛni maalolisu.» (Naa ɠɛni ga Meliɓa ɗɛi ná-fai é ɠɛni Kadɛse, Sin teʋebai zu.)<verse eid="NUM 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 27:15"/>Moize ɓɔɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 27:16"/>«Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI é ga kpusɛi kpein ta-zɛnvuiti ta-ƓALAGI, ɗa ɓɔɠɔi yiimazeɠe ga nu, è sei bɛbɛi unda, é ɠɛ ga kundiɠii, <verse eid="NUM 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 27:17"/>nui nii a ɠɛ losu ti untuɠɔ kɔɔɠɔzuʋɛti, é ɗa li ga tiye, é ɗa ʋa ga tiye, nii a kɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-nuɓusɛiti ti mina ɠɛ eɠɛʋelei baalagiti ti la, ti makɛ nu la ná.»<verse eid="NUM 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 27:18"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Moize ma: «Nun ná-doun zunui Zozuwe zeɠe, zunu ʋe nii zɛnvui zeini su, ɗa yeela ma. <verse eid="NUM 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 27:19"/>Ɗa lii la, è sei zalaɠa ɠula nui Eleazaal ɠakala, ta bɛbɛi kpein, è deveiti fe zea ti ɠaazu. <verse eid="NUM 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 27:20"/>Ɗa ɗa-ɠundiɠilai ma zobogi ta ve zea, naa ɠa a kɛ Izilayɛle ʋɛbɛi ɠolo bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 27:21"/>Toɠa zei zalaɠa ɠula nui Eleazaal ɠakala, naa ɠa ɗa gàazaɠa tɔun bɛ, ga anii nii daaseigi ga wuulimegi. Nii nɔpɛ a bona, ʋele ɠana Zozuwe ta Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti ta ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ vaiti so da.»<verse eid="NUM 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 27:22"/>Moize kɛɛni, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni la zea. É Zozuwe zeini zalaɠa ɠula nui Eleazaal ɠakala, ta bɛbɛi kpein. <verse eid="NUM 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 27:23"/>É yeeiti daani ma, é deveiti fe zea, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI boni la ma.<verse eid="NUM 27:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="NUM 28"/>
  <para style="s">Tɔgi é lo zalaɠaiti ba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 29:38-46">Ɛgezɔde 29:38-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 28:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 28:2"/>«Niima levei laazeeli Izilayɛle nuiti ma, è ɠɛ ti ma: Wa dama kpɛ, wo nɔ̀nɔ ma vebɛanii ve, yeeɠɛɠala ʋagɔi zu, é ga nà-zalaɠaiti, daamianigiti ti ɠalazu abui ɠa, ti bɛ̀ ga ani maku nɛai. <verse eid="NUM 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 28:3"/>Ɗa ɠɛ ti ma: Folo-o-folo, wa kona gila baala sinɛ felegɔ ɠula, nii nɛɛʋuzu la ba, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ ga gala zalaɠai, nii abui galazu. <verse eid="NUM 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 28:4"/>Ɗa baala ziʋoi ɠilagi ɠula ga zalaɠai sobui, è zɔɔma ʋaala ziʋoi ɠula ga zalaɠai kpɔkɔi, <verse eid="NUM 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 28:5"/>naa ʋɛɛ vebɛ zalaɠai ʋa, nii é ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi kilo saʋagɔ, gaayɔgai ga wolive wulɔ ʋagɔi litɛlɛ ɠila ta tukpɛ (1,5). <verse eid="NUM 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 28:6"/>Gala zalaɠai ɠana, folo-o-folo, nii é ɠɛɛzu ɠulazu, eɠɛʋelei deveai la Sinayi gizei ma. Zalaɠai ʋe, nii abui galazu, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 28:7"/>Wa puya zalaɠai ɓɔ baala ziʋo mɔungi ʋa, ga dɔɔ ɓaagi litɛlɛ ɠila ta tukpɛ (1,5), ada ɲadegai zu ɠa wa puya zalaɠai naa ɠula ná, ga dɔɔ ɓaagi Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 28:8"/>Baala ziʋoi velesiɛi ɠa ɠula ga zalaɠai kpɔkɔi, vebɛ zalaɠai ta puya zalaɠai, niiti ti ɓɔgai sobu gelei ʋa, naa ma ziiti nɔ ɓɔ ba. Zalaɠai ʋe, nii abui galazu, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ.<verse eid="NUM 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dooɠo foloi ma zalaɠaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 28:9"/>«Dooɠo foloi, wa baala ziʋo felegɔ ɠula ga zalaɠai, niiti ti kona gila nɔ ɠɛa, nɛɛʋuzu nɔpɛ ge la ba, è vebɛ zalaɠai ʋu ma ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi kilo lɔzita, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi, puya zalaɠai ʋu ma. <verse eid="NUM 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 28:10"/>Wa gala zalaɠai naa ɠula dooɠo foloi ɠilagilagi. Naa kpein ge ɓɔ gala zalaɠai ʋa, é ɠulazu folo-o-folo, ta ná-puya zalaɠai.<verse eid="NUM 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alugi laaɠulazuʋɛ ma zalaɠai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 28:11"/>«Alugi laaɠulazuʋɛ, wa nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpa felegɔ ɠula ga gala zalaɠai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ta baala sinɛ ɠila, ta kona gila baala sinɛ lɔfela, nɛɛʋuzu mina ɠɛ ti ʋa. <verse eid="NUM 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 28:12"/>Wa vebɛ zalaɠai ʋɛɛ gala zalaɠa zuaiti ba, toɠa ɠɛ ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi: kilo taaʋuugɔ nikɛ zinɛi ɠilagilagi ʋɛ, ta kilo lɔzita baala sinɛi ʋɛ, <verse eid="NUM 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 28:13"/>ta kilo saʋagɔ baala ziʋoi ɠilagilagi ʋɛ. Gala zalaɠai ʋe, zalaɠai nii abui galazu, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 28:14"/>Puya zalaɠaiti ta ɠɛɛzu ga dɔɔi litɛlɛ saʋagɔ, é ʋɛɛ nikɛ zinɛ ɠilagi ʋa, litɛlɛ felegɔ ʋɛɛ baala sinɛi ʋa, ta litɛlɛ ɠila ta tukpɛ (1,5) ge ʋɛɛ baala ziʋoi ʋa. Gala zalaɠaiti kana, ta ɠɛ ɠulazu alugi laaɠulazuʋɛ, alu-o-alu, konagi zu. <verse eid="NUM 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 28:15"/>Wa boli zinɛi ɠula ɓalaa ga koto gba zalaɠai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. Naa kpein ge ɓɔ gala zalaɠai ʋa, é ɠulazu folo-o-folo, ta ná-puya zalaɠai.<verse eid="NUM 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pakegi ma zalaɠaiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:5-14">Levi Nuiti 23:5-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 28:16"/>«Alu mɔungi ma volo puugɔ maazu naanisiɛi (14) ɠa ɠɛɛzu ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-Pakegi.<verse eid="NUM 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 28:17"/>«Alugi naa ma volo puugɔ maazu lɔɔlusiɛi (15) ɠa fɛtii lɔɔzeizu ma. Ɓului nii lɛʋɛ la su, naa ɠa wa ɠɛ miizu eyɛsu folo lɔfela. <verse eid="NUM 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 28:18"/>Folo mɔungi, wa gaalɛba ɲadegai wo, wo la boti nɔpɛ kɛa, eɠɛʋelei wa ɗa kɛ la, <verse eid="NUM 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 28:19"/>wa nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpa felegɔ ɠula ga gala zalaɠai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ta baala sinɛ ɠila, ta kona gila baala sinɛ lɔfela, nɛɛʋuzu mina ɠɛ ti ʋa. <verse eid="NUM 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 28:20"/>Wa vebɛ zalaɠai ʋɛɛ gala zalaɠa zuaiti ba, toɠa ɠɛ ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi: kilo taaʋuugɔ nikɛ zinɛi ɠilagilagi ʋɛ, ta kilo lɔzita baala sinɛi ʋɛ, <verse eid="NUM 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 28:21"/>ta kilo saʋagɔ baala ziʋoi ɠilagilagi ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 28:22"/>Wa boli zinɛ ɠila kula ga koto gba zalaɠai, naa ɠa a kɛ koto gba vai ɠɛ wo ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 28:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 28:23"/>Naati kpein ta laazu gala zalaɠai maazu, é ɠulazu sobu-o-sobu. <verse eid="NUM 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 28:24"/>Folo-o-folo, folo lɔfela laawu, wa naama laamianigiti kula, nii abui galazu, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. Wa ti ɠula ga zalaɠai, é ɓɔ gala zalaɠai ʋa, é ɠulazu folo-o-folo, ta ná-puya zalaɠai. <verse eid="NUM 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 28:25"/>Foloi lɔfelasiɛi, wa gaalɛba ɲadegai wo, wo la boti nɔpɛ kɛa, eɠɛʋelei wa ɗa kɛ la.<verse eid="NUM 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pantekote voloi ma zalaɠaiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:15-22">Levi Nuiti 23:15-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 28:26"/>«Zooi ʋaalɔnɔ mɔungiti ma ɠoozunɛ voloi, wo ʋaazu vebɛ zalaɠai veezu la Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ga ani niinɛiti, dɔɔɠɔiti ma vɛtii, wa gaalɛba ɲadegai wo, wo la boti nɔpɛ kɛa, eɠɛʋelei wa ɗa kɛ la. <verse eid="NUM 28:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 28:27"/>Wa nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpa felegɔ ɠula ga gala zalaɠai, ta baala sinɛ ɠila, ta kona gila baala sinɛ lɔfela, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 28:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 28:28"/>Wa vebɛ zalaɠai ʋɛɛ gala zalaɠa zuaiti ba, toɠa ɠɛ ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi: kilo taaʋuugɔ nikɛ zinɛi ɠilagilagi ʋɛ, ta kilo lɔzita baala sinɛi ʋɛ, <verse eid="NUM 28:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 28:29"/>ta kilo saʋagɔ baala ziʋoi ɠilagilagi ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 28:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 28:30"/>Wa boli zinɛi ɠula ɓalaa, naa ɠa a kɛ koto gba vai ɠɛ wo ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 28:31"/>Wa suai niiti kula, nɛɛʋuzu mina ɠɛ ti ʋa, ta ta-ʋuya zalaɠaiti. Naa kpein ge ɓɔ gala zalaɠai ʋa, é ɠulazu folo-o-folo, ta ná-vebɛanii.<verse eid="NUM 28:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="NUM 29"/>
  <para style="s">Puʋu fɛɛ vɛtii ma zalaɠaiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:23-25">Levi Nuiti 23:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 29:1"/>«Alugi lɔfelasiɛi ma volo mɔungi, wa gaalɛba ɲadegai wo. Wo la boti nɔpɛ kɛa, eɠɛʋelei wa ɗa kɛ la. Toɠa ɠɛ wo ʋɛ ga puʋu fɛɛ yeei. <verse eid="NUM 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 29:2"/>Wa nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpa gila kula ga gala zalaɠai, ta baala sinɛ ɠila, ta kona gila baala sinɛ lɔfela, nɛɛʋuzu mina ɠɛ ti ʋa, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 29:3"/>Wa vebɛ zalaɠai ʋɛɛ gala zalaɠa zuaiti ba, toɠa ɠɛ ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi: kilo taaʋuugɔ nikɛ zinɛi ʋɛ, ta kilo lɔzita baala sinɛi ʋɛ, <verse eid="NUM 29:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 29:4"/>ta kilo saʋagɔ baala ziʋoi ɠilagilagi ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 29:5"/>Wa boli zinɛ ɠila kula ga koto gba zalaɠai, naa ɠa a kɛ koto gba vai ɠɛ wo ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 29:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 29:6"/>Naama zalaɠaiti ta ɓɔ gala zalaɠaiti ba, niiti ti ɠulazu alu-o-alu ta folo-o-folo, ta ta-vebɛ zalaɠaiti, ta ta-ʋuya zalaɠaiti, eɠɛʋelei deveai la tɔgi zu ta-vaa zu. Zalaɠaiti be, niiti abui ti ɠalazu, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ.<verse eid="NUM 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Koto gba voloi ma zalaɠaiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:26-32">Levi Nuiti 23:26-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 29:7"/>«Alugi lɔfelasiɛi ma volo puugɔi ma, wa gaalɛba ɲadegai wo. Wa zugi zo, wo la boti nɔpɛ kɛa. <verse eid="NUM 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 29:8"/>Wa nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpa gila kula ga gala zalaɠai, ta baala sinɛ ɠila, ta kona gila baala sinɛ lɔfelaiti, nɛɛʋuzu mina ɠɛ ti ʋa, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 29:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 29:9"/>Wa vebɛ zalaɠai ʋɛɛ gala zalaɠa zuaiti ba, toɠa ɠɛ ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi: kilo taaʋuugɔ nikɛ zinɛi ʋɛ, ta kilo lɔzita baala sinɛi ʋɛ, <verse eid="NUM 29:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 29:10"/>ta kilo saʋagɔ baala ziʋoi ɠilagilagi ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 29:11"/>Wa boli zinɛi ɠula ɓalaa ga koto gba zalaɠai. Naa kpein ge ɓɔ koto gba zalaɠai ʋa, nii é ɠulazu koto gba voloi, ta gala zalaɠai, nii é ɠulazu folo-o-folo, ta ná-vebɛ zalaɠai, ta ta-ʋuya zalaɠaiti.<verse eid="NUM 29:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kota vɛtii ma zalaɠaiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:33-44">Levi Nuiti 23:33-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 29:12"/>«Alugi lɔfelasiɛi ma volo puugɔ maazu lɔɔlusiɛi (15) ma, wa gaalɛba ɲadegai wo, wo la boti nɔpɛ kɛa, eɠɛʋelei wa ɗa kɛ la. Wa fɛtii ɠula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɛbi vai ma, wa naa ɠɛ folo lɔfela laawu. <verse eid="NUM 29:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 29:13"/>Wa nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpa puugɔ maazu saʋagɔ (13) ɠula ga gala zalaɠai, ta boli zinɛ felegɔ, ta kona gila baala sinɛ puugɔ maazu naanigɔ (14), nɛɛʋuzu mina ɠɛ ti ʋa, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 29:14"/>Wa vebɛ zalaɠai ʋɛɛ gala zalaɠa zuaiti ba, toɠa ɠɛ ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi: kilo taaʋuugɔ nikɛ zinɛi ɠilagilagi ʋɛ, ta kilo lɔzita baala sinɛi ɠilagilagi ʋɛ, <verse eid="NUM 29:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 29:15"/>ta kilo saʋagɔ baala ziʋoi ɠilagilagi ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 29:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 29:16"/>Wa boli zinɛi ɠula ɓalaa ga koto gba zalaɠai. Naa kpein ge ɓɔ gala zalaɠai ʋa, é ɠulazu folo-o-folo, ta ná-vebɛ zalaɠai, ta ná-puya zalaɠai.<verse eid="NUM 29:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 29:17"/>«Foloi velesiɛi ma, wa nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpa puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12) ɠula ga zalaɠai, ta baala sinɛ felegɔ, ta kona gila baala sinɛ puugɔ maazu naanigɔ (14), nɛɛʋuzu mina ɠɛ ti ʋa. <verse eid="NUM 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 29:18"/>Wa vebɛ zalaɠaiti ta puya zalaɠaiti pɛɛ zalaɠa zuaiti ba, kɔɠɔgi liegɔi zoloo ti-liegɔi ma, eɠɛʋelei deveai la tɔgi zu. <verse eid="NUM 29:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 29:19"/>Wa boli zinɛi ɠula ɓalaa ga koto gba zalaɠai. Naa kpein ge ɓɔ gala zalaɠai ʋa, é ɠulazu folo-o-folo, ta ná-vebɛ zalaɠai, ta ná-puya zalaɠai.<verse eid="NUM 29:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 29:20"/>«Foloi zaʋasiɛi ma, wa nikɛ zinɛ puugɔ maazu ɠila (11) kula ga zalaɠai, ta baala sinɛ felegɔ, ta kona gila baala sinɛ puugɔ maazu naanigɔ (14), nɛɛʋuzu mina ɠɛ ti ʋa. <verse eid="NUM 29:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 29:21"/>Wa vebɛ zalaɠaiti ta puya zalaɠaiti pɛɛ zalaɠa zuaiti ba, kɔɠɔgi liegɔi zoloo ti-liegɔi ma, eɠɛʋelei deveai la tɔgi zu. <verse eid="NUM 29:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 29:22"/>Wa boli zinɛi ɠula ɓalaa ga koto gba zalaɠai. Naa kpein ge ɓɔ gala zalaɠai ʋa, é ɠulazu folo-o-folo, ta ná-vebɛ zalaɠai, ta ná-puya zalaɠai.<verse eid="NUM 29:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 29:23"/>«Foloi naanisiɛi ma, wa nikɛ zinɛ puugɔ ɠula ga zalaɠai, ta baala sinɛ felegɔ, ta kona gila baala sinɛ puugɔ maazu naanigɔ (14), nɛɛʋuzu mina ɠɛ ti ʋa. <verse eid="NUM 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 29:24"/>Wa vebɛ zalaɠaiti ta puya zalaɠaiti pɛɛ zalaɠa zuaiti ba, kɔɠɔgi liegɔi zoloo ti-liegɔi ma, eɠɛʋelei deveai la tɔgi zu. <verse eid="NUM 29:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 29:25"/>Wa boli zinɛi ɠula ɓalaa ga koto gba zalaɠai. Naa kpein ge ɓɔ gala zalaɠai ʋa, é ɠulazu folo-o-folo, ta ná-vebɛ zalaɠai, ta ná-puya zalaɠai.<verse eid="NUM 29:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 29:26"/>«Foloi lɔɔlusiɛi ma, wa nikɛ zinɛ taaʋuugɔ ɠula ga zalaɠai, ta baala sinɛ felegɔ, ta kona gila baala sinɛ puugɔ maazu naanigɔ (14), nɛɛʋuzu mina ɠɛ ti ʋa. <verse eid="NUM 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 29:27"/>Wa vebɛ zalaɠaiti ta puya zalaɠaiti pɛɛ zalaɠa zuaiti ba, kɔɠɔgi liegɔi zoloo ti-liegɔi ma, eɠɛʋelei deveai la tɔgi zu. <verse eid="NUM 29:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 29:28"/>Wa boli zinɛi ɠula ɓalaa ga koto gba zalaɠai. Naa kpein ge ɓɔ gala zalaɠai ʋa, é ɠulazu folo-o-folo, ta ná-vebɛ zalaɠai, ta ná-puya zalaɠai.<verse eid="NUM 29:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 29:29"/>«Foloi lɔzitasiɛi ma, wa nikɛ zinɛ lɔsaʋa ɠula ga zalaɠai, ta baala sinɛ felegɔ, ta kona gila baala sinɛ puugɔ maazu naanigɔ (14), nɛɛʋuzu mina ɠɛ ti ʋa. <verse eid="NUM 29:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 29:30"/>Wa vebɛ zalaɠaiti ta puya zalaɠaiti pɛɛ zalaɠa zuaiti ba, kɔɠɔgi liegɔi zoloo ti-liegɔi ma, eɠɛʋelei deveai la tɔgi zu. <verse eid="NUM 29:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 29:31"/>Wa boli zinɛi ɠula ɓalaa ga koto gba zalaɠai. Naa kpein ge ɓɔ gala zalaɠai ʋa, é ɠulazu folo-o-folo, ta ná-vebɛ zalaɠai, ta ná-puya zalaɠai.<verse eid="NUM 29:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 29:32"/>«Foloi lɔfelasiɛi ma, wa nikɛ zinɛ lɔfela ɠula ga zalaɠai, ta baala sinɛ felegɔ, ta kona gila baala sinɛ puugɔ maazu naanigɔ (14), nɛɛʋuzu mina ɠɛ ti ʋa. <verse eid="NUM 29:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 29:33"/>Wa vebɛ zalaɠaiti ta puya zalaɠaiti pɛɛ zalaɠa zuaiti ba, kɔɠɔgi liegɔi zoloo ti-liegɔi ma, eɠɛʋelei deveai la tɔgi zu. <verse eid="NUM 29:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 29:34"/>Wa boli zinɛi ɠula ɓalaa ga koto gba zalaɠai. Naa kpein ge ɓɔ gala zalaɠai ʋa, é ɠulazu folo-o-folo, ta ná-vebɛ zalaɠai, ta ná-puya zalaɠai.<verse eid="NUM 29:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 29:35"/>«Foloi lɔsaʋasiɛi ma, wa GALA dɛbi ɠaalɛbai wo. Naama voloi, wo la boti nɔpɛ kɛa, eɠɛʋelei wa ɗa kɛ la. <verse eid="NUM 29:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 29:36"/>Wa nikɛ zinɛ ɠila kula ga gala zalaɠai, baala sinɛ ɠila, ta kona gila baala sinɛ lɔfela, nɛɛʋuzu mina ɠɛ ti ʋa, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 29:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 29:37"/>Wa vebɛ zalaɠaiti ta puya zalaɠaiti pɛɛ zalaɠa zuaiti ba, kɔɠɔgi liegɔi zoloo ti-liegɔi ma, eɠɛʋelei deveai la tɔgi zu. <verse eid="NUM 29:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 29:38"/>Wa boli zinɛi ɠula ɓalaa ga koto gba zalaɠai. Naa kpein ge ɓɔ gala zalaɠai ʋa, é ɠulazu folo-o-folo, ta ná-vebɛ zalaɠai, ta ná-puya zalaɠai.<verse eid="NUM 29:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 29:39"/>«Naa ɠa wa kɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, wa-vɛti voloiti su, é ɠula wa-vebɛaniiti polu, wo ti laai ɠisu, ta wa-minazeɠe daazeeli zalaɠaiti, ti ga wa-ɠala zalaɠaiti, ta wa-vebɛ zalaɠaiti, ta wa-ʋuya zalaɠaiti, ta wa-yiilɛi zalaɠaiti.»<verse eid="NUM 29:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="NUM 30"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 30:1"/>Moize devei naati kpein boni Izilayɛle nuiti ma, niiti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ti veeni zea.<verse eid="NUM 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tɔgi é lo minazeɠegiti ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 30:2"/>Moize ɓɔɛni Izilayɛle nuiti ma wolodama ɠundiɠiiti pɔ, é ɠɛni ti ma: «Devei ʋɛtɛ, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI feai: <verse eid="NUM 30:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 30:3"/>Siɛgi zu zunui ta minazeɠezu la Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ɓaa é konai wo, é ʋilɛ fai ta ʋa, nii é pɔ ga é kɛ, é la mɔ daawooi zeɠea ma. Toɠa naa kpein kɛ, niiti ti ɠulaai da, é bo.<verse eid="NUM 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 30:4"/>«Ni anzalopoi ta, nii é kɛɛɠɛ ná-pɛlɛi wu dɛ, a minazeɠe kɛɛna Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, é ɓɔɠɔ ɠili ga naa, <verse eid="NUM 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 30:5"/>ni kɛɛɠɛ a ná-minazeɠe fai ta ná-kona vai zuɠwɛɛna, é ɓɔɠɔ ɠiliai la, ni kɛɛɠɛ a maaɠɛna kpɔ, é la faa woni tɔun tetegi, ná-minazeɠegiti ta ná-konaiti kpein ta yɛ ma, niiti é ɓɔɠɔ ɠiliai ga tiye. <verse eid="NUM 30:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 30:6"/>Kɛlɛ ni kɛɛɠɛ la yeezeini bu, yeei nɔ é faa ɠwɛɛgai la su, minazeɠegiti ta konai kpein é ɓɔɠɔ ɠiliai la, naati ti la mɔ yɛga ma. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa suvaayɛ, mazɔlɔɔ kɛɛɠɛ la yeezeini ti wu.<verse eid="NUM 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 30:7"/>«Ni toɠa zini bɛ, é minazeɠegaa ɠɛai na, ɓaa é ɓɔɠɔ ɠiliai na, ga kpɔɛi ta nii kulaai na da, é bo, <verse eid="NUM 30:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 30:8"/>ta sinigi a faa ɠwɛɛna su, é maaɠɛ kpɔ tɔun tetegi voloi nɔ é faa ɠwɛɛgai la su, ná-minazeɠegiti ta yɛ ma, ta konaiti é ɓɔɠɔ ɠiliai ga tiye, ta yɛ ma. <verse eid="NUM 30:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 30:9"/>Kɛlɛ ni sinigi la yeezeini bu, voloi nɔ é suɠwɛɛsu da, é minazeɠegi ɠaaʋa, nii é kɛai, ta kpɔɛi kulaai daaʋɛ, niiti é ɓɔɠɔ ɠiliai ga tiye, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa suvaayɛ.<verse eid="NUM 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 30:10"/>«Poanzai, ɓaa anzanui ti ɠɛlɛai ba, minazeɠegi naa a bo, ɓaa konai nɔpɛ kulaai daaʋɛ, nii é ɓɔɠɔ ɠilizu la, giliai ɠa yɛ de.<verse eid="NUM 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 30:11"/>«Anzanui nii é zini bɛ, naa a minazeɠegaa ɠɛɛna, ɓaa é ɓɔɠɔ ɠili ga konai ta, <verse eid="NUM 30:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 30:12"/>sinigi a faa ɠwɛɛna su, é maaɠɛ kpɔ, é la yeeɠulani bu, é ʋa ɠɛlɛ, ná-minazeɠegiti kpein ta yɛ ma, ta kona wooi nɔpɛ é ɓɔɠɔ ɠiliai la. <verse eid="NUM 30:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 30:13"/>Kɛlɛ ni sinigi a ɠɛlɛna, voloi nɔ é suɠwɛɛsu da, ná-minazeɠegi kpein ta kona wooi kpein é lo tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ʋa, ɓaa daawooi ʋa, naati ti la yɛga ma. Sinigi ti ɠaaʋaa, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa suvaayɛ. <verse eid="NUM 30:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 30:14"/>Sinigi ɠa zoo é ti yɛ ma, ɓaa é minazeɠegi kpein koloɠolo, ɓaa konai kpein nii a zoo ɠɛlɛzu la anii ta ʋa. <verse eid="NUM 30:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 30:15"/>Ni sinigi la ɠɛlɛni, a maaɠɛna kpɔ eyɛsu poluma zobui zeeli, anzai ɠa ɠili minazeɠegi kpein su, ta kona wooiti kpein su, é ti woga. É vaa bu ga é ti makɛ, tɔɔzei é maaɠɛga kpɔ, é la faa woni, foloi é mɛniga da. <verse eid="NUM 30:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 30:16"/>Kɛlɛ ni toɠa ti zeɠe ma, foloi tanigaani teʋega ʋoluma, kpega ʋoluma ga suɠwɛɛ, toɠa anzai ná-faaɠaaza golai ma ɠasɔi zeɠe.»<verse eid="NUM 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 30:17"/>Tɔgiti kana, niiti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ti veeni Moize ya, é ʋilɛ zunui ta anzai ti yɔɠɔzuʋɛ ʋa, doun kɛɛɠɛi ta ná-doun anzanui ti yɔɠɔzuʋɛ ʋa, siɛgi zu é ga nu niinɛi, é kɛɛɠɛ ná-pɛlɛi wu dɛ.<verse eid="NUM 30:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="NUM 31"/>
  <para style="s">Pilɛ sɔlɔɔ fai Madiyan nuiti ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 31:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 31:2"/>«Izilayɛle nuiti tɔnɔi ʋotokula Madiyan nuiti ma, naa ʋolu, ɗa li niina è-mɛmɛwolani pɔ, ti zaai.»<verse eid="NUM 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 31:3"/>Moize ɓɔɛni nuɓusɛiti pɔ, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À zunui tanigaani maaɠili ga kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti wo zaama, ti li Madiyan nuiti daalɔɠɔma, naa ɠa a kɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-potokulai laazeeli Madiyan nuiti ma. <verse eid="NUM 31:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 31:4"/>Bolodai ɠilagilagi zu, wa zunu waagila (1.000) kula ti zaama, wo ti leʋe kɔɔmaʋɛ.»<verse eid="NUM 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 31:5"/>Ti ziimazeɠegi woni Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti saama, bolodai ɠilagilagi zu, zunu waagilagila (1.000), ti-liegɔi ɠɛni ga zunu waapuugɔ maazu felegɔ (12.000) ti maaɠiliai kɔɔɠɔ vai ma. <verse eid="NUM 31:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 31:6"/>Moize ti leʋeni kɔɔmaʋɛ, é Fineyase ʋɛɛ ti ʋa, zalaɠa ɠula nui Eleazaal ná-doun zunui, naa ɠa é ɠɛni seizu ɲadegai ma zɔɔlaiti seɠezu, ta puʋugiti é ʋa ɗa poogiti dɛɛ la.<verse eid="NUM 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 31:7"/>Ti kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti seɠeni, ti li Madiyan nuiti daalɔɠɔma, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI devei veeni la Moize ya. Ti zunuiti kpein paani, <verse eid="NUM 31:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 31:8"/>é ɓɔ Madiyan nuiti ta-masa dɔɔlugɔ ʋa, ti ga: Evi, Lekɛme, Suul, Ɠuul, ta Leɓa. Ti Ɓeyɔɔl ná-doun zunui Ɓalaame ɓalaagi ʋaani ga boɠa zɔkpɔi. <verse eid="NUM 31:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 31:9"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti Madiyan anzanuiti ta ti-lointi soni ga duɔiti, ti li ga tiye. Ti ta-zuaiti soni, ta ta-logani ɓulugiti kpein, é ʋɛɛ ti-yeaɠɔligi kpein ba. <verse eid="NUM 31:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 31:10"/>Ti abui loni ta-laaiti kpein ba, ʋɛti ti ɠɛni zeini ná, ta ti-ʋuuzuʋɛti kpein. <verse eid="NUM 31:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 31:11"/>Ti liini ga aniiti kpein ti ti zoni kɔɔmaʋɛ, nuiti ti ʋɛɛ toganiiti ba. <verse eid="NUM 31:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 31:12"/>Ti liini ga duɔiti, ta kɔɔzoganiiti, ta kɔɔi zu aniiti Moize ʋɔ, ta zalaɠa ɠula nui Eleazaal, ta Izilayɛle ʋɛbɛi, naati ti ɠɛni ʋuuni Moaɓe nɛmɛi zu, Zuludɛn ɠobaʋɛ, Zeliko letemaʋɛ.<verse eid="NUM 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kɔɔɠɔ nuiti ɲade fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 31:13"/>Moize ta zalaɠa ɠula nui Eleazaal ta bɛbɛi ná-kundiɠiiti kpein ti wuzeɠeni, ti li, ti laaɠomisuʋɛ, ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋoluʋelei. <verse eid="NUM 31:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 31:14"/>Moize yiiɠaawanani kɔɔɠuluɓaiti ma, nu waagilagila kundiɠiiti, ta nu ungilagila kundiɠiiti, niiti ti ʋaani, ti zeɠe kɔɔmaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 31:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 31:15"/>Moize ti ɠaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Lee vaa zu wo niima anzanuiti kpein zɛgai vulua? <verse eid="NUM 31:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 31:16"/>À ɠizɛ su ga, tiya ɠa ti Ɓalaame ná-tɛnɛ gooi zoni, ti Izilayɛle nuiti dɔ wooʋaladai zu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laalɔɠɔma, Peyɔɔl ná-fai zu, naa ɠa é ʋaani ga maanɔɠɔi Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-nuɓusɛiti saama. <verse eid="NUM 31:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 31:17"/>Niizu niina, à zunu loungoiti kpein paa, wo anzanui kpein paa, niiti ti zunu vaa ɠwɛɛgai na. <verse eid="NUM 31:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 31:18"/>Anzanu loungoiti, niiti ti la dɛ zunu lakoba vaa ɠwɛɛ, naati nɔ ɠa wa ti yɛ ná, wo ti makɛ ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ.<verse eid="NUM 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 31:19"/>«Wɔun wa, à li, wo ʋu ada ɠila ade-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋoluʋɛ, wo yɛ ná folo lɔfela laawu, wɔiti wo nu ʋaai, ɓaa wo vɔɔɠu pooma ʋa, wa ɓɔɠɔ ɲade foloi zaʋasiɛi, ta foloi lɔfelasiɛi, wa-o, wa-luɔiti-yo. <verse eid="NUM 31:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 31:20"/>Wa seɠeiti kpein ɲade ɓalaagi, sɔɔla kpein kpɛtɛai ga kɔlɔi, ɓaa boli leɠa zeɠei kpein, ta aniɲaka kpein é ga gului.»<verse eid="NUM 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 31:21"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui Eleazaal ɓɔɛni kɔɔɠɔ nuiti pɔ, ti zeɠeni kɔɔmaʋɛ, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À wɛlɛ faazeikpasui ʋa, é tɔgi zu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veai Moize ya: <verse eid="NUM 31:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 31:22"/>zanugi, walii, kɔlu ɓɔigi, kɔlui, foɠagi, ta bɔbɔgi, <verse eid="NUM 31:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 31:23"/>anii kpein nii a zoo lɔɔzu abui ɠa, é la ɠala, wa naa lɔ abui ɠa, é ɲade. Naa ʋolu, wa ti lɔ ɓalaa ziɛ ɲadegai wu. Kɛlɛ, sɔɔla kpein é la zooga lɔɔzu abui ɠa, wa naati dɔ nɔ ziɛ ɲadegai wu. <verse eid="NUM 31:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 31:24"/>Wa wa-zeɠeiti gba, foloi lɔfelasiɛi, wa ɲade niina, naa ʋoluma, wa zoo lɔɔzu ade-ʋuuzuʋɛ.»<verse eid="NUM 31:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kɔɔzoganiiti gaaɠwɛɛ vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 31:25"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Moize ma: <verse eid="NUM 31:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 31:26"/>«Zalaɠa ɠula nui Eleazaal zeɠe, é ʋɛɛ è ʋa, ta nuɓusɛiti ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti ma ɠundiɠiiti, wo kɔɔzoganiiti gaalu, duɔiti ta toganiiti. <verse eid="NUM 31:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 31:27"/>Ɗa kɔɔzoganii naati gaaɠwɛ su fele, ma ʋalisaamai ve kɔɔɠɔ nuiti zea, ma ʋalisaamai ve nuɓusɛi zɔiti kpein zea. <verse eid="NUM 31:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 31:28"/>Nii é ɠɛɛzu ga kɔɔɠɔ nuiti tɔnɔi, vebɛanii ɠa zeɠe ba, é ɠɛ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɔnɔi, nu ɠila ka zeɠe nu undɔɔlugɔi (500) zaama, togani ɠila ka zeɠe togani undɔɔlugɔi (500) zaama, ma wolaiti ta ma goiti ta soovalegiti saama. <verse eid="NUM 31:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 31:29"/>Ma ʋalisaamai nii feai ti ya, ɗa seɠe naa ʋa, è fe zalaɠa ɠula nui Eleazaal ya, é ɠɛ ga vebɛanii seɠeai ba Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 31:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 31:30"/>Ma ʋalisaamai nii é ɠɛɛzu ga Izilayɛle nuiti tɔnɔi, ɗa nu ɠila seɠe nu ʋuulɔɔlugɔi (50) zaama, è togani ɠila seɠe togani ʋuulɔɔlugɔi (50) zaama, ma wolaiti ta ma goiti ta soovalegiti saama, è ti ve Levi nuiti zea, niiti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai makɛ vai ɠalivaai ti ma.»<verse eid="NUM 31:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 31:31"/>Moize ta zalaɠa ɠula nui Eleazaal ti kɛɛni, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni la Moize ya.<verse eid="NUM 31:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 31:32"/>Kɔɔzoganiiti niiti kɔɔɠɔ nuiti ti ʋaani la, naa ɠɛni ga: baalagi ta bolii waaundɔzita waaʋuulɔfela maazu lɔɔlu (675.000), <verse eid="NUM 31:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 31:33"/>nikɛ waaʋuulɔfela maazu felegɔ (72.000), <verse eid="NUM 31:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 31:34"/>soovale waaʋuulɔzita maazu ɠila (61.000), <verse eid="NUM 31:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 31:35"/>anzanu loungoi niiti ti la ɠɛni dɛ zunu lakoba vaa ɠwɛɛ, naati ti ɠɛni ga nu waaʋuusaʋagɔ maazu felegɔ (32.000).<verse eid="NUM 31:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 31:36"/>Ma ʋalisaamai nii é ɠɛni ga kɔɔɠɔ nuiti tɔnɔi, tiegɔi ɠɛni ga: baalagi ta bolii waaunsaʋagɔ waaʋuusaʋagɔ maazu lɔfela undɔɔlu (337.500), <verse eid="NUM 31:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 31:37"/>naa ɠa undɔzita puulɔfela maazu lɔɔlugɔi (675) zeɠeni ba, é ɠɛ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɔnɔi, <verse eid="NUM 31:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 31:38"/>nikɛ waaʋuusaʋagɔ maazu lɔzitai (36.000), naa ɠa puulɔfela maazu felegɔi (72) zeɠeni ba, é ɠɛ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɔnɔi, <verse eid="NUM 31:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 31:39"/>soovale waaʋuusaʋagɔ undɔɔlugɔi (30.500), naa ɠa puulɔzita maazu ɠilagi (61) zeɠeni ba, é ɠɛ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɔnɔi, <verse eid="NUM 31:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 31:40"/>nuɓusɛ waapuugɔ maazu lɔzitai (16.000), naa ɠa nu ʋuusaʋagɔ maazu felegɔi (32) zeɠeni ba, é ɠɛ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɔnɔi. <verse eid="NUM 31:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 31:41"/>Vebɛanii kpein é ɠɛni ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɔnɔi, Moize naa zeɠeni, é pu zalaɠa ɠula nui Eleazaal yeezu, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni la zea.<verse eid="NUM 31:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 31:42"/>Ma ʋalisaamai é ɠɛni ga Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti tɔnɔi, nii Moize puuni yɛ, kɔɔɠɔ nuiti tɔnɔi ʋoluma, <verse eid="NUM 31:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 31:43"/>naa ɠɛni ga: baalagi ta bolii waaunsaʋagɔ waaʋuusaʋagɔ maazu lɔfela undɔɔlu (337.500), <verse eid="NUM 31:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 31:44"/>nikɛ waaʋuusaʋagɔ maazu lɔzita (36.000), <verse eid="NUM 31:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 31:45"/>soovale waaʋuusaʋagɔ undɔɔlu (30.500), <verse eid="NUM 31:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 31:46"/>nuɓusɛ waapuugɔ maazu lɔzita (16.000).<verse eid="NUM 31:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 31:47"/>Ma ʋalisaamai é ɠɛni ga Izilayɛle nuiti tɔnɔi, Moize nu ɠilagilagi zeɠeni nu ʋuulɔɔludɔɔlugi (50) kpein ba, é togani ɠilagilagi ɠula togani ʋuulɔɔludɔɔlugi (50) kpein saama, é ti ve Levi nuiti zea, niiti ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai makɛsu, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni la zea.<verse eid="NUM 31:47"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faanɛɛ wuuɠwɛɛ fai <optbreak/> ma vebɛaniiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 31:48"/>Kɔɔɓɔgiti deve ɠundiɠiiti, waagilagila kundiɠiiti, ta nu ungilagila kundiɠiiti, naati ti ʋaani naazu, <verse eid="NUM 31:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 31:49"/>ti ɠɛ Moize ma: «Gɛi gi ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti, gi kɔɔɠɔ nuiti gaaluga, niiti ti ɠɛa gá-leveiti bu, ti ɠaavɔnigɛ, zunu ɠila kpalaa ge la yɛni ná ʋolu gi zaama. <verse eid="NUM 31:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 31:50"/>Gi ɠilagilagi gá ʋaazu ga zanu sɔɔlaiti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɔ, ti ɠɛ ga vebɛaniiti, nii gi ka, zanu balaiti, yɔlɔɠɔiti, balaɠaegiti, goizu anigiti, ta kɔbu ansaiti, é ɠɛ ga koto gba anii tɔgi letemazu, gi-ɓusɛiti faa zu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu.»<verse eid="NUM 31:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 31:51"/>Moize ta zalaɠa ɠula nui Eleazaal ti yeezeini naama zɔɔlaiti bu, ti ti veeni ti ya, ti ɓɛtɛai ga zanugi. <verse eid="NUM 31:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 31:52"/>Zanugi kpein nu waagilagila kundiɠiiti ta nu ungilagila kundiɠiiti ti gaaluni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, buɲɛgi ɠɛni ga kilo ungila puulɔsaʋa maazu naanigɔ (184). <verse eid="NUM 31:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 31:53"/>Kɔɔɠɔ nuiti ɛsɛ ge ná-kɔɔzoganii zeɠeni ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 31:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 31:54"/>Moize ta zalaɠa ɠula nui Eleazaal ti zanugi zeɠeni, nu waagilagila (1.000) kundiɠiiti ta nu ungilagila (100) kundiɠiiti zea, ti lii la GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu, é ɠɛ ga ɠizɛsui Izilayɛle nuiti bɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu.<verse eid="NUM 31:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="NUM 32"/>
  <para style="s">Galaade yooi vee vai <optbreak/> Gade ta Luɓɛn mavofodaiti zea</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 3:12-22">Tɔ Sɛʋɛi Velesiɛi 3:12-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 32:1"/>Togani ɓulu golai ɠɛni Luɓɛn mavofodaiti ta Gade mavofodaiti zea. Ti kaani ga Yazɛɛl yooi ta Galaade yooi ta ga ada ʋagɔ toganiiti to fai zu. <verse eid="NUM 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 32:2"/>Ti ʋaani, ti zeeli Moize ma, ta zalaɠa ɠula nui Eleazaal, ta nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠundiɠiiti, ti ɠɛ ti ma: <verse eid="NUM 32:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 32:3"/>«Taaiti ti ga, Atalɔte, Diɓon, Yazɛɛl, Nimila, Ɠɛsɛɓon, Eleyalé, Seɓame, Neɓo ta Ɓeyon, <verse eid="NUM 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 32:4"/>zooi nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI feai Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti bɛ, toɠa ga zooi pagai togani lo fai ma. Tama, toganii wola mɔinʋɛ gi ya gɛi gi ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti.» <verse eid="NUM 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 32:5"/>Ti ɠɛni ma: «Ni gi zaalai zɔlɔɔgɛ è ɠaazu, yeezei bu, è zooi nii ve gi ya, gɛi gi ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti. Mina gi ɓudɛ ga Zuludɛn ʋoluʋelei.»<verse eid="NUM 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 32:6"/>Moize bolodama felegɔi niiti gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Wa pɔ wo yɛ ʋɛ, wo-ɠɛɛlointi ta ɠɛɛna lia kɔɔmaʋɛ, naa ɠa ɠɛ ɠale? <verse eid="NUM 32:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 32:7"/>Lee vaa zu wo pɔ Izilayɛle nuiti iɲɔteʋe ti lɛɛ vai zu zooi zu, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI feezu ti ya? <verse eid="NUM 32:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 32:8"/>Zekana kpein nɔ wo-ɠɛɛni ti kɛɛni la, siɛgi zu gè ti leʋeni la, ti zeɠe Kadɛse-Ɓaaleneya, ti li, ti zooi ʋɛtɛ. <verse eid="NUM 32:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 32:9"/>Ti lɛɛni, ti zeeli Esekɔle nɛmɛi zu, ti ɓegai ma ga zooi ʋɛtɛ, ti Izilayɛle nuiti iɲɔteʋeni ga ti mina li zooi zu, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI feezu ti ya. <verse eid="NUM 32:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 32:10"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiiɠaawanani naama voloi, é ɠona, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 32:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 32:11"/>‹Zunui niiti ti ɠulaai Ezipete yooi ʋa, é zo kona ʋuufelegɔ (20) ma, é lɛ zeemaazu, naati ti la ɠaazulaa zooi ma, nii gè ma ɠona woga ga nà feezu Abalaame ya, ta Izaake, ta Zakɔɓe, mazɔlɔɔ ti la ʋilɛni gòoi ʋolu, ti ʋa ɠolo bɛ̀, <verse eid="NUM 32:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 32:12"/>é ɠula Kalɛɓe ʋolu, Yefuné ná-doun zunui, nii é ga Kenize nui, ta Nun ná-doun zunui Zozuwe, niiti ti ʋilɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawooi ʋolu, ti ɠolo bɛ.›<verse eid="NUM 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 32:13"/>«Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiiɠaawanani Izilayɛle nuiti ma, é ti leʋeteʋe teʋebai zu kona ʋuunaanigɔ (40) laawu, eyɛsu naama yamanii kpein ge zeɠe ná, niiti ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wanama vai ɠɛɛni. <verse eid="NUM 32:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 32:14"/>Wɛlɛ, wa ɠa wo wo-ɠɛɛni tosuʋɛ zeɠea, eɠɛʋelei wo la ga kotoba nuiti ti zɔlɔɔgai, wo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-ziiɠaawanai ɠaalɛɛzu ba Izilayɛle laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="NUM 32:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 32:15"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ni wo la ɠɛ kɛɛni, wo ʋa ɠolo tɔun bɛ, toɠa Izilayɛle yɛ nɔ teʋebai zu, wa ɠɛ ga zaɓui wo niima nuɓusɛi kpein undaaʋili.»<verse eid="NUM 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 32:16"/>Ti Moize wooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ɓa-o, gá sasaiti nɔ losu ʋɛ, gá-logani ɓulugiti faa zu, gi taaiti to gá-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti bɛ. <verse eid="NUM 32:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 32:17"/>Gɔun gi letegi, gá ɓɔɠɔ maaɠili ga kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti gaazuvilɛi zu, gi lo Izilayɛle nuiti untuɠɔ, eyɛsu gi lɔ ga tiye naama adaʋɛ, ʋɛ ná veai ti ya. Gá-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti gila nɔ ɠa ta ɠɛ yɛsu taaiti su, siɠigiti ti ti ma, nii a kɛ ti maalɔɔɠu zooi zu nuɓusɛiti ba. <verse eid="NUM 32:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 32:18"/>Gi la ɠalega ma gá-ʋɛlɛiti bu, eyɛsu Izilayɛle nuiti gilagilagiti ti tɔnɔ ma yooiti sɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="NUM 32:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 32:19"/>Kɛlɛ gi la mɔ zou zɔlɔɔga Zuludɛn ʋoluʋelei, anɛɛ ná maaɠooza ʋa, tɔɔzei gi gɔnɔ ma yooi zɔlɔɔga Zuludɛn ɠakamaʋɛ folo ɠulazu ʋelei.»<verse eid="NUM 32:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 32:20"/>Moize ɠɛni ti ma: «Ni wa minazeɠe gooi naa laazeelina, ni wa ɓɔɠɔ maaɠilina ga wo kɔɔi ɠɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, <verse eid="NUM 32:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 32:21"/>ni wa-ɠɔɔɠɔ nuiti kpein ta ɓɔɠɔ maaɠili, ti Zuludɛn ɓudɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, eyɛsu é sili nuiti kpein kpɛ ɠaazu, <verse eid="NUM 32:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 32:22"/>ni wa ɠale ma, siɛgi zu nɔ zooi maaɠolozu la Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, faa la mɔ ɠɛa wo ʋa, wa vie naazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, ta Izilayɛle letegi. Naazu, niima ada yɔɠɔzuʋɛ ɠa ɠɛ ga wɔnɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. <verse eid="NUM 32:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 32:23"/>Kɛlɛ ni wo la ɠɛ kɛɛni ɠana, wo koto ɠɛa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laalɔɠɔma. À suɠwɛɛ ga wa-ɠotoi ɠa wo ɠɔɠɔzumɛɛn! <verse eid="NUM 32:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 32:24"/>À taaiti to wa-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti bɛ, wo sasaiti to wa-logani ɓulugiti bɛ. Nii é ɠulaa wo-la, wo bo, à ziɛ ga naa.»<verse eid="NUM 32:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 32:25"/>Gade mavofodaiti ta Luɓɛn mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni Moize ma: «Ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti gá kɛ, eɠɛʋelei màliɠii devei wogai la. <verse eid="NUM 32:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 32:26"/>Gi-lointi, gi-anzaiti, gá-loganiiti, ta gá-logani ɓulugiti ta yɛ Galaade taaiti su. <verse eid="NUM 32:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 32:27"/>Gɛi gi ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ zunuiti, gi pɛ gi maaɠiliai ga kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti, gá Zuludɛn ɓudɛ, gi kɔɔi ɠɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, eɠɛʋelei màliɠii bosu da.»<verse eid="NUM 32:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 32:28"/>Moize devei veeni ta-vaa zu zalaɠa ɠula nui Eleazaal ya, ta Nun ná-doun zunui Zozuwe ya, é ʋɛɛ Izilayɛle wolodama ʋɛlɛyeɠe ɠundiɠiiti ba. <verse eid="NUM 32:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 32:29"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Ni wa Gade mavofodaiti ta Luɓɛn mavofodaiti, wa Zuludɛn maazuɓudɛna ʋɔɔma, ti maaɠiliai ga kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti, ti kɔɔi ɠɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, eyɛsu zooi maaɠolo wo ʋɛ, wa Galaade yooi ve ti ya ga tɔnɔ. <verse eid="NUM 32:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 32:30"/>Kɛlɛ ni ti la Zuludɛn ɓudɛni, ti ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛai ʋa ɠɛ de, ga wo kɔɔi ɠɔ ʋɔɔma, ta zei wo zaama Kanaan yooi zu.»<verse eid="NUM 32:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 32:31"/>Gade mavofodaiti ta Luɓɛn mavofodaiti ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Gá naa ɠɛ, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI bogai gi ma, gɛi gi ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti. <verse eid="NUM 32:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 32:32"/>Gá ɓudɛ, gi maaɠiliai ga kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, Kanaan yooi zu, kɛlɛ gá gɔnɔi ma yooi zɔlɔɔ Zuludɛn ɠakala ʋelei.»<verse eid="NUM 32:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 32:33"/>Amool nuiti ta-masagi Siɠon, ta Ɓasan nuiti ta-masagi Wɔge, Moize naati ta-masadai ta ta-yooiti feeni Gade mavofodaiti zea, ta Luɓɛn mavofodaiti, é ʋɛɛ Manasé ná-bolodai ɠilazuʋɛ ʋa, nii é ga Zozɛfe ná-doun zunui, é ʋɛɛ ta-laaiti ba, ta ma yooiti ti ɠɛni ti ʋa.<verse eid="NUM 32:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 32:34"/>Taai niiti Gade mavofodaiti ti ti loni, ti ɠɛni ga: Diɓon, Atalɔte, Alowɛɛl, <verse eid="NUM 32:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 32:35"/>Atalɔte-Sofan, Yazɛɛl, Yogeɓeɠa, <verse eid="NUM 32:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 32:36"/>Ɓɛte-Nimala, ta Ɓɛte-Ɠalan, taaiti siɠigi ti ma. Ti sasaiti toni togani ɓulugiti faa zu.<verse eid="NUM 32:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 32:37"/>Taai niiti Luɓɛn mavofodaiti ti ti loni, ti ɠɛni ga: Ɠɛsɛɓon, Eleyalé, ta Kiliyatayime, <verse eid="NUM 32:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 32:38"/>Neɓo, ta Ɓaale-Meyon, naati ti-laaseigi valiboni, ta Siɓima. Ti daaseigiti pɛɛni taaiti ba, niiti ti ti loni.<verse eid="NUM 32:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 32:39"/>Makiil mavofodaiti, nii é ga Manasé ná-doun zunui, naati ti liini Galaade laalɔɠɔma, ti vɔni ma, ti zobo sɔlɔɔ Amool nuiti ma, ti ɠɛni zeini ná, ti ti zeɠe. <verse eid="NUM 32:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 32:40"/>Moize Galaade yooi veeni ti ya, ti zeini ná. <verse eid="NUM 32:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 32:41"/>Yayiil é ga Manasé ná-dounloin ta, naa wuzeɠeni, é li, é ɓalaɠaiti so, é ti-laasei pɛɛni ga Yayiil ná-taaiti. <verse eid="NUM 32:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 32:42"/>Nɔɓa laalɛɛni Kenate wu, é so, ta taaiti ti ɠilini ba, é tɔ ɓɔɠɔi daaseigi ʋɛɛ ti ʋa.<verse eid="NUM 32:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="NUM 33"/>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle nuiti teʋesuʋɛti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 33:1"/>Peleiti pɛtɛ Izilayɛle nuiti ti leʋeni da, ti ɠulaai ma Ezipete yooi ʋa, ti zeiɗai kpasu, Moize ta Aalɔn ti loni ti luɠɔ. <verse eid="NUM 33:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 33:2"/>Moize ti-ʋuuzuʋɛti ta ti-ziɛzuʋɛti sɛʋɛni, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-devei ɠɛni la.<verse eid="NUM 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 33:3"/>Alu mɔungi ma volo puugɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔi (15) ma, Pakegi ʋoluma zobui, ti liini, ti zeɠe Lamesɛse. Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɠulani ɓɔɠɔ yeema zooi ʋa, Ezipete nuiti kpein gaazu ɠɛni ti ʋa. <verse eid="NUM 33:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 33:4"/>Ezipete nuiti ti ɠɛni ti-loun zunu mɔungiti maaɠuluzu, niiti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ti ʋaani. Tukpɔi ɠana é daalɛɛni ta-ɠalagiti bu.<verse eid="NUM 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 33:5"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti zeɠeni Lamesɛse, ti li, ti ʋu Sukɔte. <verse eid="NUM 33:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 33:6"/>Ti zeɠeni Sukɔte, ti li, ti ʋu Etame, nii é teʋebai ɠaaɓelazuʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 33:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 33:7"/>Ti zeɠeni Etame, ti ɠaaɠale ma ga ʋogi Pi-Ɠaɠilɔte ʋele, Ɓaale-Sefon folo ɠulazu ʋelei, ti li, ti ʋu Migedɔle letemaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 33:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 33:8"/>Ti zeɠeni Pi-Ɠaɠilɔte, ti leʋe Seeli Kpoloɗɛi zaamaʋɛ, teʋebai ʋɔ pelei. Ti folo saʋagɔ ziɛ woni Etame teʋebai zu, ti li, ti ʋu Mala. <verse eid="NUM 33:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 33:9"/>Ti zeɠeni Mala, ti zeeli Elime, ʋɛ ziɛun puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12) ɠɛni ná, ta dɔɔ wulu ʋuulɔfela (70), miná ɠa ti ʋuuni ná. <verse eid="NUM 33:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 33:10"/>Ti zeɠeni Elime, ti li, ti ʋu Seeli Kpoloɗɛi ɠobaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 33:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 33:11"/>Ti zeɠeni Seeli Kpoloɗɛi ɠobaʋɛ, ti li, ti ʋu Sin teʋebai zu. <verse eid="NUM 33:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 33:12"/>Ti zeɠeni Sin teʋebai zu, ti li, ti ʋu Dofeka. <verse eid="NUM 33:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 33:13"/>Ti zeɠeni Dofeka, ti li, ti ʋu Aluse. <verse eid="NUM 33:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 33:14"/>Ti zeɠeni Aluse, ti li, ti ʋu Lefidime, ʋɛ nuɓusɛiti ti la ɠɛni ziɛ zɔlɔɔni ná ga ti ʋa ɓɔɔle.<verse eid="NUM 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 33:15"/>Ti zeɠeni Lefidime, ti li, ti ʋu Sinayi teʋebai zu. <verse eid="NUM 33:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 33:16"/>Ti zeɠeni Sinayi teʋebai zu, ti li, ti ʋu Kiɓelɔte-Ɠataava. <verse eid="NUM 33:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 33:17"/>Ti zeɠeni Kiɓelɔte-Ɠataava, ti li, ti ʋu Ɠaselɔte. <verse eid="NUM 33:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 33:18"/>Ti zeɠeni Ɠaselɔte, ti li, ti ʋu Litima. <verse eid="NUM 33:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 33:19"/>Ti zeɠeni Litima, ti li, ti ʋu Limon-Peelɛse. <verse eid="NUM 33:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 33:20"/>Ti zeɠeni Limon-Peelɛse, ti li, ti ʋu Liɓina. <verse eid="NUM 33:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 33:21"/>Ti zeɠeni Liɓina, ti li, ti ʋu Lisa. <verse eid="NUM 33:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 33:22"/>Ti zeɠeni Lisa, ti li, ti ʋu Keɠelata. <verse eid="NUM 33:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 33:23"/>Ti zeɠeni Keɠelata, ti li, ti ʋu Safɛɛl gizei ma. <verse eid="NUM 33:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 33:24"/>Ti zeɠeni Safɛɛl gizei ma, ti li, ti ʋu Ɠalada. <verse eid="NUM 33:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 33:25"/>Ti zeɠeni Ɠalada, ti li, ti ʋu Makelɔte. <verse eid="NUM 33:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 33:26"/>Ti zeɠeni Makelɔte, ti li, ti ʋu Taɠate. <verse eid="NUM 33:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 33:27"/>Ti zeɠeni Taɠate, ti li, ti ʋu Tala. <verse eid="NUM 33:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 33:28"/>Ti zeɠeni Tala, ti li, ti ʋu Mitaka. <verse eid="NUM 33:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 33:29"/>Ti zeɠeni Mitaka, ti li, ti ʋu Ɠasemona. <verse eid="NUM 33:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 33:30"/>Ti zeɠeni Ɠasemona, ti li, ti ʋu Moselɔte. <verse eid="NUM 33:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 33:31"/>Ti zeɠeni Moselɔte, ti li, ti ʋu Ɓené-Yaakan. <verse eid="NUM 33:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 33:32"/>Ti zeɠeni Ɓené-Yaakan, ti li, ti ʋu Ɠɔɔl-Gidegade. <verse eid="NUM 33:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 33:33"/>Ti zeɠeni Ɠɔɔl-Gidegade, ti li, ti ʋu Yoteɓata. <verse eid="NUM 33:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 33:34"/>Ti zeɠeni Yoteɓata, ti li, ti ʋu Aɓelɔna. <verse eid="NUM 33:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 33:35"/>Ti zeɠeni Aɓelɔna, ti li, ti ʋu Ɛsiyon-Geeɓɛɛl. <verse eid="NUM 33:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 33:36"/>Ti zeɠeni Ɛsiyon-Geeɓɛɛl, ti li, ti ʋu Sin teʋebai zu, tɔ ɠa é ga Kadɛse. <verse eid="NUM 33:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 33:37"/>Ti zeɠeni Kadɛse, ti li, ti ʋu Ɠɔɔl gizei ma, Edɔme yooi ɠwɛmaʋɛ.<verse eid="NUM 33:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 33:38"/>Eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-devei woni da, zalaɠa ɠula nui Aalɔn lɛɛni Ɠɔɔl gizei ma, é za, Izilayɛle nuiti kulaai ma Ezipete yooi ʋa ma ɠonagi ʋuunaanisiɛi (40) ma, alugi lɔɔlusiɛi ma volo mɔungi ma. <verse eid="NUM 33:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 33:39"/>Aalɔn ná-konagi ɠɛni ga kona ungila kona ʋuufele maazu saʋagɔ (123), siɛgi zu é zaani la Ɠɔɔl gizei ma.<verse eid="NUM 33:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 33:40"/>Názu ɠa Alade masagi, Kanaan yooi zu nui, nii é ɠɛni zeini zooi unda lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazuʋɛ, naa mɛnini da ga Izilayɛle nuiti ta ʋaazu.<verse eid="NUM 33:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 33:41"/>Ti zeɠeni Ɠɔɔl gizei ma, ti li, ti ʋu Salamona. <verse eid="NUM 33:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 33:42"/>Ti zeɠeni Salamona, ti li, ti ʋu Punon. <verse eid="NUM 33:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 33:43"/>Ti zeɠeni Punon, ti li, ti ʋu Wɔɓɔte. <verse eid="NUM 33:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 33:44"/>Ti zeɠeni Wɔɓɔte, ti li, ti ʋu Ye-Aɓalime, Moaɓe kwɛpelemaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 33:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 33:45"/>Ti zeɠeni Ye-Aɓalime, ti li, ti ʋu Diɓon-Gade. <verse eid="NUM 33:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 33:46"/>Ti zeɠeni Diɓon-Gade, ti li, ti ʋu Alamon-Diɓelatayime. <verse eid="NUM 33:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 33:47"/>Ti zeɠeni Alamon-Diɓelatayime, ti li, ti ʋu Aɓalime gizeiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛ, Neɓo gizei ɠakalaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 33:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 33:48"/>Ti zeɠeni Aɓalime gizeiti ma, ti li, ti ʋu Moaɓe nɛmɛi zu, Zuludɛn ɠobaʋɛ, Zeliko letemaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 33:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 33:49"/>Ti ʋuuni Zuludɛn ɠobaʋɛ, é zo Ɓɛte-Yesimɔte, é li Aɓɛle-Sitime, Moaɓe nɛmɛiti su.<verse eid="NUM 33:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kanaan yooi zo fai ma levei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 33:50"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, Moaɓe nɛmɛiti su Zuludɛn ɠobaʋɛ, Zeliko letemaʋɛ, <verse eid="NUM 33:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 33:51"/>é ɠɛ ma: «Ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ, è ɠɛ ti ma: Siɛgi zu wo Zuludɛn ɓudɛzu la, wo lɔ Kanaan yooi zu, <verse eid="NUM 33:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 33:52"/>wa zooi zu nuiti kpein kpɛ luɠɔ, wo ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ ganigiti kpein koloɠolo, ti ti ɓɛtɛai ga kɔtui, wo ta-vololibaiti kpein koloɠolo, ti ɓɛtɛai ga kɔlui gaawuungai, wo ta-zalaɠa ɠula adaʋɛti kpein koloɠolo. <verse eid="NUM 33:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 33:53"/>Wa zooi zeɠe ga wɔnɔ, wo zei ná, mazɔlɔɔ gè zooi vea wo ya, é ɠɛ ga wɔnɔ. <verse eid="NUM 33:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 33:54"/>Wa zooi ɠaaɠwɛ ʋa, wa kɛ ga kpakutoomai, eɠɛʋelei wa-wolodamaiti ti la. Niiti ti mɔinɗai, wa ta-yooi wɔɔlɔ, wo fe ti ya, niiti ti la mɔinni, wa ta-yooi ve ti ya, kɛlɛ gola mina wɔɔlɔ. Ɛsɛ ka naa zɔlɔɔ, nii a ve zea ga kpakutoomai, wa ti zeɠe ga wɔnɔ, eɠɛʋelei wo-ɠɛɛni ta-wolodamaiti ti la. <verse eid="NUM 33:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 33:55"/>Kɛlɛ ni wo la zooi zu nuiti kpɛɛni luɠɔ, ti zaama, niiti wa ti yɛ ná, ta ɠɛɛzu ga ɠaingi, ti ɗa ʋu wo-ɠaazuʋɛti, ta ani ɠaazoɓagiti ti ɗa wo-ɠo kakamaʋɛti kpota, ta ɠɛ ga wo zili nuiti zooi naa zu, ʋɛ wo ʋaazu zeizu ná. <verse eid="NUM 33:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 33:56"/>Názu ɠa nà wo zo da, eɠɛʋelei gè deveni la ga gè ti zo da.»<verse eid="NUM 33:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="NUM 34"/>
  <para style="s">Kanaan yooi ma ɠwɛpelegiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 34:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 34:2"/>«Devei nii ve Izilayɛle nuiti zea, è ɠɛ ti ma: Siɛgi zu wo ʋaazu lɛɛzu la Kanaan yooi zu, wɛlɛ zooi ʋa, nii é ʋaazu veezu wo ya ga wɔnɔ, Kanaan yooi, é ʋɛɛ ná-kwɛpelegiti ba. <verse eid="NUM 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 34:3"/>Lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazuʋɛ, wa-you ɠwɛgi lɔɔ ɠa zei Sin teʋebai zu, é lɛ ga Edɔme yooi zakpai. Folo ɠulazu ʋelei, wo-ɠwɛgi sogai lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazuʋɛ, naa ɠa liizu, é lo Kpoloɗɛ Wanai ʋa, <verse eid="NUM 34:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 34:4"/>wo-ɠwɛgi zu ɠa ɓilisu gize yɔɠɔzuʋɛ Akelaɓime, lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazuʋɛ, é leʋe ga Sin ʋele, é zeeli Kadɛse-Ɓaaleneya, lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazuʋɛ. É li ga Ɠasaal-Adaal ʋele, é leʋe ga Asamon ʋele, <verse eid="NUM 34:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 34:5"/>é zo Asamon, é lati, é li, é zeeli Ezipete ɠɔtuɗɛi ma, é ʋilɛ Kpoloɗɛ Wolai ʋa.<verse eid="NUM 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 34:6"/>«Wa-ɠwɛpelemaʋɛ é folo liizu ʋelei, naa ɠa ɠɛ ga Kpoloɗɛ Wolai.<verse eid="NUM 34:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 34:7"/>«Wɛlɛ nii é ɠɛɛzu ga wa-ɠwɛpelemaʋɛ lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ, é zo Kpoloɗɛ Wolai ma, wa kwɛgi la, eyɛsu é zeeli Ɠɔɔl gizei ma. <verse eid="NUM 34:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 34:8"/>Wa ɠwɛgi la, é zo Ɠɔɔl gizei ma, é li Leɓo-Ɠamate, é ʋilɛ Sedade ʋa, <verse eid="NUM 34:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 34:9"/>é zo miná, é li ga Zifelon ʋele, é li, é ʋilɛ Ɠasaal-Enan ʋa. Lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋele ɠwɛpelegi ɠana.<verse eid="NUM 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 34:10"/>«Wa ɠwɛpelemaʋɛ leʋe ba folo ɠulazu ʋelei, é zo Ɠasaal-Enan, é li Sefame ʋele, <verse eid="NUM 34:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 34:11"/>é zo miná, é yei Liɓila, Ayɛn folo ɠulazu ʋelei, kwɛpelemaʋɛ ɠa yeizu, é ʋilɛ Kinelɛte ɓoloɗɛi ʋa, folo ɠulazu ʋelei, <verse eid="NUM 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 34:12"/>é yei mɔnɔ ga ziɛ wolai Zuludɛn, é ʋilɛ Kpoloɗɛ Wanai ʋa. Wa-yooi ɠwɛgiti kana.»<verse eid="NUM 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 34:13"/>Moize Izilayɛle nuiti kalani ga niima vaiti, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Zooi ɠana nii wo ʋaazu gaaɠwɛɛzu ga kpakutoomai, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI devea ga é ve boloda taaʋuugɔi ta ma lukpɛgi ya. <verse eid="NUM 34:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 34:14"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Luɓɛn nuiti ta-wolodamaiti, eɠɛʋelei ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti ti la, ti ta-yooiti seɠea, ta Gade nuiti ta-wolodamaiti ɓalaa, eɠɛʋelei ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti ti la, Manasé ná-bolodai ɠilazuʋɛ ɓalaagi ná-zooi zeɠea. <verse eid="NUM 34:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 34:15"/>Boloda felegɔi naati ta boloda lukpɛgi, ti tɔnɔi zeɠea Zuludɛn ʋoluʋelei, Zeliko letemaʋɛ, folo ɠulazu ʋelei.»<verse eid="NUM 34:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Seikpasui é lo <optbreak/> zooi ɠaaɠwɛɛ vai ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 34:16"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 34:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 34:17"/>«Wɛlɛ zunuiti daaseigiti ba, ti ʋaazu zooi ɠaaɠwɛɛzu wo yɔɠɔzu: zalaɠa ɠula nui Eleazaal, ta Nun ná-doun zunui é ga Zozuwe. <verse eid="NUM 34:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 34:18"/>Wa bolodama ɠundiɠii ɠilagilagi zeɠe ga ti zooi ɠaaɠwɛ. <verse eid="NUM 34:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 34:19"/>Naama zunuiti daaseigiti ta ga:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NUM 34:19">Zuda ná-bolodai zu, Yefuné ná-doun zunui Kalɛɓe,<verse eid="NUM 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 34:20"/>Simiyɔn nɔnɔi, Amiyude ná-doun zunui Samiyɛle,<verse eid="NUM 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 34:21"/>Ɓɛnzamɛn nɔnɔi, Kisilon ná-doun zunui Elidade,<verse eid="NUM 34:21"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 34:22"/>Dan nɔnɔi, Yogeli ná-doun zunui Ɓuki é ga kundiɠii,<verse eid="NUM 34:22"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 34:23"/>Zozɛfe mavofodaiti su,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NUM 34:23">Manasé nɔnɔi, kundiɠii Ɠaniyɛle, Efode ná-doun zunui,<verse eid="NUM 34:23"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 34:24"/>Efelayime nɔnɔi, kundiɠii Kemuwɛle, Sifitan ná-doun zunui,<verse eid="NUM 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 34:25"/>Zaɓulɔn nɔnɔi, kundiɠii Elisafan, Paalenake ná-doun zunui,<verse eid="NUM 34:25"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 34:26"/>Isakaal nɔnɔi, kundiɠii Paletiyɛle, Azan ná-doun zunui,<verse eid="NUM 34:26"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 34:27"/>Asɛɛl nɔnɔi, kundiɠii Ayiyude, Selɔmi ná-doun zunui,<verse eid="NUM 34:27"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 34:28"/>Nɛfɛtali nɔnɔi, kundiɠii Pedaɠɛle, Amiyude ná-doun zunui.»<verse eid="NUM 34:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 34:29"/>Naati ka Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI devei veeni ti ya, ga ti Kanaan yooi ɠaaɠwɛ Izilayɛle nuiti zɔɠɔzu.<verse eid="NUM 34:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="NUM 35"/>
  <para style="s">Levi nuiti ta-laaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 35:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, Moaɓe nɛmɛiti su, Zuludɛn ɠobaʋɛ, Zeliko letemaʋɛ. <verse eid="NUM 35:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 35:2"/>É ɠɛni ma: «Devei ve Izilayɛle nuiti zea, ga ti va bu, ti taai tanigaa ve Levi nuiti zea ta-yooi zu, nii ti sɔlɔɔgai ga tɔnɔ, ʋɛti ta zoo ti zei náti. Wa náti maaɠooliiti fe Levi nuiti zea. <verse eid="NUM 35:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 35:3"/>Naama laaiti ta ɠɛ ga ti-zeizuʋɛ. Ti-maaɠooliiti su ɠɛ ga ta-logani losuʋɛti, ti-yeaɠɔligiti ti ɠɛ ná, ta ta-logani ɓulugiti. <verse eid="NUM 35:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 35:4"/>Taaiti maaɠooliiti su, niiti wo ti veezu Levi nuiti zea, zooi ɠa ɠɛ ba, é ɠaku ma ga mɛtɛlɛ undɔɔlugɔ (500), é tɔɔzei siɠigiti ma, é li poluʋelei maaɠoolii kpein su. <verse eid="NUM 35:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 35:5"/>Wa kɔɠɔ, wo kwɛgi la taa ʋoluʋelei, ga mɛtɛlɛ waagila (1.000), é ɠaku ma kpoloo, taai ɠa ɠɛ zaamazuʋɛ. Ʋele ɠana zooi a ɠɛ la, ta-laaiti maaɠoolii zu. <verse eid="NUM 35:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 35:6"/>Wa yeelo taa lɔzita ʋa, wo fe Levi nuiti bɛ, ti ɠɛ ga maaʋela wosuʋɛ, nui niiti ti nu ʋaazu, ti la gaaɠilini ma, ta zoo ti ʋela, ti li ná, é ʋɛɛ taa ʋuunaanigɔ maazu felegɔ (42) ɠiligaa ʋa. <verse eid="NUM 35:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 35:7"/>Taaiti wo ʋaazu ti veezu Levi nuiti bɛ, tiegɔi ɠa ɠɛ ga puunaanigɔ maazu lɔsaʋa (48), é ʋɛɛ ti-maaɠoolii ma yooiti ba, ti ɠilagilagi pɛ. <verse eid="NUM 35:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 35:8"/>Taaiti wo ʋaazu ti zeɠezu Izilayɛle nuiti ta-yooiti su, mɔinɗa ɠa ɠula naati zea, niiti gola ti ya, tago nɔ ɠa a ɠula naati zea, niiti é la mɔinni ti ya. Bolodai ɠilagilagi ɠa ná-taai ta ve Levi nuiti bɛ, eɠɛʋelei a zoloo da sɔlɔɔgi ma, é ʋaazu bosu.»<verse eid="NUM 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maaʋela laaiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 4:41-43">Tɔ Sɛʋɛi Velesiɛi 4:41-43</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="DEU 19:1-13">19:1-13</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="JOS 20:1-9">Zozuwe 20:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 35:9"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="NUM 35:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 35:10"/>«Ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ, è ɠɛ ti ma: Siɛgi zu wo Zuludɛn ɓudɛzu la, wo lɛ Kanaan yooi zu, <verse eid="NUM 35:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 35:11"/>wa yeelo taai tanigaani ba, ta ɠɛ wo ʋɛ ga maaʋela laaiti, ni nu a nu ʋaana, é la gaaɠilini ma, é ʋela, é li ná. <verse eid="NUM 35:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 35:12"/>Naama laaiti ta ɠɛ wo ʋɛ ga maaʋela laaiti, ɲamai ʋotokula nui ʋa, naa ɠa a kɛ nu ʋaa nui mina za, aisa é ʋa ɠula kɛlɛma nuɓusɛiti gaazu, ná-tukpɔi ɠaa ʋa leʋe. <verse eid="NUM 35:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 35:13"/>Wa yeelo taa lɔzita ʋa, ti ɠɛ ga maaʋela laaiti, <verse eid="NUM 35:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 35:14"/>wa taa saʋagɔ ve Zuludɛn ʋoluʋelei, wo taa saʋagɔ ve Kanaan yooi zu. Naati ta ɠɛɛzu ga maaʋela laaiti. <verse eid="NUM 35:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 35:15"/>Naama laa lɔzitaiti ta ɠɛɛzu ga maaʋela laaiti Izilayɛle nuiti bɛ, ta wɛɛinti, naa ʋɛɛ seikɔɠɔma nuiti ba, nu-o-nu nii a nu ʋaana, é la gaaɠilini ma, miná ɠa a ʋela, é li ná.<verse eid="NUM 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 35:16"/>«Ni zunui ta a seiɲɔɠɔi loɠana ga kɔlu ani, naa za, toɠa ga nu ʋaa nu. Ta nu ʋaa nui naa ʋaa. <verse eid="NUM 35:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 35:17"/>Ni a sɔɔna ga kɔtu, naa za, toɠa ga nu ʋaa nu. Ta nu ʋaa nui naa ʋaa. <verse eid="NUM 35:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 35:18"/>Ni a doɠana ga gulu, naa za, toɠa ga nu ʋaa nu. Ta nu ʋaa nui naa ʋaa. <verse eid="NUM 35:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 35:19"/>Ɲamai ʋotokula nui ɠa nu ʋaa nui naa ʋaa, siɛgi zu é maazɔlɔɔsu da. <verse eid="NUM 35:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 35:20"/>Ni zunui ta a zɔɔna seiɲɔɠɔi ʋa ga wɔinzeɠemai, ɓaa é ani zeɠe, é pili ma ga kisiɛ ɲɔi, saa vaa ɠula su, <verse eid="NUM 35:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 35:21"/>ɓaa ni a doɠana ga yeei, sili vaa zu, saa vaa ɠula su, toɠa ga nu ʋaa nu, ta paa. Ɲamai ʋotokula nui naa ɠa nu ʋaa nui naa ʋaa, siɛgi zu é yeezeelizu la ma.<verse eid="NUM 35:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 35:22"/>«Kɛlɛ ni zunui ta a zɔɔna seiɲɔɠɔi ʋa, é la gaaɠilini ma, é la daani ɠisu, ɓaa é anii ta ʋili ma, é la daani ɠisu, <verse eid="NUM 35:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 35:23"/>ɓaa é la naa ɠaazu, eyɛsu é kɔtui loo ma, naa ʋolu ɠɛ ga saai, é la ga siliɲɔɠɔ, é la faa ɲɔu ɓɛtɛzu daalɔɠɔma, <verse eid="NUM 35:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 35:24"/>nuɓusɛiti ta tukpɔɠaaleʋe, é zoloo tɔgi ma, nu ʋaa nui ta ɲamai ʋotokula nuiti zɔɠɔzu. <verse eid="NUM 35:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 35:25"/>Nuɓusɛiti ta nu ʋaa nui ɠizo, ti kula ɲamai ʋotokula nui ya. Nuɓusɛiti ta gaaɠale ma maaʋela laai zu, ʋɛ pelaai, é li ná. Toɠa yɛ ná eyɛsu zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai, nii gulɔ ɲadegai ziaai ma, naa za.<verse eid="NUM 35:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 35:26"/>«Ni nu ʋaa nui a ɓudɛna maaʋela laai ma ɠwɛgiti maazu, ʋɛ pelaai, é li ná, <verse eid="NUM 35:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 35:27"/>ni ta ɠomina ta ɲamai ʋotokula nui taa ʋoluʋɛ, naa paa, é la ɠɛa ga sɔba nu, nu ʋaa vaa zu. <verse eid="NUM 35:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 35:28"/>Mazɔlɔɔ, nu ʋaa nui maanɛɛʋɛ, é yɛ maaʋela laai zu, eyɛsu zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai za. Zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai zaa ʋoluma, nu ʋaa nui ɠa zoo é ɠale ma ná-poganii unda.<verse eid="NUM 35:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 35:29"/>«Deveiti kana wo ma vaa zu, wo-mavofodaiti kpein su, ʋɛ nɔpɛ wa zei ná. <verse eid="NUM 35:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 35:30"/>Ni nui ta a nu loɠana, é za, ta nu ʋaa nui ʋaa, zeeleiti gooi ma. Kɛlɛ zeele ɠila ge la kula ɠɛa, peelalai ʋa ve nui ya ga ti paa.<verse eid="NUM 35:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 35:31"/>«À mina yeezei walii wu, nu ʋaa nui yɛnvui vaa zu, nii maanɛai ga é za, mazɔlɔɔ kɛni ti naama nui ʋaa. <verse eid="NUM 35:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 35:32"/>À mina yeezei walii wu, wo ʋa pelei ve zea, é ʋa ɠula maaʋela laai ʋa, é ʋa ɠale ma ná-zooi zu, aisa zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai ʋa za. <verse eid="NUM 35:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 35:33"/>À mina zooi ɠɔzɔ, ʋɛ wo ʋaazu zeizu ná, mazɔlɔɔ ɲamai ɠa ɗa zooi ɠɔzɔ. Koto gba vaa la ɠɛa ɲamai ná-faa zu nii puai, kɛni naama nui ɲamai, nii é ɲamai ʋuai. <verse eid="NUM 35:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 35:34"/>Wo la zooi naa ɠɔzɔa, ʋɛ wo ʋaazu zeizu ná, ʋɛ nà ɓalaagi gè ʋaazu zeizu ná, mazɔlɔɔ nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nii é zeini Izilayɛle nuiti saama.»<verse eid="NUM 35:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="NUM 36"/>
  <para style="s">Tɔgi é lo <optbreak/> pɛlɛyeɠeiti ta-you vaiti ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 36:1"/>Pɛlɛyeɠe ɠundiɠiiti ti ɠulaai Galaade ná-bolodai zu, Makiil ná-doun zunui, Manasé ná-doun zunui, Zozɛfe ná-doun zunuiti ta-wolodamaiti saama, ti ʋaani Moize ʋɔ bɛ, ti ɓɔɛ pɔ, ta Izilayɛle nuiti ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠe ɠundiɠiiti, <verse eid="NUM 36:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 36:2"/>ti ɠɛ ti ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI devei veeni màliɠii ya, ga é zooi ɠaaɠwɛ Izilayɛle nuiti ba ga kpakutoomai. Naa ʋoluma, màliɠii devei zɔlɔɔni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ya, ga é gi-ɠɛɛloin Selofeɠade ná-poganii ve ná-doun anzanuiti zea. <verse eid="NUM 36:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 36:3"/>Ni ta vuluna Izilayɛle nuiti ta-wolodamai taɠili ma, ta-ʋoganii ɠa zeɠe gi-mɛmɛwolani ta-ʋoganii ʋa, é ʋɛɛ bolodai naa, ná-poganii ʋa, nii ti ɠiliai ba, naa maaʋele ma, ta ɠa ɠulazu poganii la, nii gaaɠwɛai gi ʋa ga kpakutoomai. <verse eid="NUM 36:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 36:4"/>Ɓɔɠɔyeema ɠonagi a zeelina Izilayɛle nuiti bɛ, ta-ʋoganii ɠa ʋɛɛ bolodai naa nɔnɔi ʋa, nii ti ɠilizu ba, toɠa zeɠe gá-wolodai nɔnɔ ma gelei ʋa.»<verse eid="NUM 36:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 36:5"/>Moize Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-deveiti daazeelini Izilayɛle nuiti ma, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Zozɛfe mavofodaiti ta-wolodai ɠa gaamai wosu. <verse eid="NUM 36:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 36:6"/>Pɛtɛ nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI deveai Selofeɠade ná-doun anzanuiti ma: Ta zei naama nuiti bɛ, niiti ta ɠɛ ti ʋɔ, ni nɔ ta zei ti-ɠɛɛni ta-wolodai zu. <verse eid="NUM 36:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 36:7"/>Izilayɛle yooi zu, poganii tanɔpɛ ge la ɠulaa bolodai ta zu, é ʋa li bolodai zɔi zu, kɛlɛ Izilayɛle nui ɠilagilagi ɠa ɠili kɛɛɠɛni ta-wolodai ma ʋoganii ʋa. <verse eid="NUM 36:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 36:8"/>Anzanu loin ɠilagilagi kpein poganii a ɠɛ zea, Izilayɛle nuiti ta-wolodaiti su, kɛni naa zei zini bɛ, kɛɛɠɛ ná-bolodai zu, naa ɠa a kɛ Izilayɛle nuiti gilagilagiti ti ti-mɛmɛwolani ta-ʋoganii zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="NUM 36:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 36:9"/>Poganii tanɔpɛ ge la ɠulaa bolodai ta ʋa, é ʋa li bolodai taɠili su, kɛlɛ Izilayɛle nuiti ta-wolodaiti ta ɠili ti ɠilagilagi ta-ʋoganii ʋa.»<verse eid="NUM 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 36:10"/>Selofeɠade ná-doun anzanuiti ti kɛɛni, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni la Moize ya. <verse eid="NUM 36:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 36:11"/>Selofeɠade ná-doun anzanuiti ti ga Maala, Tiilesa, Wogela, Milika ta Noa, ti zeini ti-ɠɛɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi ti-loun zunuiti bɛ, <verse eid="NUM 36:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 36:12"/>ti zeini Zozɛfe ná-doun zunui Manasé mavofodaiti bɛ, ta-ʋoganiiti ti yɛni ti-ɠɛɛni ta-wolodai zu.<verse eid="NUM 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 36:13"/>Deveiti ta tɔgiti kana, niiti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI feeni Izilayɛle nuiti zea, ga Moize maaʋele, Moaɓe nɛmɛi zu, Zuludɛn ɠobaʋɛ, Zeliko letemaʋɛ.<verse eid="NUM 36:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 36"/>
</usx>
